<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Onobasulu Original (2010 Onobasulu translation team Wabele, Joseph, Jack, Yobe, and Beverly)</book>
  <para style="h">Lugu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Awalu Sulu Nafulu Luguhe Selelu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lugu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lug</para>
  <para style="mt2">Awalu Sulu Nafulu</para>
  <para style="mt">Luguhe Selelu</para>
  <para style="rem">Anne made notes and made parallel with parallel passages.</para>
  <para style="rem">Anne did final advisor check with Joseph and Yobe in Ukarumpa, January 2013, and subsequently another complete read through with all 4 translators in Walagu, Feb 2013.</para>
  <para style="rem">More editing changes made together with Yobe and Joseph, March 2015</para>
  <para style="rem">October 2016 Consultant check with Howard Oates, Beverly. Joseph and Dickson Wagada, Cedrick Jack, Felix</para>
  <para style="rem">March and June 2017 Recorded for audio with final corrections</para>
  <para style="rem">Made ready for typesetting with last input from Joseph and Yobe on ‘commas’ plus pictures by Antonia and Johann Alberts</para>
  <para style="rem">Final team read through with Wabele and Osa and Anne in Ukarumpa, March 2023</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Awalu sulu nafulu Luguhe selelu ewe, nini alegasiamo, Yesuhe Isolaele idele inoloda, mosomu nolobalo idele inoloda, gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulububa bosolu. Yesuhe Ene dabalu maugaba moloyone hamefia, Ehe idele inolo ilifea eweguba solu. “Godene sulu nafulumo weagulu inolo ilifea saaba memesine, Asubane Noekenehe Na hilibailu.” (Lugu 4.18 ami bamale.) Amo seale koleba. Bugo Lugu ewemo, sadalu wedinale awalu dobu. Yesuhe idele inolo higiniluda nonoba sesalibu ili amone yagunagafia, Ehe mana nafulu ilifea mololu amone wedinale awalu dobu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kegele Yesuhe mololumo, Ene mosomuhe Efea koleba henemesi mololu. Maliahe E seba dife fogomo, idele inolo henelu. (Lugu 1.42-48, aufia 2.10 ami bamale.) Aufia, bugo ewe samodosiamo, Yesu E hebene lago aasimo, ili aso henefiasu alolu. (Lugu 24.52 ami bamale.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Kegele wedinale, Yesu E helefealu iwi ligia mololumo, Lugu elebisu awalu. Bugo noolomo kegele amone sulu seleba ufuluale dobu. Kegele wedinale Yesuda seba duluiya fogo ami holobagalu amone sadalumo, Lugu e-su awalu dobu. Besi sulu noolomo, Lugu e-su selelu dobu. Samalia inolone besi suluda, aufia faibe enao gadefia daalumone besi sulu amoda, aufia besi sulu noolo amoda, Lugu e-su seleba walelu. Dagese dilo Sakiesefea mololu amone awalu amoda, Lugu e-su selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kegele nooloda, Lugu ehe wedinale solu dobu amo, Godedai kiwigaaba sulu saeyo mana amoda, aufia Asubane Noekenene dabalu amoda, aufia mana Godehe idele inolone wolu heesia galiloda, wedinale solu dobu. Idele ilihe dabalu wedinale mololu amoda, Luguhe sulu wedinale solu dobu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lugu ehe bugo ewesu seleluale. Aubale. Ehe bugo noda selelu, amo Hilibaisi Daalu bugo.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0">Separator Artwork -- Waves</figure></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Luguhe sadalu ewe Diofilusufea seleba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1-4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1-4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:1">HD 1.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wae, Diofilusu, inolo wida ga, na, Lugu, gafea seleba mesu ewe. Inolo wedinalehe, kegele sunia Godehe nini aleba moloba yaalu amone, gagaiyoba awasia, seleba ufiyo weiyaalu. Ili Godene sulu amone dabalu mololo inolo ligia, kegele holobagagasi, kegele sunia ine si abulu amone, ninifea hamagane awaba melu dobiyo. Na ili auba molofeba bafasia, na hilisesia, nene nada, kegele holobagalu amo, nafuluba isasenagada, kegele maugaiyafia muluguba kuliba abia, nafuluba gedeba seleba mesenagada, amo nafulu koleba. Aulune, ga bugo ewe alegasiamo, eweguba nafuluba fadaba asigimale. Sulu bugo ewene usu selelu dobu amofea alefasia, kegele holobagaluba selesi, ga dubulu amomo, seale koleba holobagalububa hilisemale.<verse eid="LUK 1:1-4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yone seba diyobafeba sulu saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodo</char> e Yudiane kini labi fogomo, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> uleno alolumo, ene wimo, Sekalaea. E-mo, Abiya mosomu amone, soba melo ulenomo, e alolu. Ene eamono Elisabede amo, <char style="w" lemma="Alono">Alonone</char> saladegelufia mulu. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Aalifaba Godene si saabiamo <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> koleba alolu. Aalifaba <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> sulu muguli suniada, Ene molomalelu sulu suniada, kuliba anone, aaluhe Ene si saabiamo heleba daaluda male koleba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Auluso, Elisabede e saune alolune, aalu faibeda male ligia, hagolu alolu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Hilia uleno, Sekalaea ene mosomumo soba melo dabalu moloyone fogo iminilu holobagasi, Sekalaea eda Godene si saabia soba meyone dabalu moloyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:7">Kis 30.7</ref></char></note>Soba meyone mosomu aleba ami, abehe Saminilone <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molosu</char> sugafia, kasineda soba meyobafelaba eloba babiyone, ilihe ine mana kuliba abia, sadu dailu. Sadu dailu amofea alefasia, Sekalaea molobebelelu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sadu dailo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mana ewe mole diyone dailale. Aubale. Soba melo ilihe inolo dabaluda moloyodolu amone iminiyone dailo.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Aufia, e molo usu sugafia ligia, kasineda nafulu soba meba labi fogomo, idele inolo wedinale Godene sebele molosu egeisa lagi gagaiyofia, Godedai sulu selesia waalelu.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ausi, e soba meba ligia, bosolufalumo, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Saminilone sulu dia ano</char> uleno e labea holobagasi abulu. E kasineda subiyone defene olabolu amone inaloafealomo ami yoba labi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sekalaeahe sulu dia anomo bisigia, e wobasubale hidigifia sagililu. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Auluso, sulu dia anohe Sekalaeafea selesia, “Ga sagilimabu. Ga <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selabasu</char> alolumo, E dubulu. Doma. Ge geamono Elisabedehe inolo faibe seba diyobafe. Inolo faibe amone, gahe wi ofelesiamo, ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yoneba</char> homale. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ausi, aine libo nafulu adesi, aali nokene heneyobafe. Dufia, faibe amo seba difeyamo, idele inolo wedinalemo heneyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:2-3">Nam 6.2-3</ref></char></note>Enebamo, e-mo Saminilone si saabiamo wida bule koleba miliyobafe. E-mo <char style="w">waini</char> hanoda, kagoalo hano nooloda, naiyobafale. E aso enae libo galinofea hamagifia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenehe</char> efea wasigaalu miliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" /><char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo wedinalemo, ehe Saminilo ine Gode labea lubia obegeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />E-mo Elaiyane kiwigagaluda, ene manada, difasia, Saminilofealo saminiba maiyobafe. Aufia, ehe enaodalida, enaedalida, ilimo, ine faibilidai hilise ule homesi moloyobafe. Aufia, ehe, inolo Godene suluda saidafolo ilimo, asigi nafulu isolu galagololu inolo ofologuba homesi isoyobafe. Saminilo milesi, ehe idele inolo madeneba ufiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Godene sulu dia ano auba selesi, Sekalaeahe efea obegeba selesia, “Ga sulu selefe ogo, sealebuba halaguba na hiliseyobi? Na hagolugulu, ne idoda hagolu koleba saabe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8.16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9.21</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, sulu dia anohe efea obegeba selesia, “Ne wi Gebilielo. Na Godene olegia adone, E alefasia na hilibaisi, sulu nafulu ewe gafea saeyone dia mulu. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Aulune, doma! Ga aga ne sulu sigiba dubulualene, agamo ge mofeyo kaasi, ga sulu saeyobafale. Ga sulu saabale ligiasu, kegele Gode saaba ufulumo holobagafe hilia ami eloyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Auba moloba labi, idele inolo egeisa yasifia alebailumo, hiliseba yaasia, Sekalaea inigiale, fogo selale sebele molo usu labe ewe, enesi aufebiba yasisia, keleba hilisesia waalelu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />E baea holobagasiamo, ehe ilifea sulu saeyodoluale alolu. Aulune, ili hilisesia, ehe Godene sebele molo usu ami halaga no abulububa hiliselu. Ehe ilifea eloba bamesi, sone dedeba moloba walesiaso, e sulu selesiale, mofe kaafiasu alolu.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Sekalaea e sebele moloa ami dabalu moloyoguba moloba samodofasia, dufia ene moloa obegeba daalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ami goafia yoba saabi, ene eamono Elisabedemo faibe aselesi abulu. Amo baafia, Elisabede aube biamo muguba asulu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Auba sigia, e selesia, “Saminilohe nafea kanuluba ofeleso. Ehe kegele nafea mololu dobu ewefea alefasia, idele inolone si saabia na yualumone diba dafeleso.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene sulu dia anohe Maliafea selesia, Yesu seba diyobafeba saaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ausi, Elisabede faibe asulumo aube kaabe adesi, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilone sulu dia ano">Ene sulu dia ano</char> Gebilielomo Nasalede dauno Galili helea ami hilibailu. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:16">Mad 1.16</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 1:18">18</ref></char></note>Gebilielo abia, ido buda uleno labea daalu. Ido amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> saladegelu alolune, inolo uleno wi <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebefea</char> saaba melu asulu. Ido buda amone wimo, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Malia</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Gebilielo e Malia labea goasia, selesia, “Hilia nafulu! Godehe gafea koleba ediliba ofelesia, gafea nafuluba ofelefe. Saminilo gadai labe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maliahe sulu amo hidigifia dabagalaba dobelesia, e hilisesia, “Sulu ewe halaguba selefebi?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia anohe</char> efea selesia, “Malia, ga sagilimabu. Gode ga koleba hamefe. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Ais 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:21-23">Mad 1.21-23</ref></char></note>Ga faibe asefasia, inolo faibe uleno seba diyobafe. Ene wimo, Yesuba homale. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2Sml 7.12-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Ais 9.7</ref></char></note>E-mo inolo wida koleba labi, ilihe E Gode Ana Labe Lagone Faibeba saeyobafe. Aufia, Godehe E-mo enauwa Deibidine asefalu ailalu saabia ami mesayobafe. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Aufia, E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> mosomu amone kini yasifia ligia, alefalu miliyobafe. Aufia, Ene kini dabalu molofe amo eloyobafale.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Auba selesi dofasia, Maliahe sulu dia anofea doba bisigia, “Na aso inolodai haneluale lolune, ewego eneba moloyobafebi?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Auba selesi, Godene sulu dia anohe obegeba selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> ga labea saabi, Gode Ana Labe Lagone kiwigagaluhe ga-mo gasiaguyobafe. Ausi, faibe gafea aselefe ogomo, Godene noekene inolo miliyobafe. Aulugulu, ilihe E-mo Godene faibeba saeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Doma, gesago Elisabedemo hagolu kolebaso, agamo inolo faibe saabe. Samini e sauneba sodoso, aga e faibe sigia aube kaabeba samodofe. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Stt 18.14</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godehe kegele uleno moloyodoluale male.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Malia obegeba selesia, “Na Saminilone dabalu mololo ido. Aulugulu, ga selefeguba nafea waagi molomesi.” Auba selesi, sulu dia anohe e gadefia daalu.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliahe Elisabede wakaliyo daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Fogo hamagaiyamo, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Malia</char> e alebale degefia, madenefia, hele galea Yudia disiligifealomo abia, dauno Sekalaeada, Elisabededa, aaluda saabea ami maiyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Aufia, e ami goafia, Sekalaeane molosu sugafia, Elisabede wakalilu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elisabedehe Malia sulu selefe amo dobelesi, faibe subobo ene libo asulumo dulubalu. Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> Elisabedefea wasigaalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ausi, Elisabede koleba selesia, “Godehe gafea nafuluba koleba moloba ofelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">edililo</char> melu dobu ogomo, idele suniafea edililo melumo, wasolu dobu. Ausi, faibe subobo ga libo saabe ogoda, Godene edililo dife. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Auluso, na halagulune, ne Saminilone enae ewe na labea saabebi? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Gahe sulu nafea selefe ogone dobelesia, faibe ne libo saabe ewemo, e henesia dulubaso. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ga-mo, sulu Saminilohe gafea saaba ufulu amo, E seale moloyobafeba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulune</char>, Ehe ga <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba</char> ofelefe.” Elisabede auba solu.<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Maliane Gasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1Sml 2.1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Malia</char> selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 1:46" />
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ne libohe Saminilone wi digisu.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Godehe na Gasiba Dafelagoba Dilo labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:47">Ne asubanehe Efea nokene henefe.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Maumo, na Ene dabalu mololo ido labi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:48">Ehe na helea labemo baafia, na kanuluba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:48">Aga iwifia, idele inolo saladegelu aselabia maiyobafe ili amo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:48">sunia selesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:48">Godehe nafea bule <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba</char> ufuluba saeyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Gode kiwigagaluda Ehe kegele bule koleba nafea mololu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:49">Aufia, Ene wimo <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene muuba kalilu</char> labe.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:13">Sng 103.13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 103:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo E baaba sagilifia, E sisa labe ili amofea,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:50">Ehe kanuluba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:50">Ehe ilifea auba kanuluba ofolabasu labi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:50">ili saladegelu aselabia dedaleba miliyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:28">2Sml 22.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ene sonehe dabalu kolelu mololo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:51">Inolo noolo hilisesia, ilisu olaibo loluba bamabamasia hiliseba yaafemo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:51">Ehe ili asigaba dafaliba yaalo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:19">Jop 12.19</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:11">5.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:6">Sng 147.6</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, kini kiwigagaluda ine ailalu saabia kakainabia amifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:52">Ehe ili sigiba dafaliba ilogoba yaalo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:52">Auluso, inolo widale helea alebaibumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:52">Ehe ana digiba yaalo.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.53 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:10">Sng 34.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe kegele nafulu wedinalemo, mamiafe inolo ilifea meba yaasi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:53">ili kubaleba yaalo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:53">Auluso, inolo kegele wedinaleda waalebumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:53">Godehe ili balu dedaleba yaamalo.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="54-55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54-55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.54-55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 7:20">Mai 7.20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Stt 17.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:3">Sng 98.3</ref></char>
    </note>Ehe Ene dabalu mololo inolo <char style="w">Isolaele</char> sagoba ofolo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Aufia, Ehe nine nauwadalifea oloba huliale sulu solumo</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:54-55">asigi gagaba ado.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Oloba huliale sulu eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamadai</char>, ene saladegelu dufia aselabia maiyobafe amonedai,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:54-55">aso hilisesia, kanulufiasu alefalu miliyobafe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:54-55" />
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Malia e gasa auba olabolu.<verse eid="LUK 1:54-55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia e Elisabededai aube osoloa labeofia, aufia ene moloa obegeba daalu.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <para style="s">Elisabedehe Hano Gelo Yone seba dulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Elisabede e faibe haseyo hilia holobagasi, ehe inolo faibe seba dulu. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Elisabede ene mosomudali, ene damenedalimo, Saminilohe efea bule koleba kanuluba ufuluba solu dobelesia, ilihe e galiba henelu.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.59 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:12">Stt 17.12</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Wkp 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:21">Lug 2.21</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia aaiyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele manamo, inolo faibe seba dulu hilia amifia </char><char style="fq">hilia aaiyo adesi</char>, ene momada bado haisi amaleba gelelo. Amo oloba huliale dabalu Godehe Abalahamadai maugaba mololu amone iminife.</note> adesi, ilihe faibe amone <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba geleyone</char> milibailu. Ilihe ene wimo, enao Sekalaeane wi ufiyo hiliselu. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Auluso, enaehe obegeba selesia, “Aubale! Ene wimo, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> homaba” solu. <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Ilihe Elisabedefea selesia, “Ge mosomudali aleba amimo, wi uleno amogulu male.”<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Aufia, ene enao Sekalaeahe faibemo wi abe ofelefelaba babiyone, ilihe efea sulu sodoguba, sone gagaba mololu. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Ausi, ehe i salilu uleno dia milaba haalisia, sone dedeba mololu. Amo difasia, ehe i amofea, “Ene wi Yoneba” seleba ofelesi, ili sunia keleba hiliseba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Alebale hamagi, ene mofe sogosi, ene eane haiba nafulusi, e sulu selesia, Godene wi digiba solu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Aine damenedalihe, kegele nokene amo molofe baafia, ili sagililu. Aufia, kegele amone mololu sadalumo, Yudia ami hele galefealo kakainalumo sunia doba sigilu. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Idele inolo sunia sulu ewene dobolaba yaasia, selesia, “Seale koleba, Godene sonemo faibe ewedai labeba” solu. Aufia, ilihe e dufia halagulu miliyobafebiba keleba hiliseba yaalu.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <para style="s">Sekalaeane Gasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Fogo ami, faibe Yonene enao, Sekalaeamo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> efea wasigasia, saaba ofa sulu selesia, gasa ewe olabolu. <verse eid="LUK 1:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:18">Sng 72.18</ref></char></note>E selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 1:68" />
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:68">“Ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> Gode nine Saminilofea wi digisu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:68">Maumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:68">E milifasia, idele inolo sagoba ofelesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:68">Ene idele inolo sunia sububa dafelagofe.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.69 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:2">Sng 18.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gode Ehe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:69">ninida <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> dilo inolo kiwigagaluda uleno ninifea melu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:69">Inolo amo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:69">Godene dabalu mololo inolo <char style="w">Deibidi</char> ene saladegelufeafia holobagalu.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Samini Godehe Ene <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolofea alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:70">auba saaba ufulugulu,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:70">agamo sulu ewe seale holobagalu.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.71 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:10">Sng 106.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gisane sonehe ninida seiya amifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:71">Godehe nini gasiba dafelagoba dilo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:71">Ninida gogoloba beaba ada amifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:71">Ehe ninimo sububa dafaliba yaalo.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.72 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Stt 17.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:8-9">Sng 105.8-9</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Oloba huliale dabalu">Oloba huliale sulu</char> noekene</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:72">samini nine nauwadalifea saaba ufulu amone, aso hilisesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:72">Ehe ili kanulufia sagoba ufulu.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.73 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Stt 22.16-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ehe nine nao <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamafea</char> ewene oloba huliale <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba sulu</char> solu.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Gisane sonehe ninida seiya amifia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:74">Ehe nini gasiba dafelagoba diaba yaasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:74">ninihe sagilibale ligia, Ene dabalu molomesi hamefe.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.75 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 2:12-14">Dai 2.12-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E auba hamesia, nini Edai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> ligia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:75">hilia sunia Ene olegia isolu melesi gadefaeyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.76 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Ais 40.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Yone, ne faibe subobo, ga doma.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:76">Dufia, ilihe ga-mo Gode Ana Labe Lagone saaba ofolo inoloba saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:76">Mau enebamo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:76">gahe Saminilo milesi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:76">Ene eno felaba madeneba miliyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="77-78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77-78" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.77-78 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31.34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:1-2">Ais 60.1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, gahe Ene idele inolofea sulu mana walesi,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:77-78">ili hilisesia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:77-78">Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> bulemo alefasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:77-78">Godehe ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> hamasia, heesia galisia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:77-78">ili gasiba dafelagoba obegeba difeba hiliseyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:77-78">Aufia, Ehe hebenene yane bule ninifea neeba doweba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 1:77-78" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.79 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Ais 9.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yane amohe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:79">idele inolo nigiligagalu aleba alebaibumoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:79">olalone hisu sisa alebaibumoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:79">ilifea neeba doweyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:79">Yane amohe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:79">nine emo emelaeyomo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 1:79">
    <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo</char> enomo lubia maiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Dufia, faibe Yone amo, bulefasia, ene asubanefealomo kiwida alolu. Aufia, e hele falaiya ami ligiasu, e Isolaele ilifea ulufaba holobagaeyo hilia adesi, elolu.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Maliahe Yesu seba dulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Madiyu 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Fogo amoyamo, <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisa</char> Ogodasuhe muguli uleno saaba ofa selesia, idele inolo Lomehe yasiba yaabu ili amo sunia, ine wi seleyo dobuba saaba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kuluniusu e hele Silia ami gamane yasilo alolu fogomo, wi seleyone dabalu amo aso selelale alolugulu, aga hamagi maugalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Ausi, gamanehe ine wi selemesine, idele inolo sunia ine mosomu helea dedaleba yaalu.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Aulune, <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebe</char> eda Nasalede dauno Galilifia felafia, Yudia helefealo <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> dauno Bedeleheme ami daalu. Maumo, e kini Deibidine saladegelu mosomu alolune aulu.<verse eid="LUK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Eda, ene ido saaba melu <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliada</char>, aalu ami daalumo, gamanehe aine wida selemesine aulu. Fogo amimo, Malia e faibe asulu daalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Aalu Bedeleheme ami goafia labi, Maliahe faibe haseyo hiliamo holobagalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Aufia, ehe inolo faibe olaibo seba dulu. Ehe faibe seba difasia, fagulo masofia, dofene keao naiyo nolo fofo usu ami, maliba ufulu. Ami ufulumone maumo, sobele hanelo molo ami alolumo, ili haneyone fogo male alolu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus is born" file="IB04102.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="2.6-7">Maliahe Yesu seba dulu.</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene sulu dia anohe dofene sibi yasiba ado ilifea sulu dia mulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Nigiliba amoyamo, dofene sibi yasiba ado noolo mosomu hamagi egeisalo, ine dofene sibi uluba alebailu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Auba alebaifia labi, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Saminilone sulu dia ano</char> ili labea holobagasi, Saminilone <char style="w">elalelu</char> bule suga inigia, ilifea neeba dowesia amaleba galisi, ili hidigisia sagiliba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ausi, sulu dia ano amohe ilifea selesia, “Gili sagilimabu. Doma. Nahe sulu nafulu gilifea dia mulu. Sulu ewe alefasia, idele inolo sunia bule koleba heneyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Aga nigiliba yagi, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> dauno ami, faibe uleno seba dulu. Faibe amohe gili sunia <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyobafe</char>. E Saminilo, E <char style="w">Keliso</char>, Ehe Ene idele inolo gasiba dafelagoba dimesine iminiba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ausi, gili eweguba eloba bamale, faibe amo fagulo masofia, dofene keaone naiyo nolo fofo usu ami maliba dobi, gili babiyobafe.” <figure style="fig" alt="Angel appears to shepherds" file="C055.JPG" size="col" copy="New Tribes" ref="2.8-12">Saminilone sulu dia anohe dofene sibi yasiba ado ilifea sulu dia mulu.</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Alebale hamagi, Godene sulu dia ano wamili noolo, saludiale <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> huga milibaifia, sulu dia ano amodai ligia, ilihe Godene wi eweguba digiba solu. <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:38">Lug 19.38</ref></char></note>Ili selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 2:14" />
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 2:14">“Gode ana labe lagone</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 2:14">koleba wi digisu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 2:14">Ene wi digisu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 2:14">Helefealu iwimo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 2:14">idele inolo</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 2:14">Godehe hamesefe ili amo</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 2:14">
    <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealodai</char> misiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Dofene sibi yasiba ado ilihe Yesu babiyone dedalelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />
    <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ilimo dofene sibi yasiba ado ili gadefia, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi dedalefia labi, ilihe ine geleba selesia, “Wae, Saminilohe ninifea saaba meluguba holobagalulaba Bedeleheme ami bea dedalesu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Aufia, ili alebale dedalefia, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebedai</char>, yoba saabi abulu. Aufia, faibe subobomo dofene keao naiyo nolo fofo usu ami, hanefia labi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ili bafasia, Godene sulu dia anohe ilifea faibe amone saaba meluguba, ami awaba melu.<verse eid="LUK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Ausi, dofene sibi yasiba ado ilihe awaba mefemo dobolaba yaasia, idele inolo ili sunia hidigiba dobelesia, momoleba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:51">Lug 2.51</ref></char></note>Auluso, sulu solu amo sunia, Maliahe ene asigi diba sefia, e hilisefiasu alolu. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Aufia, <char style="w">dofene sibi uluba ado</char> ili obegeba dedalesia, Godene wi digiba selabia dedalelu. Kegele sunia, ili dubulu amoda, abulu amoda, sulu dia anohe ilifea solu amogubasu holobagalubusia, ili Godefea henelu.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lug 1.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Faibe seba dulu amone hilia aaiyo adesi, ilihe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelesia</char>, E Yesuba wi ufulu. E aso enae libo asebale labi, Godene sulu dia anohe wi amone homaleba saaba melu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simionodai Anadaihe Yesu sebele moloa abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:1-8">Wkp 12.1-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yosebedai, Maliadai, aalumo <char style="w">Mosese</char> sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> saaba ufuluguba kuliba abia, Godene si saabia galagololu miliyo amone hilia holobagasi, aaluhe faibemo Saminilofea meyone, Yelusalame ami ulubia daalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kis 13.2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Saminilone sulu muguli eweguba saaba dobu. <char style="qt">Inolo faibe olaibo suniamo, Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">muuba kalilu noekene</char> melesi, gilihe ili amo Saminilofea memale.</char> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Wkp 12.8</ref></char></note>Saminilohe saaba ufuluguba, aaluhe haga aida soba memesine dia daalu. <char style="qt">Hilu aidanagada, me maliabu aidanagada, ulu meyo dobu.</char><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Fogo amoyamo, inolo uleno, ene wi Simiono, Yelusalame ami asulu. E <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> alefasia, Godene sulu kuliba abia, Godefea guluguluba ado. <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> efea alolu. Aufia, Godehe <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomufea ine libo aeaba homesi, e yasifia alolu. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Asubane Noekenemohe efea saaba ofelesia, “Ga aso olabale ligia, ge sihe Saminilone iminilu inolo, Kelisomo babiyobafeba” saaba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Ausi, hilia amoyamo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char>, e <char style="w">sebele molo</char> amone yala usu lubia sugalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 2:27">Simiono auba sugasi, enaodai enaedaihe Yesu subobomo sebele molo amone yala usu feoba sefia huga mulu. Aaluhe Efea Godene sulu muguli mana solu dobuguba moloyone mulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Ausi, Simionohe Yesu fafuba difasia, Godene wi eweguba digiba solu.<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Saminilo, ne bisomo, Ga. Na-mo, ge <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo</char> lolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">Aga, Gahe na waagi libo <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealodai</char> malama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">Maumo, Gahe oloba huliale sulu nafea soluguba samodosia molofe.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:10">Ais 52.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:6">Lug 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:11">Dai 2.11</ref></char>
    </note>Gahe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyone</char> daiyalu amo, ne si abulu.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Daiyalu amo, Gahe helefealu idele inolo suniane si saabia madeneba ufulubiyo.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Ais 42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52.10</ref></char>
    </note>Gahe yane meyone daiyalu. Yane amohe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolofea</char> ulufaba neeba dowesia, Ge mosomu Isolaele <char style="w">elalelu</char> melesi moloba ofelefe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Simionohe auba faibe amone saaba sulu selefemo dobelesia, enaodai enaedai aaluhe momoleba hiliselu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Ais 8.14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:42">Mad 21.42</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:8">1Fid 2.8</ref></char></note>Ausi, Simionohe ilifea <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ufulu</char>. Aufia, ehe subobo amone enae <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliafea</char> selesia, “Doma. Ge faibe ewehe Isolaele idele inolo wedinalemo gelebaiba waalesia, aufia Ehe ili noolomo degeba ifoba yaeyobafe. Aufia, E-mo eloba babiyo uleno adesi, inolo wedinale ilihe Efea woba saeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Mau amo alefasia, inolo wedinalene asigi muguba waalebumo, ulufaba yaeyobafe. Ausi, ge yagumo, helebesi uleno bubagaloguba, bubagasi babiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Fogo ami, saaba ofolo ido uleno, eda ami asulu. Ene wimo, <char style="w">Ana</char>. E Fanuelene eleweli. Fanuele e-mo, Asele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">e-mo, Isolaele mosomu huguluba amone, Yekobone faibe nomo e.</char></note> mosomu. Ana e idagolu koleba asulu. Samini e inolo daafia, ainodaimo hamu domoba asulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Dufia, ene aino olafia labi, e ilisulu yoba asulu. Aga ene hamumo, daabuluba aaiyobafia biniba (84) alolu. Hilia sunia, e sebele moloa daabasu ado. Ehe hilia noolo <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyafia</char> ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> ligia, yaidada, nigilibada, Godefea gulugulubasu ado. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Simionohe Godefea henelu sulu selaba labi fogo hamagi, Ana e Yesu subobo aniba hagoale milifasia, eda Godefea henelu sulu solu. Aufia, idele inolo Godehe Yelusalame sububa dafogomesi yasibu ili amo suniafea, Anahe faibe amone saaba sulu solu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mad 2.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yosebedai, Maliadai, aaluhe kegele sunia Saminilone sulu muguli soluguba kuliba abia, moloba samodofia, faibeda uluba dibia, aine dauno Nasalede, Galili disiligi helea ami, obegeba daalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Aufia, faibe amo bulesia, kiwida alolu. E-mo asigi nafulu wasigafia, Godene <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululoda</char> Efea alolu.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faibe Yesumo sebele moloa daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:24-27">Kis 12.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:14-17">23.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Lo 16.1-8</ref></char>
    </note>Hamu sunia, <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> Hilia adesi, Yesu Ene enaedai enaodai aalu Yelusalame sidi gagaiyofea ami daaba ado. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu E hamu huguluba adesi, Eda aalu galiba, ine Yudane mana kuliba abia, sigilo gagaiyofea ami, Yelusalame maiyone fela daalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Sigilo hiliamo samodofia, enaedai, enaodai, moloa obegeba aasi, faibe Yesumo Yelusalame waagi alolu. Auluso, Ene enaedai, enaodaihe, E-mo Yelusalame ami afelefeba eloba abuluale. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Aalu hilisesia, Yesumo ine damene noolo galiba, ua aafebuba hiliselu. Auba hiliseba ligia, aalu hilia ule daabasu alolu. Aufia ami, aaluhe E isasiamo, aine mosomudai, aine damenedai aleba ami isalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Auluso, Yesu isalumo besabale baafia, aalu E isaeyone Yelusalame obegeba daalu. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Aaluhe, E isaba ligia, hilia osolo adesi, E-mo <char style="w">sebele molo</char> amone yala usu saabi baaba golelu. E-mo walelo inolo ili aleba yoba sigia, Ehe ili selefemone dobolaba ligia, Eda ilifea doba beaba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Idele inolohe Ene asigi bafasiada, sulu E obegeba selefemo dobelesiada, ili sunia momoleba hiliselu. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ene enaedai, enaodaimo, E bafasia, hidigilu. Aufia, Ene enaehe Efea selesia, “Ne naalo, enesi gahe anifea auba mololu? Ge gaoda anine asigimo higinifia, ani Ga isaba alolu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Auluso, E aalufea obegeba selesia, “Aaligo Na enesi isase? Na Ne Nao labea miliyo dobubamo, aali hilisebualela?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Auluso, sulu E aalufea selefemo, aalu mau fadaba asigiba duluale.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 2:19">Lug 2.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, E aalu galiba obegeba suga abia, Nasalede dauno goalu. Aufia, hilia sunia, Ehe aine sulu kuliba daabasu ado. Auluso, kegele E mololu amo sunia, enae asigi hilisefiasu alolu. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1Sml 2.26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Snd 3.4</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu E bulefia, inolo adesia, Ene dawalolomo nafulu koleba holobagalu. Ausi, Godehe E hamesi, idele inolo ilida E hamelu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yonehe sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Madiyu 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2-8">Maga 1.2-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yone 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Aufia dufia, <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisa</char> Daibeliase e Lomene kini hamu daabuluba ulene bia (15) adesi, ami Fodiusu <char style="w">Filadusu</char> e Yudia disiligi ami gamanene yasilo alolu. Fogo ami, kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodo</char> e Galili disiligine yasilo alolu. Ausi, ene elewo Filibihe Idulia disiligida, Dalakonidisi disiligida amone yasilo alolu. Aufia, Lisaniase e Abilene disiligi amone yasilo alolu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amo fogomo, Yonedai, Yesudaimo, seba duluiya amifia hamu daabuluba osoloa (30) alolu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasedai, Kaiafasedai aalumo,<char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni</char> alolu. Fogo ami, Sekalaeane faibe <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> e hele falaiya ami labi, Godehe efea sulu saaba melu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:24">HD 13.24</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yone e abia, hano Yodene aniba fogoba asuluiya ami siba ligia, idele inolofea sulu mana waleba alolu. Sulu mana walesiamo, ehe ilifea selesia, “Godehe gine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galimesine</char>, gili koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisia</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gemaba</char>” solu. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Ais 40.3-5</ref></char></note>Auba molofe amo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiane</char> bugohe sulu selelu dobuguba holobagalu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">Hele falaiya ami, inolo uleno mofe eweguba wuaaba selaba miliyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Saminilo</char> E milesine, eno isoba felaba madenema!”</char><verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />
    <char style="qt">Gogolu sunia geba yaasia, hele galedai kaudai gagabumo, sunia waliba dolaba yaama.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">Eno sunia koageba yaalu dobumo, nafuluba isoba yaama.</char><verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />
    <char style="qt">Ausi, helefealu idele inolo ili suniamo, Godehe nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba disia</char> dabalu molofemo babiyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:6" />
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 3:6">Saaba ofolo Aisaiahe auba solu.<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mad 12.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23.33</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo wamilimo, Yonehe ili <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalemesi, milibailu. Ausi, ehe ili amofea selesia, “Soiye wolu aiyanene edo, gili labe! Kanolo gilifea miyobafemo elaba daafia malabamo, inolo ulenohe gilifea haguguba selesi, gili na labea milibaisela? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yon 8.33</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 8:39">39</ref></char></note>Gili seale asigi besiluba walesiamo, gine mana alefasia, asigi besilu loluba sebe walemale. Aga gili gine meleba eweguba selefe, ‘<char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamamo</char> nine nauwa labene, nini kanolo elaba daafia maiyobasu.’ Auluso, auba hilisemabiyo. Na gilifea selesu, Godehe abane waalebu ewefeafia Abalahamane enauwa hagaea isoba waagi moloba ufiyodolu labe. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mad 7.19</ref></char></note>I kuliyone kabimo, ama i mau madeneba diba waalelu dobu. Aufia, sebe nafuluda helelebuale i amo sunia, ilihe kolofasia, de saidafaliba ilogoyobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Godehe idele inolo osolaeyobafemo, kabigulu i mau diba waalelu dobu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Idele inolo wamili ilihe Yone selefemo dofasia, ili efea doba bisigia selesia, “Aulubi, nini eneba moloyobi?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ausi, ehe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Inolohe saligalo aida dobunaga, nomo inolo male amofea meyo dobu. Inolo ga naiyo wedinale dobunaga, amoda mana aubasu moloyo dobu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Lug 7.29</ref></char></note>Ausi, dagese dilo inolo noolo, Yonehe ili hano geba homesisia milibailu. Aufia, ili doba bisigia selesia, “Walelo, nini eneba moloyobi?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ausi, Yonehe ilifea selesia, “Gamanehe dagese mole gilifea dimaleba soluguba disiamo, baaba koleba noda dimabiyo.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Ausi, yobolo inolo noolohe efea doba abulu. “Ninimo, eneba moloyobi?” Ausi, ehe ilifea selesia, “Gilihe none mole oloba koweba haalimabiyo. Aufia, noolofea mole memasia, egedidiba selesia, fa dimabiyo. Aubale, elebe gili difemo isobuba hilisesia, onafia melale.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Idele inolo ili suniahe Yone solumo dofasia, ine libo hidigiba yaasia, wedinale keleba hilisesia, Yone ewemo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> e-bileba hiliselu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:25">HD 13.25</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yonehe ili suniafea obegeba selesia, “Nahe gili hano balu geba waalesu. Auluso, dufia inolo uleno na faisa miyobafemo, Ene kiwigagalumohe ne kiwigagalumo wasolu. Na Edai lilibuale. Na-mo, Ene dabalu moloba ofolo miliyone imini ololuale. Aulugulu, na wida male koleba ligia, Ene samaga husia, efolo fisigaeyone lililuale lolu. Ehe gili <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemodai</char>, dedai, geba waaleyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />E inigiamo, Ene sonehe fogeda selu miyobafemo, faso sunia <char style="w" lemma="Widi">widifea</char> dobumone diba dafaliyone miyobafe. Aufia, Ehe Ene widi sebemo gagaiyofia, Ene widi molosu diba waaleyobafe. Auluso, waa afolumo, Ehe de usulalemo soba dagiyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Aufia, Yonehe idele inolofea awalu sulu nafulu auba walesiamo, ehe ine asigi degeba yaamesi sulu nooloda walelu.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helodohe Yone dibolo dafogolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mad 14.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mag 6.17-18</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yonehe kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodofea</char> ga heleba mololuba solu. Helodohe ene elewone eamono Helodiasa sagoba dulu amoneda, e wolu nonoba mololu amoneda, Yonehe efea halaleba solu. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ausi, Helodohe, wolu noolo e mololumone saabia wolu ulenoda gegoasia, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> dibolo dafogolu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hano gelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Madiyu 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maga 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Idele inolo sunia <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> yaasi, Yesu Eda hano gelu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yone aso dibolo dabale ligiamo, ehe idele inolo suniada, Yesuda, hano geba waalelu. Dufiamo gamanehe e dibolo dafogolu.</char></note> Yesu E hano gefasia, Godedai sulu selaba labi, <char style="w">hebene</char> sogoba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:32">Yon 1.32</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> haga maliabugulu suga inigia, E saabia yoba asulu. Ausi, hebenefia sulu goo uleno saaba dafogosia selesia, “Ga Ne Naalo, Ne yaguso amo, Ga koleba. Na Gafea bule koleba henesu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune enauwane saladegelu amone wi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Madiyu 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:22">Lug 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:42">Yon 6.42</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesu E-mo hamu daabuluba osoloa adesi, Godene sulu mana waleyo maugalu. Idele inolo hilisesia, E <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebene</char> faibebuba hiliselu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:23" />
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:23">Yosebemo, Heeline faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heelimo, Madadane faibe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Ausi, Madadamo, Lifaine faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Lifaimo, Melikine faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Melikimo, Yanaene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Yanaemo, Yosebene faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosebemo, Madadiasane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Madadiasamo, Amosone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Amosomo, Nahumune faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Nahumumo, Heseline faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Heselimo, Nagaine faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagaimo, Madene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:26">Mademo, Madadiasane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:26">Madadiasamo, Semenane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:26">Semenamo, Yosekene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:26">Yosekemo, Yodane faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yodamo, Yoanane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:27">Yoanamo, Lesane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:27">Lesamo, Selubabelene faibe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:27">Selubabelemo, Saladielene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:27">Saladielemo, Neline faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Nelimo, Melikine faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:28">Melikimo, Adine faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:28">Adimo, Kosamune faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosamumo, Elemadane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:28">Elemadamo, Elane faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Elamo, Yosuane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:29">Yosuamo, Eliesane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliesamo, Yolimune faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:29">Yolimumo, Madadane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:29">Madadamo, Lifaine faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lifaimo, Saimionone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:30">Saimionomo, Yudane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:30">Yudamo, Yosebene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:30">Yosebemo, Yonamone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:30">Yonamomo, Eliakimune faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakimumo, Meleane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:31">Meleamo, Menane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:31">Menamo, Madadane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:31">Madadamo, Neidenene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:31">Neidenemo, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 4:17-22">Rut 4.17-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Deibidimo, <char style="w" lemma="Yesi">Yesine</char> faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:32">Yesimo, Obedene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:32">Obedemo, Boasane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:32">Boasamo, Salemonone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:32">Salemonomo, Nasonone faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nasonomo, Aminadabane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminadabamo, Ademinine faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:33">Ademinimo, Alanine faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:33">Alanimo, Hesolonone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:33">Hesolonomo, Felesene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:33">Felesemo, Yudane faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yudamo, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:34">Yekobomo, Aisegene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:34">Aisegemo, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:34">Abalahamamo, Delane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:34">Delamo, Nahone faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahomo, Selukune faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:35">Selukumo, Leune faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:35">Leumo, Felegene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:35">Felegemo, Ebene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebemo, Salane faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">Stt 11.10-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Salamo, Kainane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:36">Kainamo, Alefakasadane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:36">Alefakasadamo, Semene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:36">Sememo, Noane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:36">Noamo, Lamegene faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamegemo, Meduselane faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:37">Meduselamo, Inogone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:37">Inogomo, Yaledene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:37">Yaledemo, Malalelene faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:37">Malalelemo, Kenanane faibe,<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:25-26">Stt 4.25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kenanamo, Enosone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:38">Enosomo, Sedi amone faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:38">Sedimo, <char style="w" lemma="Adama">Adamane</char> faibe,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:38">Adamamo, Godene faibe.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Henanehe Yesu dedeba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Madiyu 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maga 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> Yesufea wasigafia labi, E hano Yodene afasia daalu. Ausi, Asubane Noekenemo E lubia abia, isale hele falaiya ami daalu. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Yesu E hele falaiya ami labi, hilia daabuluba biniba (40) aleba ami, <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanehe</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Henane </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ene wi nomo, Sedene.</char></note> E dedeba abulu. Hilia fogo amo aleba ami, E naiyo nabalesu alolu. Hilia daabuluba biniba amo samodosi, E mamialu.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ausi, henanehe Efea selesia, “Ga seale koleba Godene Faibenaga, amo gahe abane waalebu ewefea, <char style="w">boledi</char> mesenemaba saama.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Lo 8.3</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. ‘<char style="qt">Idele inolo ili naiyofeasu alefasia miliyolu dilale.</char>’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ausi, henanehe Yesu lubia abia, hele galea felafia, alebale hamagi, helefealu sunia yasiba adaba yaabumo, ehe Yesufea waleba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Aufia, ehe Yesufea selesia, “Mosomu ewe sunia yasimesine, nahe Gafea kiwi meyobasu. Ausi, Ga wabialeba sodo inolo koleba miliyobafe. Maumo, kegele amo sunia ne dobu. Nahe ulenofea meyo hamefe amofea, na meyobasu. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Aulugulu, Ga nafea sauba hanefia gulugulusenaga, amo nahe kegele ewe sunia Gafea meyobasu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13-14">Lo 6.13-14</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. ‘<char style="qt">Ga ge <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode E sisa ligia, Efeasu guluguluba melale.</char>’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Aufia, henanehe Yesu Yelusalame lubia daafia, E <char style="w">sebele molo</char> saabia ana lagi koleba yoba melafia, selesia, “Ga seale koleba Godene Faibenaga, amo Ga Gene meleba ligi suba mela. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Sng 91.11-12</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">‘Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilone sulu dia ano">Ene sulu dia anofea</char> selesia, ilihe ga luba ligia nafuluba yasimesi saeyobafe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Aufia, sulu eweda selelu dobu. <char style="qt">Ge emo abanefea dowelosi, ine sonehe Ga feoba seba lagoyobafe.</char>’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Lo 6.16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:9">1Kld 10.9</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. ‘<char style="qt">Gahe ge Gode Saminilomo, dedeba bamabiyo.</char>’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:18">Hib 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4.15</ref></char>
    </note>Henanehe Yesufea auba dedeba samodofia, e Yesu gadefia abia, hilia no dedeba babiyone yasilu.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasalede idele inolohe Yesu hameluale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Madiyu 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maga 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubanene</char> kiwigagalu Efea wasigafia ligia, Yesu E Galili disiligi obegeba daalu. Ausi, idele inolo hele ami kakainalumohe, Yesu Galili ami mulu labeba solumo doba sigilu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Sogo alegalu sunia, Ehe idele inolofea ine <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloa</char> Godene sulu mana selaba alolu. Ausi, idele inolo suniahe Ene wi digiba yaalu.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Ausi, Yesu E Nasalede daalu. E aso faibe ligiamo, dauno ami bulelu. <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> adesimo, E Ene mana molologuba, gulugululo moloa daalu. Suga daafia, E Godene bugo alegaeyone degelu. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Ausi, ilihe <char style="w">Saaba Ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaia</char> beba selelu homogolumo Efea melu. Ehe selelu homogolumo fisigafia, sulu eweguba selelumo bisigia alegalu.<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.18-19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Ais 61.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:6">58.6</ref></char>
    </note>“<char style="qt">Saminilohe Na iminiba ofelesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">walea hano Ne gunia sagaba ufulu amo alefasia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Ene Asubane Nafea labe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Amo alefasia, weagulu idele inolofea awalu sulu nafulu saeyo malesine, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Ehe Na iminiba ufulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo dibolo dafalibagobumone sububa dafia dedalemesineda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">idele inolo si kalaba yaalumo haiba fisigafia bebeleba yaamesineda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Ehe Na hilibailu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, idele inolo, noolo anogohe ili lasiafe amone sububa dafogomesineda,</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />
    <char style="qt">idele inolofea Saminilone fogo nafulumo holobagagabuba samesineda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">
    <char style="qt">Ehe Na hilibailu.</char>”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesu auba alegafasia, beba selelu homogolumo gadufia, inolo amoda luba ado amofea obegeba mefia, E yoba asulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele ine manamo, degeba ligia Godene sulu mana alegafasia, yoba sigia Godene sulu mana sodo.</char></note> Aufia, idele inolo gulugululo moloa asulumo sunia Yesufeasu sidalu. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ausi, Ehe ilifea maugaba selesia, “Godene sulu selelu dobu na alegaba selesi, gili dubulumo, agamo wakaliba sugafe.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:23">Lug 3.23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:42">Yon 6.42</ref></char></note>E auba selesi, ilihe Ene wi digisia, kanululu sulu E selefemone dobelesia, ili momoleba wedinale hiliseba yaalu. Aufia, ili selesia, “Wae, inolo ogo <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebene</char> faibealela?”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus reads from scroll in synagogue" file="42_Lk_04_10_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="4.16-23">Yesu alegafasia, beba selelu homogolumo inolo amoda luba ado amofea obegeba mefe.</figure> <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Seale. Gili besi sulu ewe aga Nafea saeyo hamefebu. ‘Dogoda, ga gene meleba waiba homa.’ Aufia, gilihe Nafea eweguba saeyo hamefebu. ‘Ninihe Ga Kafanima ami molosi dubulu amoguba, Ge mosomune dauno iwida aubasu moloma.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yon 4.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, saaba ofolo inolo ulenohe, ene mosomu moloa sulu mana waleyone saabimo, molada idele inolohe e heneba uluba dilalebiyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Kin 17.1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 17:7">7</ref></char></note>Na seale gilifea selesu, Elaiya alolu fogo amohe, anakiwi kaafiasu ligia, hele sugabale hamu osoloafia aube kaabeba alolu. Ausi, hele amo sunia mamia gi bule holobagalu. Fogo amohe, ido ilisulu wedinale <char style="w">Isolaele</char> ami asulu. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1Kin 17.8-16</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe Elaiyamo Isolaele ido ilisulu uleno saabea hilibailuale. Aubale. Ehe e-mo Salefade ido ilisulu uleno saabea hilibailu. Salefade amo Isolaele mosomuale. Saidono sidi aniba ami dobu.<verse eid="LUK 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2Kin 5.1-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, saaba ofolo inolo Elisa alolu fogo amohe, Isolaele idele inolo domalafea yoli walefa wedinale waalelu. Auluso, ili aleba ami, uleno wailuale. Aubale. Silia inolo, Naimana, walefa amone dulu amo, e-su wailu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Yesu auba selesi, gulugululo moloa kakainalu ili amo sunia, sulu selefe amo dobolaba yaasia, ili wobasubale kanoba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Aufia, ili degeba yaasia, Yesumo dauno fafa faisalo aiba gasaba dafulu. Ine dauno amomo, hele galea ami dulu alolu. Aufia, ilihe E-mo hele gale amone saila lubia daafia, E walaeyo kaniba dafogoyo weiyaalu. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Auluso, E idele inolo wamili alebailu ili aleba hamaga abia maiyo daalu.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo ulenofea asubane wolu alolumo aisaba dafulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maga 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ausi, Yesu E Galili disiligi, Kafanima dauno ami suga daafia, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> sunia Godene sulu mana walebasu alolu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mad 7.28-29</ref></char></note>Kafanima idele inolo ilihe, sulu mana E walefemo, hidigiba dobolaba yaalu. Mau enebamo, E walesiamo, inolo wida solu kiwida, dawalolo inolo waleloguba, walelu.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33-34" />Hilia uleno, <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> felalu inolo uleno, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloa</char> ami alolu. Ehe koleba galagiliba selesia, “Aaa! Nasalede Yesu, Ga ninifea eneba moloyone mulu? Ga nini woba ofelesia, dufa dafiyone mulubile? Na hilisesia, Ga inolo amobuba fadaba bosolu. <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">Muuba Kalilu Noekene</char> Inolo Godefea alefasia mulumo, amo Ga-bu!”<verse eid="LUK 4:33-34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe asubane wolufea halaleba selesia, “Ga sauma! Inolo ogo gadefia, afa mala!” Ausi, gamodohe inolo amo idele inolone si saabia helea saidafogofasia, holobagadafia daalu. Auluso, e afa abia, inolo amo woba ufuluale. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Ausi, idele inolo sunia wobasubale hidigiba yaafia, ine geleba selesia, “Wae! Sulu Yesu selefe amo, amenegulubi? E wida solu kiwigagaluda alefasia, Ehe gamodo ili amofea afa malaba selesi, ilihe inolomo gadefia holobagadafia dedalefe!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ili auba solugulu, Yesu mololumone sadalumo, disiligi ami kakainalumo sunia doba sigilu.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo wedinale waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Madiyu 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maga 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> afasia, abia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimonone</char> molosu suga daalu. Saimonone enamolomo haloba walefa bule ufia alolu. Ausi, ilihe Yesufea e waiba homesifia doba abulu. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ausi, Yesu abia, e aniba yoba ligia, selesia, “Walefa, ga ido ogo gadefia malaba” solu. Auba selesi, walefahe ido amo gadefia daalu. Walefa amo e gadefia aasi, ido amo degefia, ine naiyo madenelu.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Halo sugasi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.40 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Halo sugasi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mo, Yudane idele inolone Sabada hilia amo elosi, ili dabalu mololo.</char></note> ili suniahe, ine damenedali walefa nonoba waalelumo, Yesu labea lubia milibailu. Ausi, Ehe Ene sonemo walefalu ule ulebafea geba yaasia, ili waiba waalelu. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:29">Mad 8.29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:11-12">Mag 3.11-12</ref></char></note>Nigili hamagi, Ehe <char style="w">gamodo</char> wedinale idele inolofea adaaba yaalumo, gadefia dedaleba yaamalu. Ausi, gamodo holobagagafia dedalesia, eweguba galagiliba selesia, “Ga Godene faibebuba” selaba yaalu. Auluso, Ehe ilifea auba samabusia, saumaba halaleba solu. Maumo, gamodo ili hilisesia, E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisobuba</char> hiliselu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Keafale koleba, Yesu E dauno amo gadefia, inoloda maleiya heeba dulu helea daalu. Ausi, idele inolo wedinalemo E isalabia inigia, E labea goafasia, E ili gadefia anosi, ilihe E kaeyo hamelu. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Auluso, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Na kaamabu. Enebamo, Gode E Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone awalu sulu nafulu amo, Nahe dauno noolofeada saaba meyo dobu. Maumo, Godehe Na helefealu iwi dabalu amo molomesi hilibailu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mad 4.23</ref></char></note>Ausi, Ehe Yudiane gulugululo moloa ami, Godene sulu mana walelabia sibasu alolu.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu selesi, Fidahe hani wedinale sigiba yaalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Madiyu 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maga 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Mad 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mag 3.9-10</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia uleno, Yesu E Genesalede waiyo galulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Genesalede waiyo galulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ene wi nomo, ili noolohe Galili waiyo galuluba sodo. Luguhe Genesalede waiyo galuluba selelu.</char></note> aniba ami yoba labi, idele inolo wamilimo, Godene sulu mana dubiyone, E amaleba galilu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ausi, hani dafogolone hano kasu aidamo, waiyo aniba gadefalu dobi abulu. Hano kasu amone biso ilimo, ine hani selege heesia waaleba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Ausi, E hano kasu uleno aleba lagolu. Hano kasu amo, Saimononemo. Aufia, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimonofea</char> selesia, “Hano kasu ewemo egewi afasia, wedino gigiliba dibia, malaba” solu. Aufia, Yesu E hano kasu amo yoba aseba ilogofia, idele inolo wamili amofea sulu mana walelu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />E sulu selaba alolumo saaba samodofia, Ehe Saimonofea selesia, “Hano kasu ewe gigiliba dibia abia, hano dogolea daafia, gine hani selege ogo, hani sigiba molaeyone, dafaliba ilogoma.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:3-8">Yon 21.3-8</ref></char></note>Ausi, Saimonohe obegeba selesia, “Yasilo, nini nigili sunia selalemo dabalu hogoloba moloba aloluso, hani ulenoda duluale. Auluso, Ga selefe ogo alefasia, nahe hani selege dafaliba ilogoyobasu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ili auba molosi, hani wedinale wasigaaba yaasia, hani selegemo bidiba yaeyo weiyaalu. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Aulune, ilihe ine ua dabalu mololo noolo hano kasu no kakainalu ili amofea, ili sagoyo milesi sone yawelu. Ausi, ili milibaifasia, hano kasu amo aalifaba, hani sesia, wasigaaba yaasi, hano kasu aidamo hano ulubaiba yaeyo weiyaalu.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ausi, Saimono <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> amo eloba baafia, e Yesune olegia sauba hanesia, selesia, “Na gadefia mala. Yasilo, na woluda wasigaalu inolo.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Fida auba selefemone maumo, eda, e galiba alebailu ili amoda, ili sunia hani sigiba yaalu amone bisigia, ili hidigiba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Saimonone dabalu ua mololo, Sebedine faibe aida, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesedai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, aaluda aubasu hidigiba abulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Ausi, Yesuhe Saimonofea selesia, “Ga sagilimabu. Gahe hani sigiba molafeguba, aga iwifia idele inolo sigiba molaeyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:27">Mad 19.27</ref></char></note>Yesu auba selesi, ilihe ine hano kasu aidamo hano egewi dibia daafia, ine kegele sunia gadefia, E kuliba daalu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe aiye yolida alolu uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Madiyu 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maga 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu E dauno uleno labi, bosolufalumo, aiye yolida aseba samodolu inolo uleno, E labea mulu. Ehe Yesu baafia, ene mi ilogolofia, hele saabia sauba hanefia, Yesufea susiba selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Ga koleba, na galagololu melesi hamesenaga, amo Gahe na waiba ufiyodolu dobu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe Ene sone isosia, inolo amo gesia selesia, “Na auba hamefe. Ga waisia, galagololu mela!” Ausi, alebale hamagi, aiye yoli amo asigilesi, inolo amo galagololu holobagalu.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Wkp 14.1-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesu efea koleba selesia, “Kegele gafea mololu ogomo, inolo ulenofea samabiyo. Aubale. Auluso, inolo noolohe ga seale wailububa asigimesine, ga abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inolofea</char> gene waleyo dafasia, <char style="w">Mosese</char> ene muguli saaba ufuluguba, ulu kegele soba meyone mala.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Auluso, Yesuhe mololu sadalumo, sunia doba sigiba yaalu. Ausi, idele inolo wamili, ine walefamo waiba waalemesisia, Ene sulu dubiyosia, milibailu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Auluso, hilia wedinalemo, E elebi abia, hele inoloda maleiya ami, Godedai sulu saeyo bobolalo.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe kakaloba dulu inolo uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Madiyu 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maga 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Hilia uleno, Yesuhe idele inolofea Godene sulu mana waleba alolu. Ausi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo ilida, muguli mana walelo ilida, ami yoba kakainalu. Ili Yelusalame sidifiada, Galiline dauno deseine sunia amifiada, Yudiane dauno deseine sunia amifiada, milibaifasia ami kakainalu. Ausi, Saminilone kiwigagalumo Yesufea adesi, Ehe idele inolo walefalu waiba waalelu.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Auba moloba labi, bosolufalumo, inolo noolohe kakaloba dulu inolo uleno dafu adolu saabia ofasia, ikauba dibia mulu. Ilihe e-mo Yesu aniba diba ufiyone hilisesia, molosu Yesuda labea ami, suga maiyone weiyaalu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Auluso, fogo dedelelune, ilihe inolomo Yesu labea dia sugaeyodoluale baafia, molo fagia dibia felalu. Aufia, Yesuda labe iminiba ami, molo fagilu olabofia, eno ofelesi, inolo dafu adolumo, efolo godaifia, molo usu idele inolo ilida yoba kakainabia aleba ami, fisigaba dafogosia, e-mo Yesune olegia diba ufulu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:48">Lug 7.48</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:25">Ais 43.25</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe ine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> dobu bafasia, selesia, “Damene, ge <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galisu</char>.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" /><char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> ilida, Falisi ilida, sulu amo dofasia, ili wedinale keleba hiliseba yaalu. Ili hilisesia, “Inolo ewe, e abe kolebabuba hilisese? E sulu auba selesiamo, Godene hele disia, E Godegulu loluba selefe. Auba selefe ogo, Ehe samabiyolu muguli sulu gelefe. Inolo uleno wolu hamasia heesia galilale. Wolu hamasia heesia galilomo, Gode E-su labe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesuhe ili hiliseba yaafemo fadaba bafasia, E ilifea doba bisigia, selesia, “Gine asigi ogo, enesi auba hiliseba yaase? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Abeelu saeyomo, halabu? Ge wolu hamasia heesia galisuba saeyo, amobula, me degefia malaba saeyo, amobula? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:8">Yon 5.8</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> E-mo, helefealu iwi wolu hamasia heesia galiyone wida solu kiwigagalu labe. Aulugulu, gili auba fadaba asigimesine, Nahe kakaloba dulu ewefea eweguba saeyobasu.” Aufia, Ehe kakalolu inolo amofea selesia, “Ga, degema! Ge dafu adolu difasia, gene moloa mala.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ausi, alebale hamagi, inolo amo degefia, idele inolo ami alebailu ine si saabia, dafu adolu eda hanefia alolumo sefia, Godene wi digilabia, ene moloa maiyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ausi, idele inolo suniahe, molofe amone baafia, hidigiba momoleba koleba abulu. Ili Godene kiwigagalu baaba sagilisia, ilihe Godene wi eweguba digiba solu. “Aga kegele nokene koleba moloba dafelagosi, nini abulu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Lifai welu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Madiyu 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maga 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Auba molofasia, Yesu E abia, dagese dilo inolo uleno dagese dilo molo saloaiya yoba saabi abulu. Inolo amone wimo, <char style="w" lemma="Madiyu - Lifai">Lifai</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lifai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ene wi nomo Madiyuba sodo.</char></note> Aufia, Yesu efea selesia, “Ga Na kuliba mila.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Ausi, Lifai e degefia, kegele sunia gadefia, Yesu kuliba maiyo daalu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Aufia, Lifaihe Yesune naiyo bule uleno ene moloa madenelu. Dagese dilo wedinale nooloda, inolo nooloda, ili aalu galiba ua yoba sigia, naiyo naba kakainalu. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Lug 15.1-2</ref></char></note>Auba molosi baafia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo nooloda, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane walelo inolo</char> nooloda, ilihe Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> sulu gogomoba selaba yaalu. Ili selesia, “Gilihe dagese diloda, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolo nooloda, ili galiba kakainafia, naiyo ua naafego. Enesi ause?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Auba selesi dofasia, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Dogodahe domala nafulu fisigalu labemofea dabalu mololale. Aubale. Dogodahe walefa inolo ilifeasu dabalu moloba ado. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Aubasu, Na mulumo, <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> inolo weyone muluale. Aubale. Na mulumo, wolu mololo idele inolo ili amo <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimesi</char> weyone mulu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesufea naiyo aiyalo mana amone doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Madiyu 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maga 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Ausi, ilihe Yesufea selesia, “Hilia wedinalemo, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonene</char> <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilimo <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyafia</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> ado. Aufia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ine walelu faibili ilida aubasu mololo. Auluso, ge walelu faibili ilimo naiyodai hanodai naba labe. Ge walelu faibilimo naiyo aiyafale ogo, enesi aufe?” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:29">Yon 3.29</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea besi sulu eweguba solu. “Ido ifosia, inolone damenedai, idone damenedai, gagaiyofea amimo, ili naiyo aiyalola? Aa. Idoda diyo inolo aso ili galiba ua yoba saabimo, ili naiyo aiyalale. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Auluso, dufia, idoda diyomo uluba dibia daafia labi fogo ami, ene damenedalimo naiyo ami aiyayobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Besi sulu ewemo, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">idoda diyo inolo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mo Yesu iminife.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesuhe besi sulu noda ilifea eweguba solu. “Asigima. Ulenohe fagulo amakelelumo bidilu dobi, fagulo hili geleba difasia, bidilu amakelelu amofea asogolale. Aubale. E auba molosiabiaga, fagulo hilimo woba bidiba dafaiyo. Aufia, fagulo hili wedino gelelu amo, fagulo amakelelu amodai lilibaiyale.<verse eid="LUK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Aufia, inolo ulenohe <char style="w">waini</char> sebe dedelefia, waini hano hili mololu amo, dofene meme bado asogolu agogolelumofea hogonialale. Auba hogoniasiabiaga, amo waini hano hilimo, hoo kaaba galusia, dofene meme bado agogolelumo fisigasia, waini hanomo hele saabia sagaba dabaiyo. Ausimo, meme bado hamagada bidiba dafaiyo. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Aulugulu, waini hano hilimo, dofene meme bado hagaea hili asogolumofea hogoniayo dobu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Aufia, waini hano amakelelumo nafasia, ulenohe hilimo naiyo hamelale. Enebamo, amakelelumone nenalebalumo wasolubusia, hilimo naiyo afiyobafe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Besi sulu aida ewemo, fagulo amakeleluda, meme bado agogoleluda, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">waini hano amakelelu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">da, amo Yudane mana amakelelu amone iminife. Aufia, fagulo hilida, meme bado hilida, waini hano hilida, amo Yesune mana hili walefemone iminife.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu E Sabada hiliane Yasilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-14">Madiyu 12.1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-3:6">Maga 2.23–3.6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Lo 23.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Sabada hilia </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">amo, sogo alegalu hilia Kaabe amo. Mosese ene muguli selelu amo selesia, Sabada hilia ami dabalu ulenoda molomabiyoba muguli ufulu. </char>
    </note> uleno, Yesuda ili desi widi gelu aleba dedaleba ligia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> <char style="w" lemma="Widi">desi widi sebe</char> noolo sufia, bado damesi, ine sone dolafia, naba adabia dedalelu. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:10">Yon 5.10</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo noolohe amo baafia, ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Godene mugulihe Sabada hilia elo ofelesia, mana ewe molomabiyoba solugulu, gili auba molose ogo, enesi ause?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sml 21.1-6</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Amakele <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidida</char>, e galiba sibaisaloda, ili amo mamiasi, kegele mololumone sadalu amo gili alegalualela? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Wkp 24.5-9</ref></char></note>Fogo amoyamo, Deibidi e Godene molo usu sugafia, <char style="w">boledi</char> Godene olegia diba ufia adomo, e difasia, nabia, noolomo e galiba sibaisalo ili amofeada namenesi melu. Boledi amo <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ilisu namenesi, inolo baluhe namenabiyoba muguli ufulu. Aulugulu, Deibidi auba naasihe muguli molomabiyolumo gelelu.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Auba safasia, Yesuhe ilifea saabia selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibehe</char> Sabada hilia amone yasilo labe. Aulugulu, hilia amimo molomabada, molomabiyobada, saeyomo, yasilo ene dabalu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Sabada hilia no, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molosu</char> suga daafia, idele inolofea mana waleba alolu. Inolo uleno, ene sone inaloalo kakaloba dulu, ami asulu. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Falisi nooloda, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawaloloda</char>, ilida Yesu walefea ami asulu. Yesuhe muguli gelelubusia mau fadaayone isasia, ili nafuluba sidafia alolu. Yesuhe Sabada hilia ami walefaba yaalu ili amo waiba waalefelaba babiyone aulu. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ausi, Yesuhe ili hilisefe amo baafia, Ehe inolo sone kakalolu amofea selesia, “Ga degefia, idele inolone si saabia, dogolea iwi yoba miliyo mila.” Ausi, e degefia, yoba miliyo mulu. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Na gilifea doba bosolu. Sulu muguli saaba ufulu, sealego hala? Sabada hilia amimo mana wolu moloyomobile, me mana nafulu moloyomobula? Miliyolu dufa dafiyomobile, me <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyomobula</char>?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesuhe idele inolo sunia bebeleba amaleba samodofia, aufia inolo amofea selesia, “Ge sone ogo isoma.” Inolo amo auba ausi, ene sonemo haiba nafulu momoloba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Auluso, muguli manane dawalolo inoloda, aufia Falisi inolo ilida, ili wobasubale kanofia, ine geleba nenesia, eweguba solu. “Ninihe Yesufea eneba moloyobi?”<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe hilibaisi daalu huguluba molobebelelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Madiyu 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maga 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Fogo amoyamo, hilia uleno Yesu E elebi hele galea ami <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saeyone</char> daalu. Nigili amo sunia E Godedai sulu selabasu ligia, hilialu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Keafa hiliasi, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> sunia weba gagaiyofia, ili amone aleba ami hugulubamo molobebelesia, ili amo, Ene <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> melesi gadefalu. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Ulenomo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, Yesuhe ene wimo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidaba</char> wi ufulu. Aufia, Ehe Saimonone elewo <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Aduluda</char> iminisia, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibida</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Badolomiyu">Badolomiyuda</char>, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" /><char style="w" lemma="Madiyu - Lifai">Madiyuda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domaseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[2]], Alufiusune faibe">Alufiusune faibe Yemeseda</char>, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Saimono Selodo mosomune faibe">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Selodo mosomu">Selododa</char>, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />aufia <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[3]], Yemesene faibe">Yudasa e Yemesene faibeda</char>, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodoba</char>, ili amo sunia iminilu. Yudasa Isakaliodo ewe, dufia Yesuda holonolu amo, e.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo wedinalefea edililo diyobafebada, higinilu diyobafebada, walelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">Madiyu 4.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-12">Maga 3.7-12</ref>; aufia <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Madiyu 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Aufia Yesuda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, ili hele galeafia suga daafia, hele ubabea ami goafia labi, Ene walelu faibili wamili nooloda ili ami yoba alolu. Aufia, idele inolo wamili wedinale disiligi Yudiafiada, Yelusalame sidifiada, saiyalefealo sidi aida Dailadai, Saidonodai, amifiada milibaifia, ilida ubabea ami goafia alebailu. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Ili milibailumo, Yesune sulu dubiyonefiada, ine walefa waimesifiada, milibailu. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane wolu">asubane woluhe</char> woba waalelu idele inolomo, Yesuhe waiba waalelu. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Ausi, idele inolo sunia ine sonehe E geba yaeyo weiyaalu. Maumo, ilihe E sone gesi, kiwigagalu Efeafia holobagafia, ili sunia waiba waalelu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Aufia, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili bebeleba amalefia selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 6:20" />
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mad 5.1-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Weagulu alebaibu gili, gine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:20">Maumo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, gine dobu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 7:16-17">MUU 7.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 126:5-6">Sng 126.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:3">Ais 61.3</ref></char>
    </note>Aga mamiafe gilimo, gine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:21">Maumo, Godehe gili amo kubaleba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:21">Aga yegilife gilimo, gine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:21">Maumo, dufia gili galiyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:19">Yon 15.19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:2">16.2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Fid 4.14</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo noolohe gili <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> kuliba daaba labe bisigia, gilifea gogoloba besenaga, amo gine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:22">Aufia, ilihe gilifea faiso mesia, gilifea woba selesia, aufia gine wimo wolusia diba dafelesenaga, amo gine henelo wasigafia labe.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Ilihe mana amogulu gilifea molosenaga, gili henesia ibamale.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:23">Maumo, elebe bule <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi ga yasifia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:23">Asigima. Gilifea molofe amogubamo, saminimo, ine enauwadalihe mana amogubasu <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolofea moloba yaalu.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Auluso, elebeda ufulu gilimo, yeele, gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:24">Maumo, gili gine libo heneba ufiyo amo aga dulu dobu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Aga naiyo nafasia kubalefia alebaibu gilimo, yeele, gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:25">Maumo, dufia gili mamiayobafe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:25">Aga gaidesia waalefe gilimo, yeele, gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:25">Maumo, dufia gili kuanoba ligia, wobasubale yegiliyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Idele inolohe gine wi digife gilimo, yeele, gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:26">Maumo, saminida, ine enauwadalihe mana aubasu masega saaba ofolofea moloba yaalu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gisa hameseyone mana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Madiyu 5.38-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Auluso, Ne sulu dobelefe idele inolo, gili doma. Na gilifea eweguba selesu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 6:27">Gilihe gine gisafea hamesemale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 6:27">Aufia, idele inolo gilifeada gogoloba besabe ili amofeamo mana nafulu molomale.<verse eid="LUK 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Aufia, gilifeada kaoba selefe ili amofea <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ofa</char> saamale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 6:28">Aufia, gilida woba ofelefe ili amone hilisesia, gilihe Godedai sulu saamale.<verse eid="LUK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Inolo uleno ge bolobolo nolobalo dowesenaga, amo gahe bolobolo nolobaloda efea walemale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 6:29">Inolo ulenohe ge badisi saligalo huba disenaga, amo gahe ge saligalo noda efea memale.<verse eid="LUK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Idele inolo suniahe kegele noolo gafea memaba haalisenaga, amo ga ilifea memale.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 6:30">Aufia, inolo ulenohe ge kegele disenaga, amo gahe ge kegele amo obegeba memaba samabiyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mad 7.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mana sunia, gilihe noolo anogohe gilifea molomesi hamefe amogulumo, gilihe ilifeada mana amogubasu molomale.”<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Gilihe idele inolo gilifea hamesefe amosu sabe hamesesenaga, gine mana auba molofe amohe, gilifea hebene lagi elebe meyobafela? Meyobafale. Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> idele inolo ilida, ilifea hamesefe amofeamo sabe hameselo. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Aufia, gilihe inolo gilifeada mana nafulu molofe ili amofeasu, mana nafulu sabe molosenaga, gine mana auba molofe amohe, gilifea hebene lagi elebe meyobafela? Meyobafale. Enebamo, wolu mololo idele inolo ilida mana aubasu mololo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Aufia, gilihe inolo danoda duguba meyodolu amofeasu dano mesenaga, gine mana auba molofe amohe, gilifea hebene lagi elebe meyobafela? Meyobafale. Enebamo, wolu mololo inolo ilida, wolu mololo noolofeamo dano meba yaalo. Auluso, ili balu melale. Aubale. Mole enaohe inolo danoda duguba meyodolu amofeasu melo.<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Auluso, gilihe gine gisa hamesema. Aufia, ilifea mana nafulu molomale. Gilihe no anogofea dano ofelesiamo, ilihe gilifea duguba memesiba hilisebale memale. Gili auba molosenaga, dufiamo, gine elebe bule ofelesimo, gili Gode Ana Labe Lagone faibili koleba miliyobafe. Maumo, Godehe idele inolo henelu sulu selefale amofeada nafulusu moloba ofelesia, idele inolo wolu molofe ilifeada nafulusu moloba ofolo. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Gine Gaohe kanululoguba, gilida aubasu kanulumale.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gilihe inolo noolone mana osolamabiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Madiyu 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mad 6.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu selesia,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:37">“Gili inolo no anogone mana osolamabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:37">Ausimo, ulenohe gili osolaeyobafale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:37">Gili inolo no anogofea woluba samabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:37">Ausimo, ulenohe gilifea woluba saeyobafale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:37">Gili koleba, none wolu <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galimale</char>.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:37">Ausimo, gine woluda hamasia heesia galiyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mag 4.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gilihe kegele no anogofea memale.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 6:38">Ausimo, no anogohe gilifeada meyobafe.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 6:38">Auba gilifea mesimo, wasigaaba ofelesia, egeba selabia felasi, galebaisafia gilifea meyobafe. Aufia, gilihe no anogofea iminiba mefe amogubasu, Godehe gilifeada aubasu iminifia, sabe meba obegeyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mad 15.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe besi sulu noda ilifea eweguba solu. “Inolo si kalalu ulenohe, si kalalu no gasiba sefia, eno waleyodolula? Aubale. Aalu aalufaba gogolu ule ami gelebaisaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Mad 10.24-25</ref></char></note>Sugululo faibemo, ene walelomo waseba sunialale. Auluso, sunia abehe nafuluba suguluba samodofia labemo, ene walelo waagulu miliyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Ge sifea i fudulu bule dobu ogo, keleba asigibale ligia, waagi gadefafia ligia, gahe damene no anogone sia ami, i geele dobu amone, keleba asigife ogo, enesi ause? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ge sia anigi i fudulu dobu amo babale ligia, gahe ge damenefea selesia, ‘Damene, ga sifea i geele dobu ogo, na diba dafelesuba’ selefe ogo, enebane ause? Masega sodo inolo, ga. Maugabamo, ga i fudulu ge sia dobu ogodale diba dafiyo dobu. Auba diba dafasia, ga fadaba bisigia, i geele ge damenene sia dobumo, ami diba dafiyodolu dobu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">I sebe helelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Madiyu 7.16-20</ref>; aufia <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">Madiyu 12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “I nafuluhe sebe wolu helelale. Amogubasu, i woluhe sebe nafulu helelale. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />I eloba babiyonemo, inolohe ene sebe helebufea eloba bolo. Aulugulu, idele inolohe didigane efolofea, <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono sebe</char> sulale. Idele inolohe nabaiiye maiya daafia, <char style="w">waini</char> sebe sulale. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Inolo nafulumo, ene libo usu asigi nafulusu wedinale wasigaalu dobi, mana nafulusu dibia holobagaba ado. Inolo wolumo, ene libo usu asigi wolusu wedinale wasigaalu dobi, mana wolusu dibia holobagaba ado. Idele inolone asigifeafia wasigaalu dobu hamagulu, ine mofeyohe saaba dafelagolo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Molo dilone mana aida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Madiyu 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:21">Mad 7.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gilihe Nafeamo ‘Ne <char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ne Saminiloba’ selaba ligiaso, sulu Na selefeguba molosia kuliba aasale ogo, enesi ause? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Aulugulu, inolo uleno Na labea milifasia, ne sulu dofasia kuliba aafemo, Nahe aga gilifea inolo ewe amoguluba saaba mesu. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Inolo amo, e molo kolelu dulu inolo amogulu labe. Maugaba, ehe hele waidabia sugaba labeofia, ikau kolemesi, abane baliama saabia dulu. Molo auba kolelu dulu labi, dufia hano gene inigia, molo amo iluwaluso, duguba daaluale. Maumo, inolo ewehe molo kolelu dulu. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Auluso, inolo ulenohe Ne sulu dofasia, kuliba aafalemo, e molo dilo no amogulu labe. Ehe abane baliama male, hele balu saabia molo dulu amogulu labe. Dufia hano genehe molo amo iluwasia, alebale duguba abia, sunia woba dafulu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe yoboloda yasilo inolo ulenone dabalu mololo faibe waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Madiyu 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesuhe idele inolofea sulu saaba samodofia, E Kafanima dauno ami suga daalu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Lomene yoboloda yasilo uleno dauno ami asulu. Yesu ami goasimo, yasilo amone <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo faibe</char> uleno walefafia, olaeyo hagoale alolu. Yasilo amohe faibe amo bule hameselu alolu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Yasilo amohe Yesu mulu labeba solu dofasia, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo noolomo Yesu labea hilibaisia, Ehe faibe amo waiba homesine milaleyobileba saeyo malesi hilibailu. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ili Yesu labea goafia, kiwigagaba susiba selesia, “Inolo ewe kolebamo sagoba ufiyodolu dobu. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Maumo, ehe nini Yuda hamesefia, ehe nine <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> diba ufulu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Auba selesi, Yesu E ili galiba daalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Yasilone molo hagoaleba goasi, yasilo amohe ene damenedali noolo Yesu labea sulu eweguba sela malalu. E selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ga koleba hogololu dabalu molomabiyo. Ga ne molosu faseba milesine, na lililuale lolu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Aulugulu, nene na Ga bea miyone yuasia sagilife. Auluso, Gahe ugi ligia, waimaleba selesi, ne dabalu mololo faibe ewe yagi waiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Na auba selesu, enebamo, nene nada inolo no yasibu amone sisa lolu. Aufia, yobolo inolo na sisada alebaibu. Na ulenofea malasimo, e ano. Aufia, na nofea milasimo, amo e ano. Aufia, nahe ne dabalu mololofea selesia, ga dabalu ewe molomasimo, amo e mololo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu Ehe yasilo inolo amo sulu auba solumo dofasia, E momoleba hidigilu. Ausi, Ehe idele inolo wamili E kuliba milibailu ili amofea nolofasia, selesia, “Na gilifea selesu, Nahe <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu aleba amimo, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule kolelu ufulu</char> labe amogulu ulenoda abuluale.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Aufia, yasilone hilibailu inolo ili amo, moloa obegeba abia goasia, bosolufalumo, balu dabalu mololo faibe amo waifia labi abulu.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Naini dauno ami faibe fisamili degeba ifolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Hilia no, fogo wedino alefasia, Yesu E Naini dauno ami aasi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, idele inolo wamili wedinaleda, E galiba ami dedalelu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />E dauno amone eno saliba goasia, bosolufalumo, olalu uleno ilihe ikauba dibia baea holobagasi abulu. Olalu amo, e ido ilisulu ulenone faibe ulelu alolu. Ausi, idele inolo dauno ami aselo wedinalemo, ido amo galiba milibailu.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Saminilohe ido amo bisigia, wobasubale yagunagafia, efea selesia, “Ga yeemabu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Aufia, E hagoaleba daafia, olaluda hanelu dafu adolumo gesi, olaluda digilu inolo amo kaalu gagalu. Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Faibe, ga degema!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:23">1Kin 17.23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:36">2Kin 4.36</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, olalu amo degefia, yoba sigia, sulu saeyo maugalu. Ausi, Yesuhe e-mo enaefea obegeba melu.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:68">Lug 1.68</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo suniahe Godene kiwigagalu amone bisigia, Godene wi digiba selaba yaalu. Ili selesia, “<char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> inolo kiwida nini aleba holobagabu.” Aufia, ili selesia, “Godehe Ene idele inolo sagoba ufiyomo, mulu labe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Idele inolo Yudia disiligi ami, hele sunia dedaleba yaasia, aufia hele nolobaloda dedaleba yaasia, Yesu mololu sadalu amo saaba sigilu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yone e-mo Yesufea sulu sabailu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Madiyu 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18-19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.18-19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:7">Sng 40.7</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:8">MUU 1.8</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yonene</char> <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe Yesu mololu sadalumo Yonefea awaba melu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.18-19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fogo aga ewe Hano Gelo Yonemo dibolo alolu. Lugu 3.20 amoda Madiyu 11.2 amoda alegamale.</char></note> Ausi, Yonehe ene walelu faibili aleba ami aida wefia, aalu Saminilo labea hilibaisia, eweguba doba babiyo malalelu. “Inolo Gode alefasia milesiba saaba ufulu amo, Ga-la? Me ninihe inolo no milesi yasiyobile?”<verse eid="LUK 7:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Inolo aidamo Yesu labea goafia, selesia, “Hano Gelo Yonehe ani Ga labea hilibaisi mulu. Ehe Gafea eweguba doba bamaleso. ‘Inolo Gode alefasia milesiba saaba ufulu amo, Ga-la? Me ninihe inolo no milesi yasiyobile?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Fogo amoyamo, Yesuhe idele inolo wedinale walefa nonoba waalelumo, waiba waalelu. Aufia, Ehe asubane wolu idele inolofea adaaba yaalumo, aisaba yaalu. Aufia, si kalaba yaalu wedinalemo, Ehe ili bebeleba yaamesi mololu. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Ais 35.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:18">Lug 4.18</ref></char></note>Aufasia, Yesuhe Yonene sulu dia malalu faibe aida amone sulu obegeba selesia, “Aali obegeba abia, aali dubulu amoneda, abulu amoneda, Yonefea saaba mesia eweguba awamale. Si kalaba yaalu ilimo, haiba bebelefe. Aufia, kakaloba dulu ilimo, haiba dedalefe. Aufia, inolo yoli asulu ilimo, haiba galagololu adaaba yaafe. Aufia, koneni kakaba yaalu ilimo, sulu haiba dobolaba yaafe. Aufia, inolo danelu ilimo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> yaafe. Aufia, idele inolo weagulu ilimo, awalu sulu nafulu dobalaba yaafe. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Aulugulu, inolo abehe na baafia, ene asigi ule ufulu gelebaifale amo, ene henelo wasigafia labe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Inolo aida Yonene sulu dia mulu amo obegeba aasi, Yesuhe idele inolo wamilimofea, Yonemone saaba sulu eweguba solu. “Gili anogo hele falaiya ami dedalelumo, amene babiyone daalu? Gili fufulohe gabaiya uleno walu besife amone bea dedalelubile? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Auluso, auba aulualenaga, gili amene babiyone dedalelu? Gili inolo ule fagulo nenafolosu kaalu amone babiyone dedalelubile? Aa. Inolo fagulo nenafolo kakaluda, domala uluba miliyone kegele nenafolosu dobuda, inolo ili amogulumo, kinine moloa aselo. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:76">Lug 1.76</ref></char></note>Auluso, auba aulualenaga, mau eneyone gili dedalelu? <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> uleno babiyone dedalelubile? Ee, amone saaba sulu na gilifea eweguba selesu, saaba ofolo ewehe, saaba ofolo noolo wasolu labe. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>Inolo ewe iminisiamo, Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 7:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">‘Bama. Nahe Ne sulu saaba sigimesi dia ano inolomo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">Ga saminiba malesi hilibaiyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">Edale abia, Ga malesi, eno felaba madeneyobafe.’</char><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, helefealu iwi kakinabu idele inolo aleba ami, inolo ulenohe Hano Gelo Yone wasoluale. Auluso, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone ili aleba ami, widale wedino labe amohe, Yone wasolu labe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lug 3.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo ilida, dagese dilo inolo nooloda, ilihe Yesu sulu selefe amo dofasia, ili eeba selesia, “Godene manamo isolu koleba.” Maumo, ili Yone alefasia <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelune</char> auba solu. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mad 21.32</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilida, muguli manane dawalolo ilida, Yonefea ili hano waagi geba waalemaba solualegulu, Godehe ilifea molomesi daiyalumo faiso melu.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Idele inolo aga saabe ewene manamo, Na ili amo halaguluba iminiba dedeba saeyobi? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Na eweguba dedeba selesu. Faibe deseine magede ofola helea ami kakainafia ligia, faibe noolo anogofea eweguba wuaaba selefe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 7:32" />
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Nini alefasia, gili ibamesisia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">suulu gelelu feeba galaluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">gili ibasale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">Aufia, nini alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">gili yegilimesisia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">yanolu gasa soluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">gili yegilisale.’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 7:32" />
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 7:32">Idele inolo aga saabe ili amo, faibe deseine amogulu labe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Auba safasia, Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Hano Gelo Yonemo, <char style="w" lemma="Boledi">boledidai</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaelene mana naiyo boledi hilia sunia nolo. Auluso, Yone e hele falaiya ami naiyo isafia nolo. Aufia, hilia noolo e naiyo aiyalo.</char></note> <char style="w">waini</char> hanodai, nabale adabia mulune, gilihe selesia, efea <char style="w">gamodo</char> labeba selefe. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:2">Lug 15.2</ref></char></note>Aufia, agamo <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> naiyoda hanoda nalabia saabimo, gili selesia, ‘Bama, E inolo naiyoda, waini hanoda, wedinale galibaleleba noloba selefe.’ Aufia gilihe E saaba sulu selesiamo, ‘Ogomo, dagese dilodai, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolodai, damene adefeba’ selefe. <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Auluso, idele inolo Godene dawalolo dife amomo, olaibo kegele moloba walelo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wolu mololo ido ulenohe Yesune emofea walea hano sagalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />
    <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo ulenohe, Yesumo edai naiyo naiyone milasia sigilu. Ausi, Yesu E Falisi amone moloa naiyo naiyone yoba asulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mad 26.7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mag 14.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yon 12.3</ref></char></note> Dauno amone <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> ido ulenohe, Yesu E Falisine moloa naiyo naafeba solu dubulu. Auba dofasia, ehe abane bodolo yogolelumo walea kasineda selumo dibia, molosu ami suga mulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Aufia, e-mo Yesu faisa yoba ligia, yeeba alolu. E yeesia, ene si hanomo, Yesune emo saabia dudulusi, ene guni aluhe heeba dafulu. Aufia, ehe Ene emomo mimifasia, walea kasineda amo difasia, Ene emo saabia sagafia heelu.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Falisi inolo Yesuda sigilu amohe, kegele ido amo molofemo bisigia, eweguba keleba hiliselu. E ene meleba hilisesia, “Inolo ewe seale <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolobiaga, amo ehe eda gefemo abebiba asigisia, ido ewe amogulububa hilisebaiyo. Amo ehe ido amo wolu mololo ido labebuba asigibaiyo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Falisi inolo auba hiliseba labi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Saimono,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Falisi inolo Yesuda naiyo naiyone milesi sigilu amo, ene wimo Saimono. </char></note> ga doma. Na sulu uleno gafea saaba mesu.” Ausi, Saimono selesia, “Walelo, Ga saama.” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu selesia, “Inolo aidahe inolo ulefea dano dulu. Nomo, mole dinaliase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mole dinaliase </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ulemo, hilia ulene dabalu molofe amone elebe.</char></note> fula bia (500) dano ofelesi, nomo, mole dinaliase daabuluba bia (50) dano ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Aaluhe aine dano ufulumo obegeba meyodoluale adesi, inolo aalufea danoda melu amo ehe, kanulusia, aalufea waagi hamaleba solu. Aulugulu, inolo aida amone aleba amimo, abe koleba inolo amofea waseba hameseyobafe?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Yesu auba selesi, Saimono obegeba selesia, “Na amogulubileba hilisesia, inolo dano bule ufuluda afolumo, e-buba hilisesu.” Ausi, Yesu efea selesia, “Ga isoba osolafia, heda obegeba selefe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Aufia Yesu E ido amofealo baaba anogofia ligia, Saimonofea selesia, “Ga ido ewe besela? Na ge moloa sobele muluso, ga Ne emo nuguma heeyone hano, Nafea wasiba mesale. Auluso, ido ewe ene si hanohe Ne emo nuguma heeso. Aufia, ene guni aluhe falamesi heeso. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ga Nafea mimisale. Auluso, ido ewemo, Nada suga muliya amifia, agamo Ne emo mimiyone afelesale. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Gahe <char style="w" lemma="Olifi">olifine</char> walea difasia, Ne guni saabia sagaba ofelesale. Auluso, ido ewehe walea kasineda difasia, Ne emo saabia sagasia heeso. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Aulune, Na gafea selesu, ido ewene <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> wedinale e mololumo heesia galilu labe. Bama. Ene hameselo mana Nafea bule molofe amohe, ene wolumo <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galiluba</char> walefe. Auluso, inolo wolu wedino heesia galilu labe amo ehe, Godefea sabe wedino hamesefe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sulu amone kiwimo ewe: Godehe inolo wolu buleda mololu heesia galilumo e, e Gode bule hamesefe. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ausi, Yesuhe ido amofea selesia, “Ge wolumo hamasia heesia galiba yaalu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Inolo noolo ailaiya ami E galiba kakainalumo, ine geleba eweguba solu. “Inolo ewe halagulune wolu hamasia heesia galisuba selefe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:48">Lug 8.48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:42">18.42</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe ido amofea selesia, “Ge <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogo alefasia, ga <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulu</char>. Ga <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealodai</char> malale.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Idele noolohe Yesu sagoba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Amone faisamo, Yesu E dauno wedinalemo goayo, aufia mosomu wedinalemo goayo, aulabia abia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone awalu sulu nafulu walelabia siba alolu. Ene walelu faibili hugulubamo E galiba siba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mad 27.55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Mag 15.40-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Lug 23.49</ref></char></note>Aufia, asubane woluda alolu asigaba yaalu idele noolo ili amoda, walefa waiba waalelu idele noolo ili amoda, ilida E galiba siba alolu. Ulenomo, Magadala ido, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[2]], Magadala ido">Malia</char>. Samini Yesuhe asubane wolu domoba efea alolumo asigaba dafulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Aufia, Yoanada, Susanada, idele wedinale nooloda, e galiba dedalelu. Yoana e Kusane eamono. Kusa e-mo, kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodone</char> molo yasilo. Idele ili amohe, ine kegele amonesu meba ligia, Yesufeada, Ene walelu faibilifeada, sagoba ofolaba ado.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe widi sebe fifilumone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:3-34">Madiyu 13.3-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:3-30">Maga 4.3-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Idele inolo dauno nooloba noolobaba amifia inigia, Yesu labea milibaisi, idele inolo wamili wedinalemo gagaiyofia labi, Ehe besi sulu uleno ilifea eweguba solu. <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Inolo uleno abia, widi sebe geiya fifilu. Ehe fifilabia abia, widi sebe noolomo eno kia hodobaisalu. Ausi, inolo emelaba abunusi, haga diba mololu. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ausi, widi sebe noolomo, hele abane feaba dobia ami hodobaisalu. Widi soboluso, hano male adesia, ene sememo falaba disi bausolu. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ausi, widi sebe noolomo didigane aleba hodobaisalu. Didiganedai, wididai, aalufaba sobosia, didiganehe widimo mabulabia felaba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ausi, widi sebe noolomo hele nafuluiya hodobaisalu. Widi amo sobofasia, sebe wedinale helelesia, noolomo, daabulubasu daabulubaba (100) helelelu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesuhe besi sulu amo safasia, E koleba wuaasia selesia, “Inolo sulu dubiyone konenida ga, doma!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe E besi sulu solumo, amone maumo, enebiba doba abulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Ais 6.9-10</ref></char></note>Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone sulu mau mugusilu ufulu amo, Godehe gili waagi dawaloba dimesi gadefabu. Auluso, idele inolo noolofeamo Na besi sulusu sodo. Na ilifea besi sulusu sodo amone maumo, ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 8:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="qt">Ilimo beabasu ligiaso,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="qt">fadaba babiyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ilimo dobolabasu ligiaso,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="qt">fadaba asigiba diyobafale.</char>”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Aufia, Yesuhe selesia, “Besi sulu amone kiwimo ewe. Widi sebe amogulumo, Godene sulu mana. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Widi sebe eno kia hodobaisalu amogulumo, idele inolo Godene sulu mana dubuluso, <char style="w">henane</char> inigia, Godene sulu mana ine libo dobumo dibia ano. Ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Godehe ili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dimesialefia</char>, henane auba aulo. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Aufia, widi sebe abane feaba dobia hodobaisalu amogulumo, idele inolo amo Godene sulu mana doba difasia, henefia labeso, ili amo widi seme hele usu sugaluale labi, dedeba babiyo holobagasimo, ili gelebaisalo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Aufia, widi sebe didigane aleba hodobaisalu amogulumo, ili Godene sulu mana dofasia, dedaleloso, helefealune keleba hiliseloda, elebe kegeleda, henelo kegeleda, amohe ili mabulabia felasi, Godene sulu mana nafuluba kuliba anale. Ili amo sebe helefasia, nafuluba genelale amogulu labe. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Auluso, widi sebe hele nafuluiya hodobaisalu amogulumo, ili idele inolohe Godene sulu mana dofasia, nafuluba fedoba selo amogulu labe. Ine libomo, isolu ligia, fufuulu mana molosia, kiwi sanefia afelesiale, daabasu adomone sebe helelelo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naafamo ulufa yaaba ofolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maga 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mad 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lug 11.33</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Inolohe naafa yaafia, gofo usu me molobu sisa ofolale. Aubale. Inolo ili molosu suga saabe amohe, yane amo bamesifia, naafa yaafia, ailalu saabia diba ofolo. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mad 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lug 12.2</ref></char></note>Kegele sunia muguba dobumo, dufia ulufaba ufiyobafe. Aufia, kegele sunia inolohe gasiagufia labemo, dufia ulufasi, idele inolo suniahe fadaba babiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mad 25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lug 19.26</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gilihe sulu dobelesiamo, nafuluba domale. Inolo abehe kegeleda sefia labemo, efea saabia noolo gegoaba meyobafe. Auluso, inolo kegeleda sebale labemo, kegele wedino e sebuba hilisefe amoda, efea sagoba diyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune enaedai elewodalimo, abe?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Madiyu 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maga 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ausi, Yesune enaeda, elewodalida, ilimo Yesu babiyone milibailu. Auluso, idele inolo wamili gagaiyofia labi, ilimo E hagoaleba maiyodoluale alolu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Inolo nohe Yesufea selesia, “Ge gaeda, Ge gelewodalida, Ga babiyone milibaifia, idele inolo wamilimone faisalo alebaibu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Auba selesi, Ehe obegeba selesia, “Godene sulu mana dofasia kuliba aafe mosomu ili amosu, Ne naedali, Ne nelewodali labe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe mogaifo bule mulumo gadaeamalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Madiyu 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maga 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Hilia uleno, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Nini waiyo galulu nolobalo anogolo segeba aasuba” solu. Aufia, ili hano kasu wedino uleno kakainaba lagofia daalu. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Hano kasu daaba labi, Yesu E hanefia alolu. Ausi, mogaifo bule waiyo galulu saabia dowesia, hano kasumo hano wasigaeyo weiyaasia, ili daneyo weiyaalu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ausi, walelu faibilihe Yesu gilasia selesia, “Yasilo! Yasilo! Nini gifiaeyo weiyaafe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Ausi, E degefia, mogaifodai hano bule fufulelumodaifea halaleba solu. Ausi, mogaifomo gelesi, hanoda haiba gadaealu. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogo, wagi dobu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Auba molofe bisigia, ili sagilisia momoleba hiliseba yaalu. Aufia, ili ine geleba eweguba selaba yaalu, “Inolo ewe koleba abebi? Ehe mogaifodai hanodaifea kiwigaaba selesi, aalu dobolo besela?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe gamodo inolo ulenofea adaaba yaalumo aisalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Madiyu 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maga 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Ausi, Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili hano kasu abia, Gelasa helea daalu. Hele amo Galili waiyo galulu segeba nolobalo anogolo dobu. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ili hano egewi sugaba adaaba yaasi, bosolufalumo, dauno amone inolo uleno, <char style="w">gamodo</char> nooloda felalu amo, ilidai mi gagiba goalu. Saminifia, inigia agamo, e fagulo kaabale ligia, moloa aselale. E inolo baliyasu aselo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Inolo amo Yesu eloba bisigia, e koleba galagilifia, Yesune emo aniba sauba hanelu. Aufia, e sogaaba selesia, “Gode Ana Labe Lagone Faibemo, Yesu Ga! Ga nafea ene moloyo hamefe? Ga nafea naga memabiyo koleba.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />E auba wuaaba solu, mau enebamo, Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane wolu">asubane wolufea</char> inolo amo gadefia dedaleba yaamaba solu. Gamodo wolu amohe inolo amo fogo selale seba asulubiyo. Saminimo, inolo eda luba ado ilihe, ene sonedai emodaimo seini dofaba waalefia, ilihe e yasiba adobiyo. Auluso, ehe seini amo sunia gegeleba dafalilobiyo. Aufia, asubane wolu amohe, inolo amo inoloda maleiya helea ami kiwigagaba dibia silobiyo.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Ausi, Yesu efea selesia, “Ga wi abe?” E obegeba selesia, “Ne wimo, Yobolo Inolo Wedinale.” Maumo, gamodo wedinalemo efea alolu. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ausi, gamodo ilihe Yesufea susiba koleba selesia, “Gahe nini hele gogolu ulumaluda male sugamaba samabu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ili aloiya hagoaleba ami, dofene sogolugalu wedinalemo hele kaufealomo ami naiyo nabaiba alolu. Ausi, gamodo ilihe Yesufea susiba selesia, “Gahe nini dofene ili anogofea sugamaba saamaleyobile?” Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea waagi fogo melu. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ausi, gamodo ilihe inolo amo afasia, dofenefea suga dedalelu. Ausi, dofene sogolugalu ili amo kiwigagaba naguba dedalesia, waiyo galulu egewine sailafealomo subaisalu. Aufia, ili waiyo usu subaisasia, gifiaba danelu.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ausi, dofeneda luba ado ili amo, molofe amo baafia, dedalesia, dauno ami kakainalu amofea sulu amo saaba sigilu. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Ausi, amene kegele koleba holobagalulaba, idele inolo ili babiyone milibailu. Ili Yesu labea goasia, bosolufalumo, gamodomo inolo amofea adaaba yaalumo gadefia dedalelu abulu. Ausi, e asigi saabi, fagulo kaafia, Yesune emo aniba yoba saabi abulu. Idele inolo ilihe amone bisigia, sagililu. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Auba molosi si abulu ilihe, Yesuhe <char style="w">gamodo</char> halaguba asigaba dafelesi abulu amone, idele inolofea awaba melu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ausi, Gelasa fogoba asulu idele inolo sunia Yesuhe mololumone, bule sagilisia, ilihe Yesufea kiwigaaba selesia, “Ga nini gadefia mala.” Auba selesi, Yesuda ili hele amo gadefia maiyone hano kasu kakainaba lagolu. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Auluso, gamododa alolu asigaba dafulu inolo amo doba bisigia, nada Ga galiba maiyobileba susiba doba abulu. Auluso, Yesuhe e malalelu. <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />Malalesia, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Moloa obegeba abia, Godehe gafea mololu amo saeyo malale.” Ausi, e moloa obegeba abia, Yesuhe efea mololu amo, ene dauno idele inolo suniafea saaba sigilu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe ido sino hulu sugalumo waiba ofasia, ido faibe olalumo degeba ifolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Madiyu 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maga 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Aufia, Yesu E hano galulu nolobalofia, obegeba segeba saabi, idele inolo wamili suniahe E milesi yasiba alolune, ili E saabi henelu. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Aufia, inolo uleno E labea goalu. Inolo amo, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molone</char> yasilo. Ene wi, Yailusu. E milifasia, Yesu aniba sauba hanefia, ehe Yesumo ene moloa milesiba susilu. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Maumo, ene ido faibe ulelu, hamu huguluba alolumo, olaeyo weiyaasi aulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Aufia, Yesu E inolo Yailusu amodai ene moloa aasi, idele inolo wamili wedinale E galiba fuluba abia, dedeleba daalu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ausi, ido uleno sino hulu daaba ligia, hamu huguluba gelelale alolumo, eda wamili aleba ami daaba alolu. Dogodahe ene walefamo waimesisia, ene kegele suniada, moleda weaseluso, ulenohe e waiba ufiyodoluale alolu. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ido amo Yesu faisalo inigia, ehe Yesune fagulo selale haisimo sone geba golu. E auba gesi, alebale hamagi, ibi miliba alolumo, gadaeasia elolu.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Na abe gefe?” Ausi, ili sunia selesia, “Nini gelualeba” selaba yaasi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> selesia, “Yasilo, idele inolo wamili wedinalehe Ga hegoba galisia dedelebune aufe.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Auluso, Yesu selesia, “Uleno Na gelubu. Na hilisesia, kiwigagalu noolo Nafea alolumo aasi bosolu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ido amohe eloba bisigia, e muguba miliyodolualebuba eloba abulu. Aufia, e bibililabia inigia, Yesune emo sisa sauba hanelu. Aufia, idele inolo suniane si saabia, ehe Yesune fagulo gelumone mau fadaba solu. Aufia, e selesia, “Ne walefamo alebale yagi waife.” <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:50">Lug 7.50</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe ido amofea selesia, “Neleweli, ge <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogohe, ga waiba ofelefe. Ga <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealodai</char> malale.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu auba sulu selaba labi, bosolufalumo, inolo uleno Yailusune molo afasia mulu. Ehe Yailusufea selesia, “Ge gelewelimo ama olalume. Aulune, hama. Ga Walelofea higinilu saabia no memabu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesuhe amone dofasia, Yailusufea selesia, “Ga sagilimabu. <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">Asigi ule homa</char>. Ge geleweli waiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Aufia, Yesu E Yailusune moloa goasia, Ehe idele inolo noolomo E galiba molo usu sugamabulu. Ehe Fidada, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, aufia ido faibe amone enaedai, enaodai, ili amosu, Edai molo usu waagi suga malesi gadefalu. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Fogo amo, idele inolo molosu kakainalu amo, ili kuanosia, yegilisia waalelu. Auluso, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Hama! Gili yegilimabu. E olaluale. E hanefia labe.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Auba selesi, ilihe E baaba galulu. Maumo, ilihe ido faibe amo olalu dobuba asigibu. <figure style="fig" alt="Healing Jairus' daughter" file="42_Lk_08_37_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="8.49-56">Yesuhe Yailusune eleweli olalumo degeba ifofe.</figure><verse eid="LUK 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Auluso, Yesu E elalolu usu sugafia, ido faibe amone sone sefia selesia, “Neleweli, ga degema.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ausi, ido faibe amone asubanemo enefea obegesi, e alebale hamagi degelu. Ausi, enaedai enaodai wobasubale hidigisia momolelu. Yesuhe aalufea selesia, “Efea naiyo namenesi mema.” <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Aufia, Ehe aalufea eweguba solu. “Kegele mololu ewene, aali inolo ulenofeada saaba memabiyo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe hilibaisi daalu faibili huguluba amofea dabalu melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Madiyu 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maga 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesuhe inolo hugulubamo weba gagaiyofia, Ehe ilifea <char style="w">gamodo</char> sunia aisaba yaeyoneda, aufia walefalu waiba waaleyoneda, wida solu kiwida melu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Aufia, Ehe ili malalesiamo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone saamesisia, aufia walefa idele inolo waiba waalemesifia, hilibailu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lug 10.4-11</ref></char></note>Auba hilibaisiamo, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gili abiamo, kegele ulenoda sebale malale. Kaidamoda, aluda, <char style="w" lemma="Boledi">boledida</char>, moleda, saligalo hulianeda, sebale malale. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Aufia, gili hele uleno goasiamo, molo uleno sugasenaga, gili molo amisu hanebasu ligia, gili hele nolobalo abiamo, molo amo hamale. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Aufia, dauno ulenone idele inolo ilihe gili heneba uluba disalenaga, amo gili dauno amo gadefia malale. Gili hele amo gadefia maiyo ligiamo, helesao ge emofea baabugo fifiba dafogomale. Ilihe ine mololumo heleba mololuba asigimesi.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuda ilihe ine mana kuliba abia, helesao ine emofea baabumo fifiba dafelesuba sodomo, gine mana wolu mololumo ninifea baabualesia sodo.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Auba saafia, ili hilibaisi, walelu faibili ili mosomu no goayo, no goayo labia abia, awalu sulu nafulu walelabia, walefalu idele inolo waiba waalelabia dedalelu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helodohe Yesu abelaba fadaba asigiyo hamelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Madiyu 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Maga 6.14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mad 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mag 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lug 9.19</ref></char>
    </note>Kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodohe</char> kegele Yesuhe mololumone dofasia, e bule elawanelu. Maumo, inolo noolo selesia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> olalumo degelububa solu. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Ausi, noolo selesia, Elaiya holobagalububa solu. Aufia, noolo selesia, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> amakele olalumo degefia labebuba solu. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:8">Lug 23.8</ref></char></note>Ausi, Helodo selesia, “Nahe Yone gifogolo geleba dafulugulu, inolo kegele ewegulu molofeba selesi dobelesu ewemo, abebi?” Ausia, ehe Yesu babiyo weiyaalu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo wamili saii biafea naiyo melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Madiyu 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maga 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yone 6.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />
    <char style="w">Hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ili obegesia, kegele sunia ili mololumo Yesufea awaba melu. Ausi, Yesuhe ili uluba difasia, idele inolo waagi gadefia, ilibisu dauno uleno, amone wi Besaida ami daalu. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Auluso, idele inolo wamili ilihe Yesu E ami daalububa eloba baafia, ili Eda daaiya ami dedalelu. Ilimo E labea milibaisi, Yesuhe ili heneba uluba dulu. Aufia, Ehe ilifea Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone saaba melu. Aufia, walefalu idele inolomo, Ehe waiba waalelu.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Geidesi, walelu faibili huguluba ili Yesu labea milibaifia, Efea selesia, “Gahe idele inolo ogo mosomu moloa hagoaleba dedaleba yaasia, naiyodai, haneyo molodai, isaeyone malama. Enebamo, ninida aga lolu ewe, hele inoloda maleiya lolu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ausi, Ehe obegeba selesia, “Ili ogofea naiyo namenesi, gine meba yaama.” Ausi, ili selesia, “Nini <char style="w">boledi</char> bia, hani aida amosu sebu. Idele inolo wamili ogone naiyo naiyomo, nini elegeyo malesi hamefela?”<verse eid="LUK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Inolomo saii bia (5,000) amogulu alolu. Ausi, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Gilihe ili ogo, daabulubasu bia biaba, kakainamaba saama.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Ene walelu faibilihe ilifea auba selesi, idele inolo sunia auba kakainaba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Ausi, Yesuhe boledi bia amoda, hani aida amoda, difasia, <char style="w">hebene</char> sidaba lagofia, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, amo gogolefia, Ene walelu faibilifea mesi, ilihe idele inolofea sagaba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Ausi, ili sunia nabaisia kubaleba yaalu. Ausi, ili kubalesia haisi afelefemo, alu hugulubamo sefia wasigaaba waalelu. <figure style="fig" alt="The feeding of the 5,000" file="42_Lk_09_13_RG.jpg" size="col" copy="Sweet Publishing (c)" ref="9.12-17">Yesune walelu faibilihe naiyomo idele inolofea sagaba yaafe.</figure><verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Yesumo ewebuba ulufalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Madiyu 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maga 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Hilia uleno, Yesu E elebi Godedai sulu selaba ligia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char> Edai labi, Ehe ilifea doba bisigia, “Idele inolo wamili ili selesiamo, na abeba selefe?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Lug 9.7-8</ref></char></note>Ili obegeba selesia, “Noolomo, ga <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yoneba</char> selefe. Noolomo, ga Elaiyaba selefe. Aufia noolomo, ga <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo uleno samini alolumone, olafia haiba degelu amobuba selefe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yon 6.68-69</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ehe ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Auluso, gili koleba, Na abeba selese?” Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> obegeba selesia, “<char style="w">Keliso</char>, Gode iminifia hilibailu amo, Ga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe e olafia haiba degeyoba saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Madiyu 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maga 8.30–9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Fida auba selesi, Yesuhe kiwigaaba Ene walelu faibilifea kaaba selesia, “Inolo ulenofea Na amobuba ulufaba samabiyo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:44">Lug 9.44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:32-33">18.32-33</ref></char></note>Auba saafia, E selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> naga wedinale diyo dobumo, guni inolo ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolo</char> inolo ilida, ilihe E faiso mesia, E dufa olaeyobafe. Aufia, hilia osolo ami, E <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobafe</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mad 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lug 14.27</ref></char>
    </note>Auba safasia, Ehe idele inolo suniafea selesia, “Inolo ulenohe Na kuliba miyo hamesenaga, ene hamemo dufa dafogofia, hilia sunia ene <char style="w">imolane</char> ene digifia, e koleba Na kuliba milale. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mad 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lug 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yon 12.25</ref></char></note>Uleno abehe, ene miliyolu <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyo</char> hilisesenaga, amo daba dafiyobafe. Auluso, uleno abehe, Na hilisesia, ene miliyolu weasesenaga, amo e ene miliyolu gasiba dafelagoba diyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe helefealune kegele sunia difasia, sefia ligia, ene miliyolumo woba dafelesia, daba dafelesenaga, kegele sunia e dulu amohe, e halaguba sagoba ufiyobafebi? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mad 10.33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Lug 12.9</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe Nafeada, Ne sulufeada, baaba yuasenaga, amo dufiamo, Inololene Faibe Ene yane <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleluda</char>, Enaone yane elaleluda, Godene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> sulu dia ano amone yane elaleluda, saabe fogo ami, Ehe inolo amo baaba sabe yuaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Na seale gilifea selesu, inolo noolo aga iwi labemo, aso olabale ligia, amo ilihe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo babiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune domalamo noekene elalesi abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Madiyu 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maga 9.2-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Yesuhe sulu ewe safasia, hilia aaiyoba alefasia labi, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, uluba difasia, galea lagi Godedai sulu saeyofia felalu. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />E Godedai sulu selaba labi, Ene olegi dedegesi, Ene fagulomo yabagelesia neeba sigilu amogulu adesia, hoolu noekene holobagalu. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ausi, bosolufalumo, inolo aida, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesedai</char>, Elaiyadaimo holobagafia, Yesudai sulu selaba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9.22</ref></char></note>Aalu Godene yane <char style="w">elalelu</char> amodai holobagafia, kegele noolo Yesuhe Yelusalame ami moloba samodofasia, gadefia maiyobafe amone selaba alolu.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:16-18">2Fid 1.16-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Fidada, walelu faibe aidamoda, si higinisia hanefia alolu. Aufia, ili haiba degesia, bosolufalumo, ilihe Yesune elalelu amone bisigia, inolo aidamoda Edai degeba labi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Aufia, Mosesedai. Elaiyadai, Yesu gadefia maiyo adesi, Fidahe Yesufea selesia, “Yasilo, nini iwi lolu ewemo, nafulubu. Ninihe hisuba misiyone molo wedino osoloa iwi diyoba. Ulenomo, Ge, ulenomo, Mosesene, aufia ulenomo, Elaiyane.” Fidahe sulu auba solumo, babeafia ligia solu.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Fidahe sulu amo aso selaba labi, kene uleno inigia, ili gasiagusi, ili sagililu. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lug 3.22</ref></char></note>Sulu goo uleno kene usu amifia selesia, “Ewe Ne Naalo. Nahe E Ne dabalu molomesi molobebelelu. Gilihe Ene sulu domale.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Sulu auba saaba samodosi, Yesu elebi labi abulu. Walelu faibili ilihe kegele ili abulumo, fogo ami ulenofea saaba mesiale, ilibisu hilisefia alolu.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe faibe uleno asubane wolu alolu waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Madiyu 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maga 9.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Adigi keafa, Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili gale amo afasia suga saabi, idele inolo wamilihe E wakalilu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ausi, inolo uleno eweguba saaba dafelagolu. “Walelo, Ga koleba ne faibe bamesi hamefe, e-mo ne faibe ulelu hamaga. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Hilia wedinale asubane wolu uleno efea sugasi, alebale koleba e wobasubale galagiliba ado. Aufia, asubane wolu amohe e bibiliba ofelesi, ene mofe enomo subu holobagagalo. Asubane wolu ewehe ene domala woba ofelesia, fogo wedinoda e gadefia maiyale hamelo. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nahe ge <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> asigamesi susiba soluso, ili alefasia asubane wolu amo asigaeyodoluale adeso.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Asigi ule ufuluale, heleba ano mosomu, gili! Na gilifea habofia ligia, aso fogo halaguba waagi gilidai miliyobi? Na gili gadefia daabale ligia, fogo halaguba aso miliyobi? Ge faibe ogo Na labea iwi lubia mila.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Ausi, faibe amo Yesu labea saabimo, <char style="w">gamodo</char> amohe e helea dowesia wobasubale bibiliba ufulu. Auluso, Yesuhe <char style="w">asubane wolu</char> amofea halaleba saafia, faibe amo waiba ofelesi, ene enaofea obegeba melu. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ausi, idele inolo suniahe Godene kiwigagalu amo baafia, ili wobasubale momoleba yaalu.<verse eid="LUK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu aganebo saabia selesia, E olaeyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Madiyu 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maga 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili suniahe Yesu kegele sunia mololumo amone momoleba yaaba labi, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Gili koleba sulu Na saeyobasu ewefea nafuluba koneni kimale. Ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> holonofia, inolone sone saabia ufiyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:34">Lug 18.34</ref></char></note>Auluso, walelu faibili ilihe sulu amone mau nafuluba fadaba abuluale. Sulu ewene sisamo ilifea muguba ufulune, ili nafuluba fadaba duluale. Ausi, Ehe ilifea sulu amone sawaba samesi, Efea doba babiyomo sagililu.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olaibomo, abe koleba?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Madiyu 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maga 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lug 22.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, walelu faibili ili hegesia, ili aleba ami olaibo koleba abesia hegelu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ausi, Yesuhe ili asigife amo baafia, Ehe faibedeno uleno milafia, E aniba yoba melalu. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mad 10.40</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ehe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Uleno abehe, Na asigisia, faibe deseine ewegulu heneba uluba disenaga, amo ehe Na heneba uluba dife. Inolo abehe Na heneba uluba difemo, Nada hilibailu amoda heneba uluba dife. Inolo gili suniane aleba ugi, wedino koleba wida male labemo amo, e olaibo labe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo gilidai gisa adefale amo e gine damene labe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maga 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonehe</char> Yesune sulu dofasia, Efea selesia, “Yasilo, inolo ulenohe asubane wolumo Ge wi saaba asigaba labi, nini abulu. Auluso, e-mo nini kuliba saabale. Aulune, ninihe e kaeyo weiyaalu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mad 12.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Lug 11.23</ref></char></note>Auluso, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Gilihe e kaamabu. Inolo gilidai gisa adefalemo, amo gine damene labe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samalia ilihe Yesu ine helea milabusia kaalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Godehe Yesu E hebene dia maiyo hagoale adesi, Yesu E Yelusalame koleba maiyoba hiliselu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ausi, Ehe inolo noolo saminiba malasi, ilihe Ene kegele madeneba ufiyo abia, Samalia mosomu uleno sugalu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Auluso, inolo mosomu ami asulu ili amohe, Yesu E ine moloa milesi hameluale. E-mo Yelusalame maiyone aafesia aulu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2Kin 1.9-16</ref></char></note><char style="w">Walelu faibe</char> aida, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesedai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedaihe</char>, Samaliane mana amo baafia, aaluhe Yesufea doba bisigia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ninihe de <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> suga inigia ili somesi saeyobile? Ga auba hamefela?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Auluso, Yesuhe nolofia, aalufea selesia, “Auba aumabuba” halaleba solu. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Aufia, Yesuda ili mosomu nolobalo dedalelu.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe E kuliba miyone mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Madiyu 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili eno aiba daaba labi, inolo uleno inigia, Efea selesia, “Hele sunia Gada maiyo aafeamo, nada Ga kuliba miyobasu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Selibo geso ilimo, hele kaleba hanelo eno dobu. Aufia, haga ilimo, molo adaaba yaabu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char>, haneyone guni ufiyo hele male.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Aufia, Yesuhe inolo nofea selesia, “Ga Na kuliba mila.” Auluso, inolo amo obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, nadale ne nao baliba ufiyone, Ga nafea waagi malaba saamaleyobile?” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Hama, olalu ilimo, olalu mosomu ine geleba baliba waaleyo dobu. Auluso, ga-mo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone sulu mana waleyo malale.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.61 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1Kin 19.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo nomohe Yesufea selesia, “Saminilo, na ga kuliba miyo hamefe. Auluso, nadale abia, ne damenedalifea hawiyoba saeyo maiyone, Ga nafea waagi malesi fogo memaleyobile?”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Inolo saminiba lubia aafe amohe, hilia sunia, nolofia faisalo besiba beabia aasenaga, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone dabalu moloyodoluale dobu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo daabuluba domobafia aida Ene dabalu moloyo malesi hilibailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:7">Mag 6.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dufia, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> inolo daabuluba domobafia aidamo (72) iminifia, Ehe ili amo hele sunia Eda maiyofealo amolo, ili amodale aida aidaba saminiba malasia hilibaisalu. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mad 9.37-38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:35">Yon 4.35</ref></char></note>Ehe ilifea selesia, “Edo geiya sebe wedinale gegenelu heleleba yaabuso, amone suba miliyone dabalu mololo inolo bilalebu. Aulugulu, gelu enaohe dabalu mololo inolo sebe amone suiyone hilibaimesi, gilihe Efea haalimale. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mad 10.16</ref></char></note>Gili malale. Nahe gili dofene sibi edogulu selibo geso adaaba yaabia aleba ami dafalibagosu. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mad 10.7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mag 6.8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lug 9.3-5</ref></char></note>Gilihe mole selo samoloda, aluda, samagada, sefia malabiyo. Aufia, gilihe idele inolo eno kia wakaliba yaasi, gili kalugaafia ilidai sulu samabiyo.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Aulugulu, gili molo uleno sugasia, gilihe maugaba ewegubadale saamale. ‘Molo usu ewe <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo</char> miliyobafe.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Aulugulu, gilihe aealo inolo uleno molo amo saabi besenaga, amo gine aealo amo efea miliyobafe. Auluso, inolo amogulu malenaga, aealo amo ginefea obegeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:6-14">1Kld 9.6-14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Dim 5.18</ref></char></note>Gili molo ule amisu mesale. Gilihe naiyodai hanodai ili gilifea mefemo namenale. Enebamo, dabaluda molofemo ene elebe diyo dobu. Aufia, gili molo nonoba simabiyo.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:27">1Kld 10.27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili dauno uleno goasi, ilihe gili ine moloa heneba luba disenaga, amo naiyo ilihe osolafia, gilifea mefemo namenale. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Gilihe dauno ami walefalu waalebumo, waiba waalemale. Aufia, gilihe Godene sulu mana ilifea selesiamo, ‘Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo mulu hagoale labeba’ saamale. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Auluso, gili dauno uleno sugasi, ilihe gili ine moloa heneba uluba disalenaga, gili dauno amone eno kia ligia, eweguba saamale. <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">HD 13.51</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">18.6</ref></char></note>‘Gine dauno ewene helesao nine emofea baalu amoda, ninihe ginefea fifiba dafelesu. Auluso, gili nafuluba eweguba hilisemale. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo mulu hagoale labe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:24-25">Stt 19.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mad 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">11.24</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesu selesia, “Na gilifea selesu, Godehe iminilu hilia adesimo, dauno amone idele inolone higinilu diyobafe amohe, <char style="w">Sodomo</char> idele inolo diyobafemo waseba suniaeyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo asigi besifale ili amofea woba ufiyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Madiyu 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Yeele! Kolasini dauno ga, gafea woba ufiyobafe! Yeele! Besaida dauno ga, gafea woba ufiyobafe! Enebamo, gili aleba ami, Nahe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> wedinale mololuso, gili asigi ule ofelesale. Nahe yau mosomune sidi aida, Dailadai, Saidonodai, aleba ami momolelu kegele auba mololubiaga, amo ili yagunagalo fagulo kakafia, dose heefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besibaiyo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:29-31">1Kin 16.29-31</ref> </char></note>Auluso, gili doma. Osolaeyone hilia adesimo, higinilu gilifea holobagaeyobafe amohe Dailadai, Saidonodai, higinilu diyobafemo, wasolu koleba miliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Aufia, Kafanima dauno ga, gili <char style="w">hebene</char> lago koleba digi dibia felaeyobafeba hilisefela? Felaeyobafale koleba. Gili koleba daneba yaalu yasiba ada ami sugaeyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mad 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lug 9.48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:23">Yon 5.23</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Inolo gine sulu dobelefemo, ilihe Ne suluda dobelefe. Aufia, inolo gilifea faiso mefe amohe, Nafeada faiso mefe. Aufia, inolo Nafea faiso mefe amohe, Nada hilibailu amofeada faiso mefe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo daabuluba domobafia aidamo haiba obegeba milibailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Dufia, inolo daabuluba domobafia aida (72) Yesuhe hilibaisalu ilimo heneba obegeba milibaisia, selesia, “Saminilo, ninihe Ge wi selesimo, asubane wolu ilida nini sisa adeso.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:31">Yon 12.31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:8-9">MUU 12.8-9</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenemo</char> <char style="w">hebene</char> afasia, yabagelesi yane neeba sigiloguba, huga saabi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Sng 91.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:18">Mag 16.18</ref></char></note>Bama! Soiyeda, maideganada, gine emohe abunuyonesia, gisane kiwigagalu sunia dufa dafogosia kaamo miliyone, Nahe gilifea kiwi melu. Ausi, kegele ulenohe gili woba ufiyobafale. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:3">Fil 4.3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:5">MUU 3.5</ref></char></note>Auluso, asubane wolu ilimo gili sisa adefesia heneba samabiyo. Aubale. Gine wimo hebene lagi Gode Ene Miliyolu Miliyo Bugo seleba dobu amone henemale.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E henefasia, Enao Godedai henelu sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Madiyu 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Fogo amoyamohe, Yesune libomo <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekenemohe</char> nokene heneba ofelesi, E selesia, “Nao, Ga <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenedai</char> helefealudaine Saminilo labene, Na Ge wi digisu. Mau enebamo, Gahe kegele ewemo dawalolo inoloda, asigilo inoloda, ilifea muguba ufuluso, Gahe inolo faibe deseinegulu labe ili amofea, ulufaba walefe. Seale, Nao, Ga auba mololumo, Gene heneyone mololu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yon 3.35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10.15</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Ne Naohe kegele sunia Ne sone saabia ufulubiyo. Inolo ulenohe Faibe ewe amobuba hilisebualeso, Enao Elebisu Faibe hilisebu. Ausi, inolo ulenohe Nao ewe amobuba hilisebualeso, Faibe Elebisu Enao hilisebu. Faibehe Enao babiyone molobebelelu idele inolo ili amoda, Enao hilisebu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Aufia, Yesuhe nolofia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilifeasu selesia, “Gine si besabe ogone besabemo, heneyo dobu. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Maumo, Nahe gilifea selesu, samini <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> wedinaleda, kini wedinaleda, kegele gili aga besabe ogo, ilihe babiyo hameluso, amo ili abuluale. Aufia, sulu gili aga dobelefe ogo, ilihe dubiyo hameluso, amo dubuluale.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samalia inolo nafuluhe mololu amone Yesuhe besi sulu awalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mad 22.35-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18">Lug 18.18</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia ulenohe, muguli manane dawalolo inolo uleno Yesu dedeba babiyone degefia, Efea doba bisigia, “Walelo, nahe eneba molosi, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> diyobafebi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “<char style="w">Muguli</char> sulu ogo eneba selelu dobubi? Ga eneba alegafia hiliselu?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Lo 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wkp 19.18</ref></char></note>Yesu auba selesi, dawalolo inolo obegeba selesia, “<char style="qt">Ga koleba, ge Gode Saminilo hamesesiamo, ge libo kolebada, ge asubane kolebada, ge kiwigagalu kolebada, ge asigi kolebada, E hamesemale. Aufia, gahe gene meleba hameselo amogubasu, ge damene noolo anogoda auba hamesemale.</char>”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Wkp 18.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Amo koleba. Gahe isoba obegeba selefe. Gahe auba molosia, miliyolu miliyo diyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Auluso, muguli manane dawalolo inolo amo hilisesia, Yesuhe na dawaloloda malebuba hiliselosisia, Efea eweguba doba abulu. “Ne dameneba selefe ogo, amo abe kolebabi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, sadalu ewe solu. “Inolo uleno Yelusalame afasia, Yeligo dauno maiyo sugasi, fadilo inolo noolohe e sefia, ene fagulo bidiba dafalisia, e wobasubale dufa ufulu. Auba molofasia, ili dedaleba yaalu. Ausi, e eno kia ami hanefia ligia, olaeyo hagoale alolu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ausi, fogo amohe <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> uleno eno hamagane kuliba maiyo suga abia, ehe inolo amo eno kia hanefia labi baafia, e eno aniba nolobalo elaba maiyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Amogubasu, Lifai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lifai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mosomu ilimo sebele moloa dabalu mololo.</char></note> inolo ulenoda ami goafia, inolo amo bafasia, eno amone aniba nolobalo elaba maiyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Aufia, Samalia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samalia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">idele inolo Yuda idele inolodai damene adale.</char></note> inolo uleno, eno amone kuliba inigia, inolo dufa dafulu dobia ami goalu. Ehe inolo amone bisigia, bule koleba yagunagalu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Ehe inoloda dobia yoba sigia, walea hanodai, <char style="w">waini</char> hanodaimo ene aiyefea sagaba sefia, dofaba ufulu. Aufia, ehe inolo amo digifia, ene dofene dogi saabia yoba mesesi ifoba ufulu. Aufia, ehe inolomo auba lubia abia, sobele molo uleno labea goalu. Ami goafia ligia, ehe inolo amo nafuluba luba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Aufia, adigi keafamo, ehe silifa mole iso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele ilimo hilia ule dabalu molofasia, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">silifa mole iso</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ule dilo.</char></note> aida haneyo molo amone enaofea mefia, efea selesia, ‘Ga inolo ewe nafuluba luba melale. Aufia, ga e luba ligia, ge mole noolo weasesenaga, amo na obegeba inigia, ge mole amo duguba meyo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Sadalu amo saaba samodofia, Yesuhe muguli mana dawalolo inolofea doba bisigia selesia, “Ga eneba hilisefe? Inolo osoloa amone aleba ami, fadilo inolone sone alefasia woba dafulu inolo amone damene koleba, abebi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yesu auba doba besabi, e obegeba selesia, “E-da yagunagafia sagoba ufulu amo e.” Aufia, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga daafia, mana imini ule aubasu molomale.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Madadai Maliadai moloa sobele mulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili daaba ligia, mosomu uleno suga daalu. Mosomu ami asulu ido uleno, ene wi Mada, ehe Yesuda ili ene moloa suga milalu. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yon 11.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:2-3">12.2-3</ref></char></note>Madahe ene inalo uleno asulumo, ene wimo, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[3]], Lasalusune enano ligia">Malia</char>. Saminilo E molo usu yoba saabi, Malia inigia, Ene emo aniba yoba sigia, E sulu selaba labi dobolaba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ausi, Madahe naiyo kegele madeneyo amone dabalu bulebuba keleba hilisefia, Yesu labea milifasia, doba bisigia, “Saminilo, ne ninalo ogo, na gadefia Ga labea yoba saabene, na nelebisu naiyo madeneba lolu. Ga amone asigifalela? Ga efea na sagoba homaba saama.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Auluso, Saminilohe ene sulu amone obegeba selesia, “Mada, Mada, ga asigi elawanelu adesia, kegele wedinale amone keleba hilisefe. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mad 6.33</ref></char></note>Auluso, kegele ule amosu diyodolu dobu. Maliahe kegele nafulune nafulu molobebelefia labe. Aulune, kegele efea dobu ewe diba dafiyobafale.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Godedai sulu saeyo mana amone walelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-15">Madiyu 6.9-15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Hilia uleno, Yesu E hele no ligia, Godedai sulu selaba alolu. E Godedai sulu saaba samodosi, Ene <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> ulenohe Efea selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, samini <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> ene walelu faibilifea Godedai sulu saeyo walelu. Aga Ga ninifeada amogubasu walemaleyobile?” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gilihe Godedai sulu selesiamo, eweguba saamale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 11:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Nao, Ge wimo <char style="w">Noekene</char> melesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Ga Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">helefealu sunia ulufa holobagamesi hamesu.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Aufia, hilia sunia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:3">Gahe hilia aga ewene liliba naiyo ninifea memale.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">Wolu</char> nini mololumo, Ga <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galimale</char>.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Enebamo, noolohe ninifea heleba molosia, dano ufulumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">ninida ine dano ufulumo, hamasia heesia galisu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Aufia, nini wolu moloyalene dedeba babiyo ninifea waagi holobagamabu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5-6" />Aufia, Yesuhe ilifea saabia selesia, “Aulugulu, inolo gili aleba ugi, damene uleno elenaga, aufia nigili dogolea, e ge moloa goafia, baea ligia selesia, ‘Ne damene, doma! Ne moloa ami, ne damene no milifasia goaluso, na efea naiyo meyomo malebu. Aulugulu, gahe nafea naiyo wedino memaleyobile?’ <verse eid="LUK 11:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Auba ausenaga, ga molo usu sigia, eweguba obegeba saeyobafela? ‘Gahe nafea higinilu memabu. Na molo eno ama kaalubu. Nada ne faibilidai nini molobia hanelu dobu. Na degefia, gafea kegele uleno meyodolualebu.’ Ga ge damenefea auba obegeba saeyodolubile? <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Auba saeyodoluale koleba. Nahe gilifea selesu, Maumo, aali damene labe amofea alefasia, ga degefia, naiyo amo ge damenefea waagi mebaiyo. Auluso, aali damene labe amofeasu auba moloyale. Aubale, ge damene ogohe gafea memasia yuafale amo alefasia, gahe e dibaiyefe amogulumo mebaiyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Aulugulu, gili doma. Haalisi, gafea meyobafe. Isasi, ga babiyobafe. Godogodosi, eno gafea sogoba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Maumo, haalife ili amo dilo. Aufia, isafe ili amo bolo. Aufia, godogodofe ilifeamo eno sogoba ofolo.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Aulugulu, enaodali gili aleba ami, ge faibe hani uleno memaba haalisenaga, amo gahe soiye aiyane efea meyobafela? Auba melale. <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Aufia, ge faibehe hagaiso memaba haalisenaga, amo gahe maidegana uleno efea meyobafela? Auba melale. <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Enaodali, gili wolu labeso, gilihe gine faibefea kegele nafulu meyo asigilo. Aulune, gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labemohe, gine faibefea melo mana waselesiamo, Efea haalife ilifea heafusia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> melo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesumo Besebulune kiwi alefasia dabalu molofeba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Madiyu 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maga 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Aufia, hilia no Yesuhe mofe kaaba dafelaba ado <char style="w">gamodo</char> uleno inolo ulenofea alolumo, asigaba dafulu. Gamodo amo aasimo, mofe kaalu inolo amo haiba sulu solu. Ausi, idele inolo wamili ilihe amone bisigia, momolesia hidigiba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mad 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char></note>Auluso, noolo selesia, “Gamodone yasilo <char style="w">Besebulu</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Besebulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mo gamodone yasilobuba solu.</char></note> alefasia, Ehe gamodomo asigafe.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mad 12.38</ref></char></note>Aufia, inolo noolohe Yesu dedeba bisigia, “Ninihe Ga Godefea alefasia dabalu molofelaba eloba bamesine, Ga koleba <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> ninifea walemaba” solu.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Auluso, Yesuhe ili asigifemo bafasia, ilifea selesia, “Mosomu uleno ine meleba aidaba osolafia yobosenaga, amo bidiba dafelesia, hodobaiyobafe. Aufia, yasiba ado uleno ine meleba aidaba osolafia yobosenaga, amo woba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Aulune, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> mosomu ine meleba osolafia yobosiabiaga, amo e halaguba kiwigaafia yasiba alebaiyo? Na auba selesu maumo, gili selesia, Na Besebulune kiwi alefasia gamodo asigaba yaafeba selefe. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Gili aleba ami, inolo noolohe gamodo asigafe. Aufia, gilihe Na-mo Besebulu alefasia gamodo asigafeba selesenaga, amo ilida Besebulu alefasia asigabaiyo? Aulugulu, sulu gine selefe ogohe gili osolafia, isolualebuba walefe. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Auluso, Godene sone alefasia Nafea kiwi mesi, Nahe gamodo asigasu. Ausimo, gili eweguba hilisema. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo gili labea mulu labe.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Aulugulu, inolo kiwida ulenohe iboloda, yaloda sefia, ene molo nafuluba haguguba yasisenaga, amo ene kegelemo sunia nafulu ufiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:15">Kol 2.15</ref></char></note>Inolo amohe, ene iboloda, ene yaloda, amofea alefasia kaamo miliyobasuba ado. Auluso, inolo ulenomo kiwigagaluda alefasia, inolo amodai yoboyo inigia, kaamo adesenaga, amo ehe inolo hodobaife amone yaloda, iboloda, sagoba diyobafe. Aufia, inolo kaamo alolu amohe, inolo hodobailu amone kegele inolo noolofea osolaba meyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:50">Lug 9.50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo Ne damenealemo, Nadai gisa adefe. Uleno abehe, Nadai idele inolo gagaiyoba ufiyone dabalu molosalenaga, amohe ilimo dusuba dafaliba labe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nafuluba, asubane wolu asigaba dafulumo saabia obegeba anosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Madiyu 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “<char style="w">Asubane wolu</char> ulenohe inolo uleno gadefia abia, hele falaiya daafia, ami siba ligia, halemane misiyone fogo isafeso, besabalene e selesia, ‘Na abia, molo nada samini gadefia muluiya ami, obegeba maiyobasu.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Aufia, inigia goasia, bosolufalumo, molomo sawaba dafasia, misiyone madenelu dobi besabe. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Auba madeneba dobi bisigia, e daafia, asubane domoba noolo, e wolu mololomo wasolu ili amo uluba difasia, ilidai obegeba inigia, molo amo suga daafia, ami yoba kakainabu. Saminimo, inolo amo asubane wolu ule ligia, nafuluba asuluale. Auluso agamo, asubane wolu aaiyoba ligiane, e saabemo, wolune wolu koleba saabe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo ewegulumo ili seale heneyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:28">Lug 1.28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:42">42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:48">48</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe idele inolo wamili ili amofea sulu auba selaba labi, ili dobolaba alolu aleba ami, ido ulenomo eweguba wuaaba solu. “Ela molo gada seba dulumo heneyo dobu. Bu gada namenesi melu amo, heneyo dobu.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ido amo auba selesi, Yesu selesia, “Amo seale, auluso Godene sulu mana dofasia kuliba aafe idele inolo, ili amo seale heneyo dobu.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo noolohe Yesufea momolelu kegele walemasi, Ehe eweguba obegeba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Madiyu 12.38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Maga 8.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mad 16.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo wamili wedinale Yesu labea milibaifasia, E amaleba galisi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Godefea faisoda melo mosomu gili, <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> walemafebu! Auluso, momolelu kegele uleno gilifea waleyobafale. Aubale. Saaba ofolo <char style="w" lemma="Yona">Yonafea</char> holobagalu amosu, gilihe eloba bamesine, gilifea waleyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Saminimo, Yonafea mololumohe, Ninifa sidi idele inolo Godene daiyalu eloba bamesine mololu. Amogubasu, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibefea</char> moloyobafe amohe, mosomu aga labe ewe eloba bamesine moloyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Kin 10.1-10</ref></char></note>Osolaeyo hilia adesimo, hele Siba amone kuwini ehe godo dobelefea ami degesia, mosomu aga labe ewefea fadaasia, ilimo osolaeyobafe. Mau enebamo, kuwini ido amo e, hele hago amifia inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomonone</char> asigilo nafulu selefe amo dubiyone mulu. Auluso, Solomonoda wasolu E-mo, aga iwi labe. Ausi, gilihe sulu E selefemo dubiyo habofe. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5-10">Jna 3.5-10</ref></char></note>Osolaeyo hilia adesimo, Ninifa sidi inolo ilihe godo dobelefea ami degesia, gilifea fadaasia, osolaeyobafe. Mau enebamo, Ninifa idele inolo ilihe Yona mana walelumo sigiba dofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besilu</char>. Auluso, aga iwi labe E-mo, Yona wasolu labe. Ausi, gilihe mana E walefemo sigiba dofasia, asigi besiluale.”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Domalane yane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Madiyu 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mag 4.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lug 8.16</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Inolohe naafa yaafasia, gasiaguba ofolale. Aufia, gofo sisada muguba ofolale. Aubale. Inolo ili molosu suga saabe amohe, yane amo bamesifia, naafa yaafia, ailalu saabia diba ofolo. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ge si ogo domalane naafagulu labe. Aulugulu, gine si ogo nafulunaga, amo gine domala ogo suniamo yane wasigafia labe. Auluso, ge si ogo wolunaga, amo ge domala ogo sunia nigiligagalu wasigafia labe. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Aulugulu, yane ga usu labe ogo, nigiligagalu holobagalosi, ga nafuluba yasimale. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Aulugulu, ge domala ogo sunia yane wasigafia, haisi uleno nigiligagalu malenaga, amo ge domala ogo suniamo naafa neeloguba, needa miliyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Falisi inolo ilifeada, muguli manane dawalolo inolo ilifeada, haguguba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Madiyu 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maga 12.38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lugu 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesuhe Godene sulu mana waleba samodofia labi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo ulenohe edai naiyo naiyo milesi sigilu. Ausi, Yesuhe ene molosu sugafia, ailalu amone aniba yoba asulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Auba yoba sigia, Yesuhe Ene sone nuguma heebale, naiyo naba alolu. Falisi inolohe amone baafia, e keleba hiliselu. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ausi, Saminilohe efea selesia, “Falisi gilimo, gine gaabuda, beledida, saabialosu nafuluba heeloso, gine libo usumo asigume manada, wolu manada, wasigafiasu ado. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Gili elawanelu inolo! Egeisa lagoda moloba dafelagolu Ehe, libo usu ilogoda moloba dafelagolu. Amo gili asigibualela? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Gili koleba, naiyo disi usu dobumo weagulufea memale. Gilihe weagulu auba sagoba ofelesenaga, gili kegele suniafealomo galagololu holobagaeyobafe.” Auba safasia, Yesu gegoaba selesia,<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Yeele! Falisi, gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 11:42">Enebamo, Gilihe muguli sulu siadeno afelesiale, gili gine edo geiya iwalu osolafia, daabulu ulenomo Godefea meba ado. Auluso, olaibo kegelemo, gili afolobiyo. Olaibo kegele amo ewe. Imini uluse mololo mana amoda, Gode hameseyo mana amoda, mana amo gili afolobiyo. Amo nafuluale. Gilihe olaibo koleba molomale. Auba molosiamo, siadenoda hamabiyo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Yeele! Falisi, gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 11:43">Enebamo, gili <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu aselesiamo, wida solu asela amisu kakainayo hamelo. Aufia, gagaiyolo helea ami, idele inolo gili wakalimesisia, misi waleba siyo hamelo.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 11:44">Enebamo, gilimo, balilu dana imini male amogulu labe. Idele inolohe dana amo saabia emelaba ligia, usu sesenelu dobubamo, babiyo babealu labe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuda idele inolo ili inolo balilu dana gesenaga, Godene si saabia ili nugumafia ligia, hilia domoba ado. (Namba 19.16 ami bamale.) Yesu iwi selesia, Falisi ine libo usu sesenelu dobu amohe, idele inolo ine sulu selesi dobelefe ili amo nugumafe.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Yesu auba selesi, muguli manane dawalolu inolo uleno Yesufea obegeba selesia, “Walelo, Gahe Falisi ilifea sulu auba selefe ogomo, Gahe ninifeada woluba selefe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Muguli manane dawalolu inolo, Na gilifeada yeeleba selesu. Gilifea woba ufiyobafe. Enebamo, gilihe idele inolofea agiyodoluale higinilu bule agiba ofelefe. Auluso, gilihe ili sagoba ofelesia, higini digiyone gine sone gaso ulenoda melalebu.” Auba safasia, Yesu gegoaba selesia,<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 11:47">Enebamo, saminimo, gine gauwadalihe <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> noolo yasoba dafalilu. Agamo, gilihe saaba ofolo amakele danelu amone balilu dana yogolelu momoloba yaafe. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Auba molofemo alefasia, gili gine gauwadali mololumone eefe. Ili amohe saaba ofolo yasoba dafalilu. Aufia, gili amohe saaba ofolone dana yogolelu momoloba yaafe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amakele koleba, muguli mana dawalolo ine enauwadalihe, saaba ofolone sulu dubiyo haboba yaasia, ilimo yasoba dafalilu. Ausi, saaba ofolo yasoba dafalilu ili amo baliba yaalu. Hamu wedinale dafasia, Yesune hilia holobagasi, muguli manane dawalolo inolo ilihe, balilu amakelelu amomo haiba saabia momolofasia, momadaba yaalu. Ili amo mololumo, saaba ofolo danelu ili amone wi digiyosia aulu. Ili auba mololumo, idele inolohe ilimo nafulububa samesifia aulu. Auba moloba labi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, gilihe balilu dana ewe momolosiamo, saabia lago nafulu bamesi molofe. Auluso, gine libo usu ogomo, gine gauwadaligulu ligia, saaba ofolo iwi baliba yaabu amone sulumo, gilida kuliba dedalefalebu. Gili sulu amo kuliba dedalesiabiaga, amo gilihe Nafea asigi ule ofaiyo.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Aulune, Godehe Ene asigi nafulu isolu kolebahe, eweguba solu. ‘Nahe saaba ofolo ilida, <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ilida, Isolaele ili labea hilibaisu. Auluso, Isolaele ilihe ili noolofea woba moloba yaasia, noolomo dufa daneyobafe.’ Gode auba solu. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Aulugulu, saaba ofolone ibi helefealu maugaiya amifia sagaba dedalelu sunia amohe, mosomu aga labe ewefea su haaliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Na gilifea selesu ewe. <char style="w" lemma="Aibele">Aibelene</char> ibifea maugafia inigia, Sekalaeane ibi elosia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane Baibolo Maugaba Seleiya ami, inolo dufa olalu agelemo, Aibele. (Stt 4.8) Baibolo seleiya amifia, dufa olalabia inigia, elosiamo, Sekalaea. (2Sto 24.20-22) 2 Stori bugomo, Yudane Baibolo seleba eloba kaalu. Aibelene ibifea maugafia inigia, Sekalaeane ibi eloluba selefe ewenemo, isolu inolone ibi sunia sagalu amone iminife.</char></note> mosomu aga labe ewefea su haaliyobafe. Sekalaea amo ilihe <char style="w">soba meyone defene olabolu</char> amodai, sebele molo amodai, elala olea ami dufa olalu.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Yeele! Muguli manane dawalolu inolo gili. Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="LUK 11:52">Enebamo, asigilo dilone giimo, gilihe sagoba dulu. Gine gilimo ami huga anale ligia, idele inolo noolo huga maiyofia saabe, ili amoda huga malesialefia, gilihe ili kaabasu ado.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Auba saaba samodofia, Yesu E molo Eda aloiya amo gadefia aasi, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawaloluda</char>, Falisida, ilimo Efea woba habofia gadifia, ilihe Efea diba anogoba doba abulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Hilia amifia, ilihe sulu E selefe amofea alefasia, E-mo seyo hamesia, enogele yasifia alolu.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Falisine masega mana amone baaba, nafuluba yasimale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Madiyu 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ausi, idele inolo wamili wedinale gagaiyosia, hele fogo dedelesia, ine geleba no emomo, no abunuba emelaba yaalu. Ausi, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilifeadale eweguba solu. “Gili <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisine</char> <char style="w">yisi</char> baaba nafuluba yasifia melale. Ine masega muguba mololo mana amone Na iminiba selesu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lug 8.17</ref></char></note>Kegele sunia aga gasiaguba dobumo, ulufa holobagaeyobafe. Aufia, kegele sunia aga muguba dobumo, fadaba asigiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Aulune, sulu sunia gili nigiliba solumo, yaida dubiyobafe. Aufia, sulu sunia gili molo usu esebalo koneniaba solumo, ili molo fagia degefia ligia, idele inolofea wuaaba saaba meyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gode baabasu sagilimale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Madiyu 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Ne damenedali, gili doma. Inolohe gine domalasu dufa olalo ili amo baaba sagilimabiyo. Enebamo, ge domala ogo olalu dobi, ilihe gafea kegele uleno saabia moloyodoluale miliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ili amo baaba sagilimabiyo. Auluso, domala dufa olalu dobi, gada <char style="w">heli</char> usu dafogoyomone wida solu kiwida labe amo, E baaba koleba sagilimale. Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, E baabasu sagilimale!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Haga biliye wedino biamo, mole iso wedino aidasu elegelomo, gili asigibualela? Auluso, Godehe haga deseine ule amogulumo asigi galibuale. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:24">Lug 12.24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:34">HD 27.34</ref></char></note>Seale aubasu, Godehe gine guni kaau ule uleba, sunia alegaba samodobu. Aulugulu, gili sagilimabiyo. Gili eleda haga biliye wedinale amo wasolu dobu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune mosomu loluba saeyone yuamabiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Madiyu 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Doma. Uleno abehe, idele inolone si saabia selesia, na Yesune mosomu loluba fogaba selesenaga, amo <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> Eda, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ine si saabia selesia, ‘Inolo ewe Ne labeba’ fogaba saeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Auluso, uleno abehe, idele inolone si saabia selesia, Na Yesune mosomu lolualeba selesenaga, amo Nada, Godene sulu dia ano ine si saabia selesiamo, ‘Inolo amo Ne-aleba’ saeyobasu. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Idele inolo abehe, Inololene Faibefea woba selesenaga, Godehe ine wolumo <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galiyobafe</char>. Auluso, inolo abehe, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> amofea saaba gaidabosia soaneba selesenaga, Godehe ene wolu amo hamasia heesia galiyobafale.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mag 13.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">Lug 21.12-15</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, ilihe gili sefia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molone</char> yasilodai, gamane inolo wida soludai, ine si saabia godomesi uluba dibia aasenaga, amo gili gine meleba subuyone sulu saeyone, ilifea eneba saeyobiba keleba hilisemabiyo. Aubale. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Maumo, fogo amoyamo hamagi koleba, Asubane Noekenemohe sulu ewene saamaba gilifea waleyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elebeda ufuluhe mana elawaneba mololu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Ausi, idele inolo wamili gagaiyolu aleba ami, inolo ulenohe Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, ne nao olalumone daalo kegelemo, ne nelewohe osolafia, noolo nafea memaba, Ga efea auba saama.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Auluso, Yesu efea obegeba selesia, “Inolo, enefe? Nahe aine kegele ogo osolaeyone, uleno Na iminiluale koleba.” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:9-10">1Dim 6.9-10</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ehe idele inolofea selesia, “Gili nafuluba sidafia yasimale. Gili kegele noolo diyo mesegelosi. Kegele wedinale ga dobu ogone aleba ami, ge miliyolu sealemo amone usu dobuale.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu ewene ilifea solu. “Inolo elebeda ufulu uleno asulu. Ene geiya ami, widi sebe wedinale helelelu. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ausi, inolo amohe ene meleba eweguba hiliselu, ‘Nahe ne widi sebe sulu diba ufiyomone, molo fogo wedinobu. Na eneba moloyobi?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Aufia, e hilisesia, ‘Na eweguba moloyoba. Na ne molo wedino sunia bidiba dafalifia, molo bule noolo diyoba. Aufia, nahe <char style="w">widi</char> sebeda, ne kegele nenafolo suniada, molo ami diba waaleyoba.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Aufia, na auba molofasia ligia, na nene meleba eweguba saeyoba. ‘Hamu wedinale aleba ami miliyone, nahe kegele nenafolo molo usu ami ililiba waalelu dobu. Aulune, na halemane misiyo. Na naiyoda, waini hanoda, na hamefeguba heneba nabasu ligia, fogo selale misiyo’. <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Auluso, Godehe efea selesia, ‘Ga asigida male koleba! Aga nigiliba yaagi, ga olaeyobafe. Ausi, kegele sunia ga gene madeneba dobu ogomo, abe diyobafe?’ ” <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:19-20">Mad 6.19-20</ref></char></note>Aufia, Yesu selesia, “Inolo abehe kegele wedinale ene meleba dauna galabia felafe amofea aubasu moloyobafe. Enebamo, e-mo Godene si saabiamo elebeda ufulualegulu labe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asigi wedinale ofasia, keleba hilisesiale, Godesu hilisemale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Madiyu 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ausi, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Doma. Gilihe gine miliyolu ogone keleba hilisemabiyo. ‘Nini naiyo ene naiyobi?’ Aufia, gili gine domala ogone keleba eweguba hilisemabiyo. ‘Na fagulo ene kaeyobiba’ hilisemabiyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ewe asigima. Miliyoluhe naiyo suniabu. Domalahe fagulo kegele suniabu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Gilihe haga anakiwi sibaisafe ogo baafia asigimale. Ili edo gelale. Aufia, naiyo amo gagaiyofia, naiyoda ofolo moloa ami ofolale. Aubale. Godehe haga ili amofea naiyo melo. Idele inolo, gili doma. Gili koleba haga wasolu dobu! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ausi, keleba hilisefe mana amofea alefasia, inolo ulenohe ene miliyolumofea aso halosi fogo uledeno gegoaba ufiyobafela? Inolo uleno auba mololale koleba. <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Aulugulu, gilihe kegele wedino amogulu moloyodolualenaga, amo enesi gili kegele noolone keleba hilisefe?”<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />“Gilihe maamo helelebu ogo, eneba holobagafebiba nafuluba fadaba baafia asigimale. Ilihe dabalu hogolosia, ine fagulo mololale. Na gilifea selesu, saminimo, kini <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomonohe</char> ene momada sunia yogolelusu kaalobiyo. Auluso, maamo ine momadalu amohe, Solomonone momadalu amo sunia wasolu koleba. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Asigi ule ufulune wedino dobu gili, eweguba hilisema. Maamo aga helelebu ogo, aide waagisu, inolo gelefasia de dafogolo amofea, Godehe fagulo yogolelu amogulu kaaba ofolonaga, amo Ehe gilifea fagulo waseba kaaba ufiyobafe koleba.<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Aulugulu, naiyo ene naiyobi, hano ene naiyobi, auba ge asigi ogo keleba hilisemabiyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ilihe auba koleba keleba hilisefia, kegele amo sunia dibaiyeba isalo. Auluso, gilihe kegele amo diyoluba hilisefe ogomo, gine Gao amo, Ehe asigiba samodobu. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Auluso, kegele olaibodale isaeyo dobumo ewe. Godehe ge miliyolu ogo sunia uluba ligia, ge yasilo waagi melesiba isamale. Ausi, Ehe kegele noolo suniada gafea gegoaba meyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hebene lagi elebe diyone madenemale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Madiyu 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gili, Ne dofene sibi edo deseinegulu. Gili sagilimabiyo. Gine Gaomo, gine kini miliyoba heafuba saaba ofelesia, Ehe Ene Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo gilifea meyoba saaba dobu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:22">Lug 18.22</ref></char></note>Gilihe gine kegele ogo elegefia, mole amo inolo weagulufea memale. <char style="w">Hebene</char> lagimo, kegele asigilelale. Aufia lagimo, fadilohe kegele dilale. Aufia lagimo, dibuhe kegele amo nolale. Aulugulu, gili koleba mole selo alu wolale amone difasia, gili koleba gine samolomo hebene diba homale. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Enebamo, ge kegele nafulu samoloda dobia amimo, ge asigida amisu miliyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu obegeba miyobafe amone nafuluba yasifia madenemale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:42-44">Madiyu 24.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mad 25.1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu saabia selesia, “Hilia sunia Godene dabalu moloyone madenefia ligia, gine fagulo abobofia, madibu dofafia, gine gamalida yaaba ofasia, madenefia melale. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Gili kolebamo, inolo ine yasilomo obegeba miyobafeba yasifia ado amoguba melale. Ine yasilo amo ido ifofea daafia, naiyo naba samodofia obegeba miyobafe. Ausiamo, e obegeba inigia, eno godogodosimo, ilihe eno alebale sogoba ofolo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Aulugulu, yasilo inigia, ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo faibili</char> amo auba hanebale yasifia labi besenaga, ili amo koleba heneyo dobu. Na seale gilifea selesu, yasilo amohe balu dabalu mololone fagulo ene meleba dofaba kaafia, ehe ilimo naiyo naiyone ailalu dobia ami, yoba misiyo milibaimaba saeyobafe. Aufia, ehe ili amofea naiyo meyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Amo seale, yasilo e-mo, nigili dogolea esenagada, me hiliaeyo hagoalesi esenagada, e inigia, balu dabalu mololo faibili hanebale yasifia labi besenaga, ili amo heneyo dobu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mad 24.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">1Des 5.2</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesu saabia selesia, “Gilihe besi sulu eweda nafuluba fadaba hilisema. Molo bisohe, fadilo inolo halosi amo miyobafeba asigisiabiaga, fadilo amo inigia, ene molo olaboba sugamesi fogo mebaiyale. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Gilida koleba madenefia melale. Maumo, gilimo <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> fogo amoyamo miyobafeba hilisebale labi, E miyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dabalu nafulu mololo faibedai, wolu mololo faibedaine besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Madiyu 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Ga besi sulu ogo ninifeasu selesela, me idele inolo suniafeada selesela?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ausi, Saminilo obegeba selesia, “Sulu solu afelesiale, sigi doba mololo faibe nafulumo, ewegulu labe. Ene bisohe e iminisia, ene dabalu mololo faibe noolomo yasimesi gadefalo. Ausi, dabalu mololo faibe nafulu ewehe, ili noolo amofea fogo iminiba ufuluiya ami naiyo sagalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ene biso daafia, obegeba inigia, ehe ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibe</char> auba moloba labi besenaga, amo faibe amone henelo wasigaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:21">Mad 25.21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:23">23</ref></char></note>Na seale koleba gilifea selesu. Bisohe ene dabalu mololo faibe amofea ene kegele sunia yasimesi iminifia gadefaeyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Auluso, sulu sigi dobale dabalu mololo faibe wolu, e ewegulu labe. E hilisesiamo, ene bisomo alebale obegeba miyobafaleba hilisefia, ehe ene ua dabalu mololo ideleda inoloda yasoba yaeyo maugaeyobafe. Aufia, e naiyoda, hanoda, nafasia, kagoaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Auba moloba ligia, dabalu mololo faibe amohe ene bisomo hiliada, halosida, amoyamo miyobafeba hilisebale ligia, madeneluale labi, e obegeba miyobafe. Aufia, ehe efea naga bule koleba mefia, ehe e-mo asigi ule ofolale idele inolo amodai hele ua melesi gadefaeyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 4:17">Yem 4.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">Balu dabalu mololo faibehe</char> ene bisone hame hilisefia ligiaso, ehe kegele madenebale, ene bisone hame kuliba aasalenaga, amo ene bisohe e bule koleba dufiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Auluso, balu dabalu mololo faibehe ene bisone hame hilisebale ligia, naga meyodolu mana molosenaga, amo ene bisohe e wedino dufiyobafe. Idele inolo sunia abefea kegele wedinale melu dobumo, ili amofea haiba wedinale obegeba sabe memesi haaliyobafe. Idele inolo abefea dabalu wedinale molomesi gadefalumo, ili amofea saabia dabalu bule no molomesi haaliyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe aealo dia mulualeso, mosomu aidaba osolaba dafiyone mulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Madiyu 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yesu saabia selesia, “Na mulumo, helefealufea de dia mulugulu, de amo alebale koleba waiyamalebaiyeba Na hamefe. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38-39">Mag 10.38-39</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na aso hano uleno geyo dobu. Amo aso geluale lolugulu, Ne libo koleba higinife. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Gilihe hilisesia, Na mulumo, idele inolo helefealu iwi <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> mesesine muluba hilisefela? Aubale. Auluso, Na gilifea selesu, Nahe mosomu aidaba osolaba dafiyone mulu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Fogo aga iwifia, molo ulenohe damene bia saabenaga, amo ine geleba mosomu aidaba osolaeyobafe. Osoloahe aidafea osolaba dafaliyobafe. Ausi, aidahe osoloafea osolaba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ili auba osolaba yaasiamo, enaohe faibefea osolaba dafiyobafe. Ausi, faibehe enaofea osolaba dafiyobafe. Ausi, enaehe elewelifea osolaba dafiyobafe. Ausi, elewelihe enaefea osolaba dafiyobafe. Ausi, enamolohe ene enamolofea osolaba dafiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu moloyone mulumo, idele inolo hilisebuale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Madiyu 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesuhe idele inolo wamilifea selesia, “Gilihe halo lubailofealo anakiwi ogisi besenaga, amo gili hilisesiamo, hele sugaeyobafeba hiliselo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele helea amimo, halo lubailofealo hele sugalo.</char></note> Amo seale, auba molosenaga, hele sugalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Aufia, gili hilisesia, ilogolo fufulo kolelu fuuba dafelesenaga, helesoyobafeba hiliselo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele hele amimo, fufulo ilogoloba fusenaga, hele falalu ado. Amo alefasia, hele halosia falalo.</char></note> Amo seale, auba mololo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Gili masega gegelo inolo. Gilihe kegele helefealu iwida, anakiwi lagida, holobagafe amo nafuluba osolalo. Auluso gili koleba, seale aga fogo ewe molofemo nafuluba osolaba besabale. <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Mau enesi, gili gine meleba bisigia, mana isolu ewebuba osolaba bolale?”<verse eid="LUK 12:57" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gahe inolo gada godoyo weiyaafe amodaidale isomale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Madiyu 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Inolo ulenohe gadai godoyo weiyaasenaga, aali godoyo helea ami aso goayo ligia, eno aiba daaba ligia, alebale hamagi, sulu edai isoba bamale. Ehe ga osolalo inolo labea sigidibia aasi, osolalo inolohe ga ibolo selu yasilone sone saabia ofolosi. Ibolo seluhe ga dibolo dafogolosine, auba isoba bamale. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Seale koleba, Na gafea eweguba selesu. Gahe ge dano haisidenoda aso duguba samodobale labi, ilihe ga dibolo dafogobugo sububa dafogoyobafale.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Inolo asigi besifalemo e afiyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Yesu E sulu auba saaba samodofia labi, inolo noolohe, kegele Galili inolo noolofea mololu amone, Yesudai sulu saeyo maugalu. Galili inolo ili amo Godefea kelebulu soba meba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> ili dufasia, ine ibida, kelebulu soba melu amone ibida, saabia gegoafia, soba meyone defene olaboiya ami sagalu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:2">Yon 9.2</ref></char></note>Ilihe auba mololumone sulu selaba labi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Galili inolo ili ogofea kegele ewe mololumone, gili hilisesia, ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololu</char> amohe, Galili inolo none wolu sunialububa hilisefela? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Aubale koleba. Auba hilisemabiyo. Auluso, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisalenaga</char>, gilida sunia aubasu woba dafiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Me hele Siloama ami, kegele holobagalumo, gili eneba hilisefe? Inolo daabuluba ulefia aaiyobamo (18), molo selale olaboba abunusia daneba yaalu amo, ili heleba mololu amone dano amohe, Yelusalame inolo noolo kakainabu amone danomo wasolububa hilisefela? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Aubale koleba. Auba hilisemabiyo. Auluso, gili asigi besisalenaga, gilida sunia aubasu woba dafiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">I sebe helelale amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu ule ewene solu. “Inolo ulenohe ene <char style="w">waini</char> geiya <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono i</char> uleno gelu. Aufia dufia, e i amo labea, olono sebe helefelaba babiyone mulu. Auluso, ehe sebe ulenoda helebi abuluale. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:9">Lug 3.9</ref></char></note>Ausi, ehe gelu amone dabalu mololo amofea eweguba solu. ‘Bama. Hamu osoloa aleba ami, olono ewe sebe helebulaba, na bea bobolaba aloluso, sebe ulenoda helebi abuluale. Aulugulu, ga i ewe koloba dama! Helene safe balu diaba adosi.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:9">2Fid 3.9</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 3:15">15</ref></char></note>Ausi, dabalu mololo inolohe efea obegeba selesia, ‘Yasilo, ga i amo aso hamu uleno melesi waagi gadefama. Nahe i mau amo hele waliba mefasia, keaone galimo ami ufiyoba. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Aufia, hamu no anogo sebe helefelaba fadaba babiyone milale. Ami aso sebe helesalenaga, amo gahe i amo koloba damale.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sabada hilia uleno Yesuhe ido uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />
    <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> ulenohe, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> uleno usu ami, Yesuhe idele inolofea sulu mana waleba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Ido uleno ami asulumo, asubane woluhe ene faiso sesegeleba ufia ligia, hamu daabuluba ulefia aaiyoba (18) alolu. Ausi, ido amo isoba degeba adale. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesuhe ido amo bisigia, E labea milafia, efea eweguba solu. “Ido, Nahe ge walefa diba dafelesu.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Aufia, Ehe Ene sone ido amofea gesi, alebale hamagi ehe ene faiso isoba lagofia, Godene wi digiba solu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Kis 20.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Lo 5.13-14</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, sese amone guni inolohe Sabada hiliahe ido amo waiba ufulu amone bafasia, Yesufea gadilu. Aulune, guni inolo amohe idele inolofea selesia, “Dabalu moloyo hiliamo, hilia kaabeba dobu. Aulugulu, gilihe gine walefa waiba waalemesi hamesenaga, amo gili dabalu mololo hilia amisu milale. Auluso, Sabada hilia ami waiba homesi doba bamabiyo.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Lug 14.5</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> efea obegeba selesia, “Gili masega sodo inolo! Gine sulu selefeda, mana molofeda, ule aiba adefale. Sabada hilia adesimo, gilihe gine <char style="w">dofene keao</char> moloa daafia, dofene keaoda, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene dogi">dofene dogida</char>, subufasia, hano namenesi uluba sefia analela? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> eleweli ewemo, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenehe</char> e kiliseba ufia ligia, hamu daabuluba ulefia aaiyoba (18) alolumo, Na e sububa dafogoyo hamesenaga, amo Sabada hilia ewemo Na e sububa dafogomabusela?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />E auba selesi, ene gisa inolomo yualu. Auluso, idele inolo suniahe, kegele nafulu e molofe amo baafia, henelu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maseda sebe amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Madiyu 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maga 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ausi, Yesuhe doba bisigia, selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo amenegulu dobubi? Na alefasia, kegele amomo mimisililu halagulufea iminiba saeyobi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Amomo maseda sebe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maseda sebe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo wedino kewalo sebe amogulu.</char></note> amogulu labe. Amone inolo difasia, ene geiya fifilu. Amo sobofasia, i adesi, haga noolo milibaifasia, i amone odo dalelu saabia, ine molo ami diaba yaalu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisi boledi bulelo amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Madiyu 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Aufia, saabia Yesuhe doba bisigia, “Na alefasia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo mimisililu halagulufea iminiba saeyobi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Amomo, boledida bulelo <char style="w" lemma="Yisi">yisigulu</char> labe. Ido ulenohe yisi wedino difasia, falawa amodai besifasia, habanelo. Aufia, dufia ami, falawa amo sunia bolesia, bulelu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gili koleba eno saliba dedelelumo sugamale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Madiyu 7.13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Aufia, Yesu E dauno nooloda, mosomu nooloda, amolo abia, idele inolofea walelabia, Yelusalame enofealo maiyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Ausi, inolo ulenohe doba bisigia, “Saminilo, Godehe inolo bilalesu <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyobafela</char>?” Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24-25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:10-12">Mad 25.10-12</ref></char></note>“Gilihe eno saliba dedelelumo aso sogoba dobi sugaeyomo, kiwigaaba koleba molomale. Maumo, Na gilifea selesu, molo biso e degefia, eno kaasimo, idele inolo wedinale sugaeyo weiyaeyobafe. Auluso, ili sugaeyodoluale miliyobafe. Gili auba milibaifia, fafa faisa godogodoba ligia, susiba selesia, ‘Saminilo, nini eno sogomaba’ saeyobafe. Auluso, ehe gilifea eweguba obegeba saeyobafe. ‘Gili wagifia mulu? Na gili bolalene hilisebuale.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ausi, gilihe eweguba saeyobafe, ‘Ninihe ga galiba yoba sigia, naiyoda, hanoda, mololu. Aufia, ga nine eno kia ligia, nini waleba alolu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Sng 6.8</ref></char></note>Auluso, ehe eweguba obegeba saeyobafe. ‘Na gili asigifale. Gili amifia mulubamoda hilisebuale. Wolu mololo gili, Na labea melabu. Gili sunia dedaleba yaama!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">Mad 8.11-12</ref></char></note>Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamada</char>, Aisegeda, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekoboda</char>, aufia <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> suniada, ili Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo suga daafia, ami yoba kakainabi babiyobafe. Auluso, gine gilimo, baea saidafulune, gili bese hegelesia, yegiliba ligia, kudumaneba miliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:3">Sng 107.3</ref></char></note>Ausi, idele inolo ili ine hele afasia, halo holobagalofealoda, halo sugalofealoda, aufia lagoloda, ilogoloda, ili milibaifia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami sugafia, naiyo bule yufuluiya ami naba misiyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mad 19.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu doma. Idele inolo noolo aga dufialo alebaibu ilimo, saminiyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo noolo aga saminiba alebaibu ilimo, dufialo miliyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Yelusalame amone hilisesia yagunagalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Madiyu 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Fogo amoyamo koleba, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo noolo milibaifia, ilihe Yesufea eweguba solu. “Ga koleba hele ewe afasia, nolobalo mala. Mau ene, <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodohe</char> Ga dufa olaeyo hamefe.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Aufia, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gili abia, selibo geso wolu amofea eweguba saamale. ‘Doma, aso agada, aideda, Nahe asubane wolu asigasia, walefalu waiba waaleyo. Aufia, hilia osolomo dabalu samodoyo. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Auluso, agada, aideda, mimiyoda, Na aso mololabiasu abia, Yelusalame goayo koleba dobu. Mau enebamo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo hele nolobalo ligia, olalale. Aubale. Saaba ofolo ilimo Yelusalame amisu olalo.’<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Yelusalame-eee, Yelusalame-eee, saaba ofolo inoloda dufa danelo ga. Aufia, ga labea hilibaisalu inoloda abane odo ga. Hilia wedinale ami, gogono edobeyohe ene edo ene awi sisa gagaiyoba ofolo amogubasu, Nahe gine faibili gagaiyobaiyeba hiliseluso, ga hamefale. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sng 118.26</ref></char></note>Doma. Ge molo elabu miliyobafe. Na gafea eweguba selesu, ‘Gahe Na saabia no babale ligiasu abia, hilia ga eweguba selesia eloyobafe. <char style="qt">Saminilone wi saabia saabe amofea, wabialesia Ene wi digimaba saeyobafe.</char>’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo uleno domala galulu waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />
    <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> ulenohe, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisine</char> guni inolo uleno moloa naiyo naiya daalu. Naiyo naba labi, ilihe E nafuluba sidafia alolu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Amimo, inolo uleno domala galulumo Yesu aniba yoba mesafia alolu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:9">Lug 6.9</ref></char></note>Yesuhe amo baafia, muguli manane dawalolu ilifeada, Falisi ilifeada, doba bisigia, selesia, “Ninihe Sabada hiliahe, walefalu inolo waiba ofelesenaga, amo muguli mana saaba dobuguba iminifebile, me iminifalela?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Auluso, ili sunia saufia ligia, sulu uleno obegeba soluale. Ausi, Ehe inolo amo luba difasia, waiba ofelesia, e malalu. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mad 12.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:15">Lug 13.15</ref></char></note>Aufia, Ehe ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Gine faibe uleno, me gine <char style="w">dofene keao</char>, Sabada hiliahe hano walulu uleno sugasenaga, amo gilihe alebale gasiba dafelagoyobafela, me auba auyobafalela?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Auba selesi, ilihe sulu ewene obegeba soluale.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe selesia, inolo ene meleba koleba helea miliyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Falisi inolo amone moloa ami, naiyo naiyone weba sigilu inolo ilihe, wida solu aselo molobia misiyofia, molobebeleba yaalu. Ausi, Yesuhe ili auba molofe bisigia, besi sulu ewene ilifea solu. <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6-7">Snd 25.6-7</ref></char></note>“Inolo ulenohe, ido ifosia naiyo bule naafe amone, ga wesimo, wida solu aselo molobia ami ga mesabiyo. Enebamo, ilihe molobu amo inolo no, ge wida wasolu amoneba, iminiba ufia adosi. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ausenaga, inolo gada welu amohe inigia, gafea selesia, ‘Molobu gada saabe ogo, inolo ewefea memaba’ selesi, ga wobasubale yuafia, abia faisa misiyobafe koleba. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Auluso, inolo uleno ga wesi, naiyo naiya abiamo, ga faisa koleba mesale. Ga auba molosimo, inolo gada welu ewehe inigia, gafea eweguba saeyobafe, ‘Damene, ga mila. Molobu nafulu ewe mesaba’ saeyobafe. E auba molosi, inolo gadai naiyo nabia kakainabu ine si saabia ga wi bule diyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mad 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Lug 18.14</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, idele inolo suniahe ine wida digibaiyefemo, Godehe ili helea dufa dafogoyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo ine meleba helea adefemo, Godehe ine wi digiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo ninifea duguba meyodoluale ili amofea, ninihe nafulu moloyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Aufia, Yesuhe inolo eda naiyo naiyone sigilu amofea selesia, “Ga naiyo uleno madenefia, idele inolo milesi sigisiamo, gahe ge damenedalida, ge gelewodalida, ge mosomuda, elebeda ufulu amoda, sigimabiyo. Enebamo, ga auba ausenaga, ilihe dufia ga ine moloa naiyo namenesi sigifia, ge naiyomo ami duguba meyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Auluso, ga naiyo bule naiyone madenesiamo, gahe inolo weaguluda, inolo ine domala woba yaaluda, emo woba yaaluda, si kalaba yaaluda, ili amogulumone milesi sigiba yaamale. Ausenaga, gafea ediliba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:29">Yon 5.29</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, inolo ili amogulumo ge naiyo duguba meyobafaleso, dufia Godehe isolu inolo olalu degeba waalesi, Ehe ge naiyo ami duguba meyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naiyo bule naiyone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Madiyu 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 13:29">Lug 13.29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo uleno Yesudai naiyo naba asulu amohe, E selefe dofasia, ehe Efea eweguba solu. “Idele inolo Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada usu ami, naiyo naba misiyobafe, ili amo ine henelo wasigafia labe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, besi sulu no solu. “Inolo ulenohe naiyo bule yufiyo madenesia, inolo wedinale naiyo amo naiyone milesi sigilu. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Naiyo naiyone iminilu hilia fogo amohe, ehe ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo inolo</char> hilibaisia, inolo samini milesi weba sigilu ili amofea, eweguba samesi hilibailu. ‘Gili mila. Aga naiyo kegele sunia ama madenelu dobu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Auluso, inolo ili amo suniahe, miyalebuba selaba yaalu. Inolo maugabamo selesia, ‘Na gelu uleno elegelu dobune, na amo babiyo maiyogulu, yagunagabu, na miale kolebabu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Ausi, inolo no selesia, ‘Nahe dabalu moloyone <char style="w">dofene keao</char> daabuluba elegelu dobune, ili amone dedeba dabalu moloyo aasune, yagunagabu, na miale kolebabu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:33">1Kld 7.33</ref></char></note>Ausi, inolo nomo selesia, ‘Na ido sedalele dulugulu, na mialebu.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Ausi, dabalu mololo faibe amo obegeba abia, sulu amo sunia ene yasilofea awaba melu. Ausi, yasilo inolohe sulu amo dofasia, kanofia, ene dabalu mololo faibefea eweguba solu. ‘Ga alebale abia, eno bule aibada, eno wedino aibada, ami abia, inolo weagulumoda, inolo domala woba yaalumoda, inolo si kalaba yaalumoda, inolo emo mauaba yaalumoda, ili amo sunia uluba dibia, ne moloa milibaimale.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ausi, dabalu mololo faibehe auba moloba samodofia, e selesia, ‘Yasilo, ga solugubamo na moloba samodolu. Auluso, molo amimo, fogo aso dobu.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Ausi, yasilohe dabalu mololo faibefea selesia, ‘Ga dauno gadefia abia, eno bule aibada, gelu yalaba waalebialoda, ami abia, idele inolo alebaibi besenaga, ne naiyo naiya milibaimaba saamale. Auba ausimo, ne molo wasigamesi hamefe.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Na gafea selesu, ‘Inolo sunia samini na milesi weba sigilu amone, ulenohe ne naiyo haisideno ulenoda namenaleyale koleba.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuliba maiyone, gilihe nafuluba asigimale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Madiyu 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Idele inolo wamili Yesu Edai dedaleba ligia, E nolofia, ilifea eweguba solu. <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lug 9.23</ref></char></note>“Uleno abehe, Na labea inigia, ene enaoda, ene enaeda, ene eamonoda, ene faibilida, ene elewodalida, ene enanodalida, aufia ene miliyolu amoda, Nafea alefasia weaseyo habosenaga, amo e Ne <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> miliyodoluale. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Aufia, inolo abehe Ne walelu faibe miliyo hilisesenaga, amo e Na kuliba inigia, <char style="w">imolane</char> ene digifia milale.”<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Gili aleba ami, inolo uleno molo bule diyo hilisesenaga, amo e yoba sigia, molo diyone mole weaseyobafemo, aubabuba nafuluba asigi daiyaba aselo. Mole amohe, ene molomo diba samodoyobafebile, me diba samodoyobafalebileba, asigi daiyaba aselo. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Enebamo, maugaba e hele waliba feaba madenefia, dufia molo amo diba samodosalenaga, idele inolo suniahe baafia, e baaba galiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Ilihe selesia, ‘Inolo ogomo, molo diyo maugaluso, diba samodofaleba’ saeyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Amogubasu, kini ulenohe, kini nodai yoboyo maiyo hilisesenaga, amo e nafuluba yoba sigia, asigi nafulu daiyaeyobafe. E yoba sigia, maugaba hilisesia, ene yobolo inolo daosene daabuluba (10,000) ligia, ami kini nomone yobolo inolo daosene daabuluba aida (20,000) labimo, e amodai yoboyodolulaba asigi daiyaba ado. Ehe kini no amodai yobosimo, kaamo miliyobafebile, me kaamo miliyobafalebileba asigi daiyaba ado. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ehe amo isolualebuba hilisesenaga, yoboyo amo afiyone, inolo noolo seloayone sulu saeyo malesi hilibaisalo.<verse eid="LUK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Aubasu, gili ulenohe ene kegele amo sunia afasia, gadefia aasalenaga, amo e Ne walelu faibe miliyodoluale labe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salune nenalebalu asigilelo amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Madiyu 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maga 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Salu e nafulu kegele koleba. Auluso, ene nenalebalu asigilesenaga, salu amo haiba nenalebalu melesi, nini kegele uleno moloyodoluale koleba. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Salu amogulumo, dabalu male koleba. Edo gelu sobomesi ufiyone, dabalu amoda male. Ninihe amo balu saidafolo. Inolo sulu dubiyone konenida ga, doma!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Dofene sibi daba dafulu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Madiyu 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Hilia uleno, dagese dilo ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> nooloda, milibaifasia, Yesu sulu selefe amone dubiyone, E amaleba galilu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:30">Lug 5.30</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisida</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawaloluda</char>, ilihe eweguba gogomoba solu. “Inolo ogohe, wolu mololo inolodai damene molosia, ilidai naiyo naba aselo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea besi sulu ewene solu. <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:11">Ese 34.11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:10">Lug 19.10</ref></char></note>“Asigima. Gili ulenohe <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> daabulubasu daabuluba (100) ligia, dofene sibi uleno daba dafelesenaga, amo ehe eweguba moloyobafebuba hilisesu. Ehe dofene sibi daabulubasu agofolobafia agofoloba (99) amo ili nolobalo waagi melesi gadefasia, e dofene sibi ule daba dafulu amone, isalabia abia besabi, ami afolo. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />E dofene sibi amo baaba golefia, ene kilele saabia digifia, henelabia ene moloa obegeba ano. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />E moloa goafia, ene damenedalida, ene mosomudalida, weba gagaiyofia selesia, ‘Gili nadai henema. Nahe ne dofene sibi daba dafulumo baaba golelu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Besi sulu auba safasia, Yesuhe selesia, “Na gilifea selesu, wolu mololo inolo uleno <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisi</char>, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi ili aubasu henelo. Seale, wolu mololo uleno asigi besife amofea, henelo amo bule koleba. Auluso, isolu inolo daabulubasu agofolobafia agofoloba (99) asigi besiyone dabalu maleba hilisefe ili amofea, henelo amo wedino koleba.” <figure style="fig" alt="Rescuing a lamb" file="IB04138.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="15.3-7">Inolo e dofene sibi ule daba dafulu amo isafia besabe.</figure><verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mole iso daba dafulu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu no selesia, “Ido ulenohe, silifa mole iso daabuluba sefia ligia, amone iso uleno moloa daba dafelesenaga, amo e eneba moloyobafe?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu alolu fogo amo, silifa mole amo, higinilu bule ligia, nine kina mole amo wasolu. Silifa iso ulehe, hilia ule dabalu molofe amone elegelo.</char></note> E naafa yaafia, molo usu sawaba nafuluba isalabia abia, mole iso amo baaba golesi, ami afolo. E auba aulalela? Aa! E auba aulo. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ene mole iso diba obegesimo, ehe ene damenedalida, ene mosomudalida, weba gagaiyofia, ilifea selesia, ‘Gili nadai henema. Ne mole uleno daba dafuluso, aga na baaba golefia obegeba dulu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Aufia, Yesu selesia, “Na seale gilifea selesu, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolo uleno <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisimo</char>, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> aleba amimo, henelo amogubasu dilo.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faibehe enao gadefia daalu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu no selesia, “Inolo ulenohe, inolo faibe aida asulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Faibe sia amohe, ene enaofea selesia, ‘Nao, daalo ga nafea meyo ufulumo, aga nafea mema.’ Ausi, enaohe ene kegelemo, ene faibe aidafea osolaba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Fogo selale daabale ligia, faibe sia amohe, ene kegele sunia madeneba agifia, ene enao gadefia, hele hago maiyo daalu. E hele ami ligia, mana elelilu nokene nokeneba molosia, mole sunia ami samodoba sugalu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Aufia, ene mole sunia samodoba sugasi, hele ami mamia gi bule holobagalu. Ausi, e kegele ulenoda ufuluale alolu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Aufia, e-mo hele ami, inolo none dabalu moloyone daalu. Ausi, inolo amohe, e-mo ene dofeneda alebaila ami dofene luba melesi gadefalu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Dofene saiyele bado nabaife amo baafia, ehe ene galisalo wasigabaiyesia, saiyele bado amo naiyo hamelu. Auluso, inolo ulenohe efea kegele ulenoda waagi namenesi meluale.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ausi, aga e asigi nafulu haiba disi, e selesia, ‘Ne naone dabalu mololo faibilimo, naiyo wedinale kubaleba nabaisia, hulianeda afelefebu. Auluso, na aga iwi labe ewemo, na mamiaba koleba olaeyodolubu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Sng 51.4</ref></char></note>Hama, na obegeba abia, nao labea daafia, na efea eweguba saeyo. ‘Nao, na gafeada, Godefeada, wolu mololu. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Agamo, na ge faibeba saeyomo nafuluale lolu. Gahe na-mo ge dabalu mololo uleno melesi gadefama.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Auba hilisefasia, e degefia, ene enao labea obegeba daalu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">E aso hago miliba labi, ene enaohe e baafia, ene asigihe efea bule yagunagalu. Ausi, e-mo naguba daafia, ene faibemo ene sone seba sugafia, fafuasia mimilu. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Ausi, faibe selesia, ‘Nao, wolu na mololumo, nahe Godefeada, gafeada, mololu. Aga na inolo nafulualene, gahe na-mo ge faibeba saeyodoluale lolu.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Auluso, enaohe ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibilifea</char> selesia, ‘Ogoba sisiba! Gilihe fagulo selale dia inigia, efea kaaba homa. Aufia, sone kaalo dia inigia, ene sone kaaba homa. Aufia, samagada difasia, ene emo kaaba homa. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Aufia, dofene keao edo gaugagilu, dia milifasia, dufa dasigama. Nini naiyo nabia heneyoba. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1">Efe 2.1</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:5">5</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, ne faibe ewe, olalu aloluso, aga e haiba bebea adefe. E daba dafuluso, e aga haiba baaba golelu.’ Ausi, ilimo naiyo bule yofasia, nabia henesia waalelu.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Auba labi, inolo faibe olaibomo, e edo geiya alolu. Dabalu moloba samodofia inigia, dobelesufalumo, ilimo ibaba sodosia, gala dafelesia waalesi dubulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Aufia, ehe dabalu mololo faibe uleno milafia, selesia, ‘Ili ogo ene molosia gala dafelefe?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Ausi, dabalu mololo faibe amo obegeba selesia, ‘Ge gelewo obegeba mulune, aufeba’ solu. ‘Aufia, ge gaohe, dofene keao edo gaugagilu dufa dasigalu. Maumo, ge gaohe gelewomo nafulu alefasia obegeba mulu amone bafasia aufe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Faibe olaibomo sulu amo dofasia, e kanofia koleba, molosu sugaeyo hameluale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:28">Ausi, ene enao baea holobagafia, ene faibe kanolu amone onamesi aealu sulu solu. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Auluso, ehe enaofea obegeba selesia, ‘Bama! Hamu wedinale nahe balu dabalu mololo faibegulu ligia, ge dabalu moloba ofolaba alolu. Aufia, nahe ge sulu uleno saidafolale. Auluso, gahe na ne damenedali heneba naiyo yomesi, dofene meme edo ulenoda mesale. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Auluso, ge faibe ogohe, ge kegelemo sunia susugu idelefea weasefasia, moloa obegeba saabi, ga koleba, dofene keao edo gaugagilumo efea dufa ofeleso!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Auba selesi, enao selesia, ‘Ne naalo, hilia sunia ga nadaisu alolu. Kegele sunia na dobu ewemo, ge. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Auluso, aga nini henesia, asigi nafulu ufiyo dobu. Maumo, ge gelewo ewe olalu aloluso, haiba bebea adefe. E daba dafuluso, e haiba baaba golefe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Dabalu yasilo uleno gegelo labeso, e asigi belebelelu alolu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> besi sulu no eweguba solu. “Elebeda ufulu ulenohe, ene mole kegeleda yasimesi, inolo nofea dabalu melu. Auba mefasia labi, inolo noolo elebeda ufulu amo labea milibaifia, ene mole yasilo amone saaba sulu oloba koweba selesia, ‘Ge mole yasilo ogohe, ge kegele sunia nafuluba yasisiale, weaseba yaalu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ausi, elebeda ufulu amohe, mole yasilo amo wefia selesia, ‘Aga nahe ga saaba sulu selesi dobelesu ewene, eneba labe? Gahe ne molemo yasiba ligia, dabalu halaguba mololu? Nafea awasia, sowi seleba memale. Maumo, gahe ne molemo saabia no yasiba miliyobafale.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ausi, mole yasilomohe ene meleba selesia, ‘Aga na eneba moloyobi? Ne yasilohe ne dabalu duguba dafelefe. Inolo none dabalu molosia, hele waliyonemo, na kiwidalebu. Aufia, inolo nofea mole memaba haaliyomo, na yuafe. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Aa! Kegele ewe na aga moloyobaba hilisesu. Inolo noolo nadai damene adesenaga, ne yasilohe na duguba dafulu labi, ilihe na-mo ine moloa heneba uluba diyobafe. Aulune, nahe inolo noolo nadai damene melesi hahanoba ufiyoba.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Auba hilisefasia, ehe elebeda ufulu amone danoda ufulu inolo, elebi elebiba, e labea milaba weba yaalu. Ehe maugaba mulu amofea wanesia, ‘Gahe ne yasilofea dano halagia ufuluba wanelu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ausi, e obegeba selesia, ‘Walea hano wasulu fulasu aaiyoba (800)’. Auba selesi, mole yasilomohe efea selesia, ‘Ge dano ufulu beba selelumo difasia, alebale aseba ilogofia, beba amo dedegesia, fulasu aaiyobamo heefia, haiba fulasu biniba (400) selemaba’ solu.<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ausi, ehe inolo aganebo amofea dobelesia, ‘Dano ga halagia ufulu?’ E obegeba selesia, ‘<char style="w">Widi</char> alu fula ule (100) ufulu.’ Ausi, mole yasilomohe efea selesia, ‘Ga dano ufulu bebamo difasia, daabuluba aaiyobaba (80) dedegeba selemalu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Aufia, dufia elebeda ufulumohe, mole yasilo isoluale amo auba mololumo baafia, ehe ene wi digilu. Maumo, e asigi belebelelu ligia mololu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:8">Besi sulu ewe walesia, helefealu idele inolo aga saabe ewemo, asigi belebelelu ligia, ine mosomune dabalu moloyone eno nonoba isalobiyo. Auluso, yane daaba labe idele inolomo, ili asigi belebelelu amogulu adale. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Aulugulu, Na gilifea selesu, besi sulu ewene kiwimo ewe. Helefealu iwi molemo mana isolualene kegele. Auluso, mole gili iwi sebumohe, gili koleba, noolo anogomo gine damene holobagamesisia, ilifea sagoba homale. Ausenaga, molene kiwigagalu sugasi fogo ami, Godehe gilimo hebene moloa ami heneba luba diyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:17-26">Lug 19.17-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Uleno abehe, kegele wedino nafuluba uluba adesenaga, amo ehe kegele bule amoda nafuluba uluba miliyobafe. Aufia, inolo abehe kegele wedino amone mana isoba molosalenaga, kegele bule amoda mana isoba moloyobafale. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Aulugulu, kegele gafea helefealu iwi uluba melesi gadefalumo, ga nafuluba uluba adesalenaga, amo abehe gafea Asubanefealo elebe kegele uluba melesi gadefaeyobafe? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Aufia, ga inolo none kegelemo nafuluba uluba adesalenaga, amo kegele gene ge-ba uluba melesi, abehe gafea meyobafe?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Dabalu mololo faibe ulenohe, yasilo aidane dabalu moloyodoluale dobu. Ausiabiaga, ehe nomo hamesesia, nomo gogoloba babaiyo. Aufia, ehe no sulu selefemo dobelesia, nomo faiso mebaiyo. Amogubasu, gili Gode sisada, Mole sisada, aalifaba dabalu moloyodoluale dobu.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />
    <char style="w">Falisi</char> ili mole bule hamelomohe, Yesu sulu sunia selefe amone dobelesia, Yesufea mi gogoniba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:28">Mad 23.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:9-14">Lug 18.9-14</ref></char></note>Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gilimo idele inolo si saabiamo, mana isolusu molofeba bamesisia mololo. Auluso, gine asigi muguba hilisebu amo, sunia Gode asigibu. Kegele idele inolohe eleda bule koleba bolomo, Godehe amo wolu kalemolu bolo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu noolo gegoaba walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mad 11.12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu saabia selesia, “Godene sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulidai</char>, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ine suludai, selabia inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yonefea</char> goalu. Auluso, fogo Yone aloiya amifia maugafia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone awalu sulu nafulu selaba yaafe. Ausi, idele inolo sunia Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami suga dedaleyo kiwigaafe. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mad 5.18</ref></char></note>Helefealuda, anakiwida, asigileyomo abeelu dobuso, Godene sulu muguli selelu dobumo, wedino ulenoda asigileyobafale.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Uleno abehe, ene eamono duguba dafasia, ido no disenaga, amo e susugu molofe. Aufia, inolohe, inolo none ido duguba dafulu disenaga, amo eda susugu molofe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe elebeda ufulu inolodai, Lasalusudaine sadalu awalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">Madiyu 5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maga 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Inolo elebeda ufulu uleno alolu. Amohe fagulo yogolelu ogaeagulu, hubabelelumo, mole ana dilomone kakaba ado. E hilia sunia naiyo nafulusu naba ado. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Elebeda ufulu amone molo eno saliba ami, kegele susiba haaliba ado weagulu inolo uleno, ami ufiya alolu. Ene wi, Lasalusu. Ene domalamo, aiyehe naba samodolu. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />E bule koleba mamiasia, elebeda ufulune, naiyo diba ofolo ailalu saabia amifia hodobaisafemo e nabaiyeba aselo. Auba labi, geso milibaifia, ene aiye nalebaba ado.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Dufia, weagulu inolo amo olasi, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ilihe, e dibia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> feele saabia ami ifoba ufulu. Aufasia, inolo elebeda ufulu amoda olasi, ene damenehe e baliba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Danelu ada ami ligia, e naga bule diaba alolu. Ami naga diaba ligia, ehe baaba lagosia, Abalahama hago labi abulu. Aufia, e bosolufalumo, Lasalusu e-mo Abalahamane feele saabia yoba saabi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Aufia, elebeda ufulu inolo amo wuaaba selesia, ‘Nao Abalahama, na de usu iwi naga bule bosolugulu, gahe na yagunagafia, Lasalusu ogo, ene sone gaso hano gefasia, ne eane gesi badimesi malaba saama.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Auluso, Abalahama obegeba selesia, ‘Faibe, ga helefealu aso bebea aloiya amimo, ga kegele saludiale nafulu dobu amofea henelo diabasu alolu. Ausimo, Lasalusu e-mo naga diaba alolu. Auluso, Lasalusu e aga iwi heneba ofolaba labimo, ga aga naga wolu dife. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Aufia kegele no eweda, gilidai ninidai aleba amimo, gana gogolu bule gelelu dobu. Aulune, inolo iwifia gana felagifia, gili labea ugi miyodoluale dobu. Aufia, inolo ugi labemohe gana felagifia, nini labea iwi miyodoluale.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Ausi, inolo elebeda ufulu amo selesia, ‘Nao, ausenaga, na gafea eweguba susiba selesu. Ga alefasia Lasalusu ogo, ne naone moloa malesi hilibaimaleyobile? <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Maumo, ne nelewodali biamo moloa ami kakainabugulu, ilida hele nada naga diaba labea iwi anosi, ehe ilifea haguguba saeyo malesi saamale.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Auluso, Abalahama obegeba selesia, ‘Ge gelewodalimo <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Moseseda</char>, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inoloda, ine sulu selelu dobu amone alegasi, ili amone sulu dubiyo dobu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ausi, elebeda ufulu inolo amo obegeba selesia, ‘Nao Abalahama, auluso, olalu inolo uleno degefia, abia, ilifea sulu selesenaga, amo ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besiyobafe</char>.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ausi, Abalahamahe efea selesia, ‘Ilihe Mosesedai, saaba ofolo inolodai, ine sulu dobelesalenaga, amo hama, olalu inolo uleno degefia abia, ilifea sulu selesenagada, amo ili aso asigi besiyobafale.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Wolu manahe asigi ule ufulu woba ofolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Madiyu 18.6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maga 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Kegele nokene nokenebahe idele inolo wolu molomesi gelebaiba ufiyo holobagagalo. Auluso, kegele woluda auba holobagamesi molofe amo, efeamo woba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ulenohe faibe deseinemo wolu molomesi gelebaiba ofelesenaga, amo ilihe sabesia, ene dogaeyofea abane baliama godaifia, e waiyo galulu gifiamesi dafogosiabiaga, amo nafulu koleba babaiye.<verse eid="LUK 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mad 18.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili gine meleba nafuluba yasimale. Ge gelewo ulenohe wolu molosenaga, ga isosiamo, efea halaleba saamale. Ausi, e <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisenaga</char>, amo gahe ene wolumo <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galimale</char>. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Aulugulu, ehe gafea hilia uleno wolu domoba molosenagada, ga labea fogo domoba asigi besisusia, fogaba sela bobolaba adesenaga, amo ene wolu domoba amone aleba amimo, gahe fogo ule uleba hamasia heesia galibasu melale.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuhe iwi fogo domobaba selefe amo, elosia aufale. Aubale. Hilia sunia aubasu moloba melaleba selesia solu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />
    <char style="w">Saminilo</char> auba selesi, walelu faibili ilihe Efea selesia, “Gahe nine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> bulemesi kiwigaaba homa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mad 17.20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21.21</ref></char></note>Ausi, Saminilohe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gine asigi ule ufulumo maseda sebegulu wedino dobunaga, amo isobu. Ausenaga, gilihe i ewefea selesia, ge seme ogo duguba dibia abia, salu hano dobia kalugaeyo malaba selesimo, i ewehe gine sulu dobelesia, kuliba abia, ami kalugaeyo maiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe dabalu mololo faibiline mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Inolo uleno gili aleba ugi, ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibefea</char> eweguba mololola? Dabalu mololo faibe amo, edo geiya hele yuguliyo, me dofene sibi luba miliyo malaba saafia, e dabalu molofasia moloa obegeba saabimo, efea selesia, ‘Ga ogoba suga milifasia, naiyo naiyone yoba mesaba’ sodola? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Auba sodale. Yasilohe dabalu mololo faibefea eweguba saeyobafe. ‘Ga ne naiyo madenefia, ge fagulo momolofia, ne naiyo sifasia, na naiyone dia mila. Nadale nafasia ligia, dufia ami, nahe ga naiyodai hanodai namenesi fogo meyobasu.’ Yasilo auba saeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Dabalu mololo faibe amohe ene sulu kuliba aasi, yasilohe amone bisigia, efea henelu sulu sodale. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Aulugulu, dabalu gilifea melumo sunia moloba samodosimo, gilida eweguba saamale. ‘Nini dabalu mololo faibili widale lolu. Ninihe dabalu ninifea molomaleba solu amogubasu mololu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe yolida alolu inolo daabuluba waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu E Yelusalame eno aiba amo maiyone abia, disiligi Samaliadai, Galilidai, eloa aleba ami daaba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />E mosomu uleno goasi, inolo daabuluba yolida alolu ilimo, eno kia Yesuda aafea ami milibaifia, hago kalugagafia alebailu. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:45-46">Wkp 13.45-46</ref></char></note>Aufia, ili koleba wuaaba selesia, “Yesu-ooo! Yasilo, Ga koleba nini yagunagama-aaa!” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-3">Wkp 14.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:3-4">Mad 8.3-4</ref></char></note>Yesuhe ili bisigia, ilifea selesia, “Gili abia, gine domala ogo <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inolofea</char> waleyo dedalema.” Auba selesi, ili dedalesi, ine domalamo waisia galagoloba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Ausi, inolo uleno ili aleba ami, ene domala wailu baafia, e Godene wi koleba digiba selabia obegeba mulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />E Yesu labea goasia, Ene emo sisa sauba hanefia, Efea henelu sulu solu. Inolo amo Yuda inoloaleso, Samalia inolo alolu. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Ausi, Yesuhe inolo amo baafia, selesia, “Nahe inolo daabuluba waiba ufuluba hilisesu. Auluso, inolo agofolobamo, wagi labe? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Godene wi digiba saeyone, yau inolo Samalia ewesu mulubile?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ausi, Ehe inolo amofea selesia, “Degefia mala. Ge <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogohe ga waiba ufulu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo miyobafe amone walelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Madiyu 24.23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />
    <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilihe Yesufea eweguba doba abulu. “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adomo, asiga maugaeyobafe?” Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ado maugasimo, idele inolo eloba bamesi molologuba, moloyobafale. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Aubale. Maugasimo, idele inolohe eweguba saeyodoluale miliyobafe. ‘Bama, amo iwi labe, me doma, amo anigi labe.’ Auba saeyobafale, maumo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adomo gine libo usu maugafia labe.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Dufia Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Dufia, fogo ewegulu holobagaeyobafe. Fogo ami, gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibene</char> hilia amo milalebaiyeba hameyobafe. Auluso, gilihe hilia amo babiyobafale. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:21">Mag 13.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:8">Lug 21.8</ref></char></note>Idele inolohe gilifea selesia, ‘Bama, E anigi labe, me E iwi labeba’ saeyobafe. Auluso, gilihe amo sealelaba babiyone, ili kuliba abia dedalemabiyo. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Enebamo, gili eweguba asigima. Anakiwi yabagelesimo, yabagelefe amohe hele sunia neeba sigilo. Inololene Faibe miyobafe amoda amogubasu molosi, idele inolo sunia si babiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Auluso, maugabamo, hilia amo aso holobagabale labi, idele inolo aga kakinabu ewehe Efea faiso mefia labi, E-mo naga wedinale diyo dobu.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Noa aloiya hilia ami mana mololu amogubasu, Inololene Faibe miyo hilia adesimoda, mana aubasu moloyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Noa aloiya fogo amimo, idele inolo ilihe naiyoda hanoda nabia waalesia, inolohe ido diabia dedaleba labi, ido inolofea ifolabia dedaleba labisu, Noa hano sibi sugafe hilia ami elolu. Ausi, hano galusia, hano sibi usuda sugaluale ili amo, sunia woba dafulu.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:20">Stt 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:25">19.25</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo samini <char style="w">Lode</char> hilia aloiya ami kakainalu ili amoda, mana aubasu mololu. Idele inolohe naiyo nabia, hano nabia, kegele noolo elegemesi diba waalesia, edoda gesia, moloda disia waalelu. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Auluso, Lode e <char style="w">Sodomo</char> daunomo gadefia aafe hilia amoyamo, deda, salofada<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Salofa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mo, abane wanogulu, kasine wolu dobolo. Kasine wolu amo, hagaiso sesenelu dobologuba, kalololu dobolo.</char></note>, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> hele hugaloguba, idele inolo dauno usu ami kakainalumofea hugasi, ili sunia woba dafalilu.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Aulugulu, Inololene Faibe ulufafe hilia amoda, amogubasu moloyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mad 24.17-18</ref></char></note>Hilia amoyamo, inolo molo saabia lagi labemo, e ene kegele molo usu dobumo diyone huga abiale, fisaba malale. Inolo edo geiya labemo, kegele ulenoda diyone ene moloa obegeba abiale, fisaba malale. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:17">Stt 19.17</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 19:26">26</ref></char></note>Gilihe kegele Lodene eamonofea mololumo hilisema. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lug 9.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yon 12.25</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, uleno abehe, ene miliyolu fedoba seyo weiyaasenaga, amo e ene miliyolumo daba dafiyobafe. Auluso, uleno abehe, ene miliyolu weasesenaga, amo e ene miliyolumo nafuluba fedoba seyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nahe ewene gilifea selesu, nigiliba amoyamo, inolo aida molobu ule hanefia labi, uleno diba disia, nomo afiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Ido aida aalifaba falawa besiba labi, ulenomo diba disia, nomo afiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Inolo aida edo geiya labi, ulenomo diba disia, nomo afiyobafe.”  <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ene walelu faibilihe Efea selesia, “Saminilo, ogo halayago moloyobafe?” E obegeba selesia, “Haga uso amaleba hauba siba adefea ami, gili hilisesia, kelebulu olalu ami dobububa hiliselo.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amone kiwi sisamo ewe, kegele ami moloyobafemo idele inolo fadaba babiyobafe.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Ido ilisuluhe osolalo inolofea sagoba homaba susiba selabasu alolu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:2">Kol 4.2</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:17">1Des 5.17</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea besi sulu uleno saaba walesia, gilihe hilia sunia, Godedai sulu selabasu ligia, bonemabiyoba walelu. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />E selesia, “Dauno ulenohe osolalo inolo uleno alolu. Osolalo inolo amo e Gode baaba sagililale ligia, idele inolo ilifeada waaselaba bolo. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ausi, ido ilisulu uleno eda dauno ami asulu. Hilia sunia ilisulu amohe osolalo inolo amo labea bobolabasu ligia, selesia, ‘Ne gisahe na woba dafiyo hamefegulu, gahe na sagoba ofelesia, ne godo isoba homa.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Maugabamo, osolalo inolo amohe ido amo sagoba ufiyo hameluale. Auluso, dufia e ene meleba hilisesia, ‘Na-mo, Gode baaba sagililale lolu. Aufia, nahe idele inolo ilifeada waaselaba bolo. <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Auluso, ido ilisulu ewehe hilia sunia na labea bobolaba ligia, nafea higinilu mefe. Aulune, nahe ene godo sagoba ofelesia, isoba ufiyo hilisefe. E hilia no inigia, ne si yabulu melosi, na e sagoba ufiyobasu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Besi sulu auba saaba samodofia, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> selesia, “Besi sulu solumone osolalo inolo ewe, mana isolu kuliba anale. Auluso, e selesia, ilisulu amo sagoba ufiyoba solumo, gili dobelesia hilisema. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Isolu mana mololale inolo auba molosenaga, eweguba asigima. Idele inolo Godehe Ene-ba molobebelelu ilimo, nigilibada, yaidada, Efea yegilibasu labemo, Gode alefasia ilimo sagoba ofelesia, ine godo isoba ofolalela? Aubale. Ehe ine godo isoba ufiyobafe. Godehe ilifea aso baaba melasia, yasimaba saeyobafela? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Aubale. Nahe gilifea selesu, Ehe ilimo alebale sagoba ofelesia, ine godo isoba ufiyobafe. Auluso, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> obegefeyamo, Ehe helefealu iwi idele inolo <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> labi baaba goleyobafela?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falisi inolodai, dagese dilo inolodaihe Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Inolo noolo hilisesia, ili inemo inolo isolusu loluba hilisesia, ilihe inolo noolo sunia baaba ilogolo. Inolo amogulumofea Yesuhe besi sulu ewene solu.<verse eid="LUK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Inolo aida <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele moloa</char> Godedai sulu saeyo daalu. Ulenomo, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo, nomo, dagese dilo inolo. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Falisi inolomo degefia ligia, ene melebasu saaba Godedai sulu selesia, ‘Gode, na inolo noologulu lolualene, na Gafea henesu. Fadilo inoloda, wolu mololoda, susugu mololoda, dagese dilo inolo anogoda, na ili amogulualene na Gafea henesu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:1-4">Ais 58.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:23">Mad 23.23</ref></char></note>Sogo alegalu suniamo, nahe <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyayone</char> hilia aida iminiba ofolo. Aufia, kegele sunia na dife amone daabulumo osolafia, haisimo Gafea melo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:1">Sng 51.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Auluso, dagese dilo inolomo hago yoba ligia, e-mo <char style="w">hebene</char> baaba lagoyone yuasia, ene faga dowesia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele ilihe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">faga dowefemo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, ili yuafesia aufe.</char></note> selesia, ‘Gode, na <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolo. Gahe na kanuluma.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mad 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lug 14.11</ref></char></note>Besi sulu auba saaba samodofia, Yesu selesia, “Na gilifea selesu, dagese dilo inolo e-su Godene si <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">saabia galagololu holobagafia</char>, ene moloa obegeba daalu. Auluso, inolo nomo auba auluale. Mau enebamo, idele inolo suniahe ine wida digibaiyefemo, Godehe ili helea dufa dafogoyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo ine meleba helea adefemo, Godehe ine wi digiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe faibe deseine ediliba waalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Madiyu 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maga 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Idele inolohe ine faibe subobomo, Yesune sonehe ili gemesifia lubia milibailu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe, idele inolofea halaleba selesia, faibe ulubia milibaimabusia kaalu. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Auluso, Yesuhe faibe deseine milaba gagaiyofia selesia, “Faibe deseine ogo, na labea waagi milibaimalema. Gilihe ili ogo kaamabu. Aubale. Maumo, Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo ada amo inolo faibe deseine ewegulu adefe amone dobu. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mad 18.3</ref></char></note>Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, Inolo uleno faibe deseinegulu adesalenaga, amo e Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada usu ami faseba sugaeyobafale.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elebeda ufuluhe Yesune walelu faibe miliyomo afolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Madiyu 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maga 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25">Lug 10.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Guni inolo ulenohe Yesufea eweguba doba abulu. “Walelo nafulu, na eneba molosi, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> diyobi?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu obegeba selesia, “Enesi Ga nafea nafuluba selese? Uleno nafulu male, Gode ule elebisu nafulu labe. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Kis 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Lo 5.16-20</ref></char></note>Gahe Godene sulu muguli selelu dobumo hilisebu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 18:20" />
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 18:20">
    <char style="qt">Ido fa dimabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 18:20">
    <char style="qt">Inolo dufa olamabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 18:20">
    <char style="qt">Kegele fa dimabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 18:20">
    <char style="qt">No anogofea masega godomabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 18:20">
    <char style="qt">Gaodai gaedai sisa ligia, </char></para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 18:20">
    <char style="qt">aine sulu kuliba malale.</char> ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yesu auba selesi, elebeda ufulu inolomo selesia, “Na aso faibe wedino waagifia adabia inigia, Godehe molomalelu sulu amo na sunia kuliba abia mololo.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesuhe sulu e selefe amo dofasia, efea selesia, “Ga kegele uleno aso mololualemone moloyo dobu. Ge kegele dobu ogo sunia elegeba samodofia, mole ga dife amo weagulufea memale. Ga auba molosenaga, gahe kegele nafulu koleba, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi ge samolo diba ufiyobafe. Auba molofasia, ga Na kuliba milale.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Auluso, inolo amohe sulu amo dobelesia, ene libo higinilu. Maumo, e elebe wedinale koleba ufulune aulu. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesuhe e sidafia ligia, selesia, “Elebeda ufulu inolomo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami sugaeyobafemo kolelu koleba dobu. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Kelebulu hagolu bule, <char style="w" lemma="Kamele">kamelemo</char>, asogolo aleba eno sugaeyomo lilibula? Lilibuale. Amogubasu, elebeda ufulu inolo uleno, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami sugaeyomo, kolelune kolelu koleba.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Idele inolo sulu Yesu selesi dobolaba alolu amohe, Efea doba bisigia selesia, “Amo aulunaga, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulu</char> miliyobafemo, abe kolebabi?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu obegeba selesia, “Kegele inolo moloyodoluale dobu amo, Gode moloyodolu dobu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> Efea selesia, “Doma, nini Ga kuliba miyone kegele sunia nini ufulumo afasia milibailu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29-30" />Yesu ilifea selesia, “Na seale gilifea selesu, inolo abehe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone hilisefia, moloda, eamonoda, elewoda, enaodai enaedaida, faibeda, afaliba yaalu labe amo, e aso helefealu iwi ligiamo, kegele amogulu wedinale efea sabe obegeba meba yaeyobafe. Kegele amohe e samini ufulumo haiba waseyobafe. Aufasia, hilia nafulu dufia adesimo, e miliyolu miliyo diyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu osolo saabia selesia, E olafia haiba degeyoba saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Madiyu 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maga 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:44">Lug 24.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili aniba ulubia daafia, ilibisufea selesia, “Doma, nini Yelusalame fela maiyo dedalesugulu, samini <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolohe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibefea</char> moloyobafeba seleba ufulumo, aga koleba wakaliba hugaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32-33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9.22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:44">44</ref></char></note>Idele inolo ilihe, E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ine sone saabia ufiyobafe. Ilihe Efea baaba gaidesia, woba molosia, gau dowesia, efolo fegosia, E dufa olaeyobafeso, hilia osolomo E haiba degeyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:32">Mag 9.32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu auba selesi, Ene walelu faibilihe sulu E selefe amo, nafuluba fadaba asigiluale. Sulu Yesu solu amone kiwi sisamo, aso muguba ufiasu labi, ilihe sulu E selefemo, nafuluba fadaba asigiba duluale.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe si kalalu uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Madiyu 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maga 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili Yeligo dauno aniba goasi, si kalalu inolo uleno eno aniba yoba sigia, mole kegele haaliba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ehe idele inolo wamili milibaifemone dobelesia, e ilifea doba bisigia, “Ogo ene molofe?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Ilihe efea selesia, “Nasaledene Yesumo suniaba aafe.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Amo dofasia, e wuaaba selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> faibe, Yesu-ooo! Ga na yagunagama-aaa!” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Idele inolo saminiba milibailu ilihe, efea saumasia halaleba solu. Auluso, e haiba koleba wuaaba selesia, “Deibidine Faibe-eee! Ga na yagunagama-aaa!” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu E kalugaafia, selesia, Inolo ogo ulubia Na labea milalemaba solu. Ausi, si kalalu hagoaleba saabi, Ehe efea doba bisigia selesia, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Na gafea amene molomesi hamefe?” E obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, na haiba bebeleyo hamefe.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ge si ogo haiba bebelema! Ge <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogohe ga waife.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Ausi, alebale hamagi, ene si waisi, e haiba bebelesia, e Yesu kuliba abia, Godene wi digiba selabia daalu. Ausi, idele inolo suniahe amo bafasia, ilida Godene wi digiba solu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Dagese dilo Sakiesehe Yesu kuliba maiyo maugalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu Yeligo dauno sugafia, suniaba maiyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Aufia, bosolufalumo, inolo ene wi Sakiese ami asulu. E dagese dilone yasilo uleno ligia, elebe wedinale ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ehe inolo Yesu ewe halagulubiba babiyo hamelu. Auluso, idele inolo wedinalehe Yesu amaleba galisi, e babiyodoluale alolu. E inolo abobone aulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Aulugulu, Yesu babiyofia, edale saminiba naguba abia, olono i uleno fela daalu. E hilisesia, Yesumo eno amo miyobafeba asigilu.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ausi, i Sakieseda felafia labea ami goafia, Yesuhe baaba lagofia, efea selesia, “Sakiese, ga alebale suga mila. Aga Na ge moloa sobele misiyone aasu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Auba selesi, e alebale suga milifasia, ene libo heafusia, Yesu ene moloa heneba luba dulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:2">Lug 15.2</ref></char></note>Idele inolo suniahe molofe amo bafasia, gogomoba selesia, “Ogomo, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolo ulenone moloa sobele aafebu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:1">Kis 22.1</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 5:6-7">Nam 5.6-7</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, ene molo usu, Sakiese degefia ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> selesia, “Bama! Saminilo, aga nahe, ne kegelemo sunia aidaba osolafia, haisimo weagulu idele inolofea meyobasu. Aufia, nahe inolo ulenone kegele fa dulunaga, amo na obegeba mesiamo, efea binibaba duguba meyo.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:31">HD 16.31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:16">Lug 13.16</ref></char></note>Yesu efea selesia, “Agamo, idele inolo molo iwi kakainabumo, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba dife. Enebamo, inolo ewe eda, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> mosomu faibe labe. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:4-5">Lug 15.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:17">Yon 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:15">1Dim 1.15</ref></char></note>Maumo, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> mulumo, idele inolo daba dafulumone isafasia, ili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diba</char> obegeyone mulu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yasilo ulenohe ene dabalu mololo faibilifea mole melu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Madiyu 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Idele inolo ili aso Yesu sulu selefemo dobolaba labi, Ehe besi sulu noda aso gegoaba solu. Maumo, E Yelusalame aniba goafia labi, idele inolo hilisesia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adomo aga yagi holobagaeyobafeba hiliselu. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Aulugulu, E selesia, “Inolo wida solu ulenomo, ilihe e kini gadefamesi hele hago daalu. E abiamo, dufia obegeba miyofia daalu. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />E aso daabale ligia, ehe ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo faibili</char> daabulubamo, e labea milafasia, ili ule ulebafea, silifa mole fula ule uleba meba yaalu. Auba meba yaasia, e ilifea selesia, ‘Gili mole ewe difasia, bisinesi dabalu molobasu ligia, na saabi elomale.’ E mole auba ilifea meba yaafia, e daalu.<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Auluso, ene mosomu idele inolomo e babiyo habolu. Aufia, e daafia labi, ilihe inolo noolo sulu dia malesi e daaiya ami hilibaisia, selesia, ‘Ninihe inolo ewe nine kini melesi hamebuale.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Auluso, hele hago ami ilihe e kini gadefasia iminisi, dufia e obegeba mulu. Ausi, E obegeba milifasia, selesia, ‘Balu dabalu mololo faibili, samini na mole ilifea meba yaalumo, na labea milibaimalema. Inolo ule ulebahe mole huliane halaguba dululaba na babiyo hamefe.’<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ausi, inolo agelemo edale inigia, selesia, ‘Yasilo, nahe ge silifa mole fula ule amohe, bisinesi dabalu mololumo, huliane haiba fula daabuluba no dulu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:10">Lug 16.10</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, ene yasilo selesia, ‘Na gafea henesu. Ne dabalu mololo faibe nafulu ga. Kegele wedino ga afelesiale, sigi doba mololugulu, nahe ga dauno daabuluba yasimesi iminifia gadefasu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Dabalu mololo faibe aganebomo milifasia, e selesia, ‘Yasilo, nahe ge silifa mole fula ulemohe, bisinesi dabalu mololumo, huliane haiba fula bia no dulu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Auba selesi, ene yasilomo efea selesia, ‘Ga dauno biamo yasimesi gadefasu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Ausi, dabalu mololo faibe nomo inigia, selesia, ‘Yasilo, ge silifa mole fula sebu ewe. Nahe ge molemo fagulo gelelu no masoba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nahe ga baaba sagililu, maumo, ga inolo kolelu koleba. Kegele ga diba ufulualemo, ga waagi dilo. Aufia, sebe edo ga gelualemo, ga waagi suba ado.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Auba selesi, ene yasilo selesia, ‘Ga dabalu mololo faibe wolu koleba. Sulu gene selefe ogo alefasia, na ga osolaba dafelesu. Na inolo kolelububamo, ga asigibula? Kegele na diba ufulualemo, na waagi diaba ligia, sebe edo na gelualemo, na waagi suba ado labebuba hilisesela? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Ga auba hilisesenaga, ne molemo, mau enesi begi ufuluale? Begi ami ufulubiaga, na obegeba inigiamo, mole huliane nooloda na dibaiyo.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ausi, yasilohe balu dabalu mololo inolo noolo ami yoba alebaibu amofea selesia, ‘Ene silifa mole fula ule e sebu ogo, sagoba difasia, fula daabuluba sebu anogofea mema.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Ausi, ilihe efea selesia, ‘Yasilo, e-mo fula daabuluba ama sefia labe.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mad 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lug 8.18</ref></char></note>E obegeba selesia, ‘Na gilifea selesu, inolo abehe kegeleda sefia labemo, efea saabia noolo gegoaba meyobafe. Auluso, inolo kegeleda sebale labemo, kegele wedino e sebu amo, efea sagoba diyobafe.’<verse eid="LUK 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />‘Aufia, ne gisa ili ogo na ine kini melesi hamebualene, gilihe ili ogo uluba dibia milifasia, na si saabia dufa danema.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E dogi saabia asefasia, kinigulu Yelusalame suga mulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Madiyu 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maga 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yone 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Besi sulu amo safasia, Yesuda ili Yelusalame lago maiyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ili mosomu Bedefagedai, Bedanidai, hagoaleba, hele gale Olifiba soda ami goasia, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> amone aida nomo hilibaisia, aalufea selesia, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Aali mosomu dobia anigi mala. Aali mosomia ami goasiamo, <char style="w">dofene dogi</char> kalofo uleno kiliseba dobi babiyobafe. Dofene dogi amomo inoloda aso aselale. Amo fisigafia, iwi lubia milale. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ulenohe aalifea wanesia, eneyone aali ogo fisigaseba selesenaga, aali efea selesia, ‘Saminilohe efea dabalu moloyo dobuba’ saamale. ” <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Yesuhe aalu hilibaisi, daafia, goasia, bosolufalumo, kegele sunia E soluguba mololu dobi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Aaluhe dofene dogi kiliselumo fisigaba labi, dogi enaohe aalufea wanesia selesia, “Aali ne dofene dogi ogo eneyone fisigase?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Ausi, aalu obegeba selesia, “Saminilohe efea dabalu moloyo dobu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Aufia, aaluhe dofene dogimo, Yesu labea lubia mulu. Aufia, aine fagulo saligalo seselamo hufasia, dofene dogi saabia feaba ufulu. Aufia, aaluhe Yesu dofene dogi saabia mesesi sagoba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu E dofene dogi saabia asefia aasi, idele inolo ine fagulo selalemo hufasia, eno aiba fefeaba waalelu. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yesuda ili miliba labeofia, Olifi galea afasia, Yelusalame sidi sugaeyone eno hagoaleba goayo sugasi, Eda kuliba silo idele inolo wamili ili sunia nokene heneba yaalu. <char style="w">Momolelu kegele</char> sunia ili abulu amone hilisesia, ili koleba wuaaba yaasia, Godene wi eweguba digiba selaba yaalu.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sng 118.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:14">Lug 2.14</ref></char>
    </note>“<char style="qt">Kini ewe, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">Saminilone wi alefasia </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">saabe-eee!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">Efea wabialesia, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">Ene wi digimo-ooo!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">Gode <char style="w">Hebene</char> Labe Lagone</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">wi elalemesi digimo-ooo!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">Hebene lagi</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo mana</char> wasigafe-eee!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Ausi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> noolo wamili aleba alolumohe, Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, Gada kuliba silo idele inolo ogo isosia, ilifea halaleba saama!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Auluso, E selesia, “Na gilifea selesu, ili amo sausagasenaga, abane ili koleba Godene wi digiba selaba yaabaiyo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />E Yelusalame hagoaleba adesia, sidi amone bisigia, amone saabia E yeelu. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />E selesia, “Yelusalame-ooo! Hilia aga yaagi ga aeaba melesi moloyobafemo, ga asigimesi Na hamebaiye. Auluso, amo ga si babiyomo hagubu. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Dufia, hilia uleno holobagasia, ge gisa milibaifia, hele dauna galabia abia, ge yala bule ogo amaleba galiyobafe. Aufia, ilihe ga saguba gaeyone, hele fogo sunia gele mabuyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:6">Lug 21.6</ref></char></note>Ilihe yala olaboba dafaliba ilogosia, gada, ge faibe gadai yala usu kakainabu ogoda, hele saabia saidafaliba ilogosia, woba dafaliyobafe. Aufia, ilihe ge abane yalalu ogoda, ge molo suniada, olabofia bidiba dafaliyobafe. Maumo, Godehe ga sagoba homesi Na hilibailuso, gahe Na amobuba auba eloba besabeale.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo sebele moloa kegele elegesia waleba labi, Yesuhe ili aiba gasaba yaalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Madiyu 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maga 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yone 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ausi, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu sugafia, Ehe idele inolo bisinesi dabaluda ami molosia waalelumo aiba gasaba dafalilu. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Ais 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7.11</ref></char></note>Ehe ilifea selesia, “Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu, ‘<char style="qt">Ne molomo, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> ada amone molo miliyobafe.</char>’ Auluso, gilihe molo ewe fadilo inolo muguba misiyo molo gadefalubu.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus clears the temple" file="IB04118.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="19.45-46">Inolo sebele moloa kegele elegesia waleba labi, Yesuhe ili aiba gasaba yaafe.</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Lug 21.37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufasia, Ehe hilia sunia sebele moloa yala usu Godene sulu mana idele inolofea waleba alolu. Ausi, soba melo inolone yasiloda, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane walelo inoloda</char>, aufia guni inoloda, ili suniahe Yesu dufiyone eno isaba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Auluso, ili auba moloyone eno ulenoda abuluale. Enebamo, idele inolo suniahe Ene sulu kiwigaaba dubiyone hameba yaalu.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesufea selesia, Ga wida solu ogo, abehe gafea meluba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Madiyu 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maga 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Hilia uleno, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu ami, idele inolofea Godene sulu mana waleba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, guni inoloda, ili sunia Yesu labea milibailu. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Ili selesia, “Kegele ga molofe ogo moloyone wida solu kiwigagalu ogo, wagifia dulu? Abehe Gafea wabialelo wi mesi, Ga auba molose? Ninifea saaba mema.” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Auba doba besabi, E ilifea obegeba selesia, “Nada gilifea doba besabimo, gilida Nafea obegeba saamale. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" /><char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalelu amomo, e mana ewe wagifia dulu? <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenefia</char> molomasi mololula, me inolone hilise alefasia mololula?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Yesu ilifea auba doba besabi, ilihe ine geleba nenesia selesia, “Nini hebenefia molomasi mololuba selesenaga, amo E ninifea eweguba saeyobafe. ‘Gili sulu e selefemo sigidubuluale ogo, mau enesi ause?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Auluso, nini selesia, ‘Amo inolone kegeleba’ selesenaga, amo idele inolo suniahe Yonemo <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo alolububa hilisesia, nini abane uliyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Aulugulu, ilihe Yesufea selesia, “Yonemo mana wagifia dulubi, nini hilisebuale.” <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Amo Nahe wi halagulu alefasia dabalu molosuba, gilifeada saeyale.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo wolu ilihe waini gelu uluba alolumone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Madiyu 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maga 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Ais 5.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuhe idele inolofea besi sulu uleno eweguba solu. “Inolo ulenohe <char style="w">waini</char> edo gelu. Aufia ehe gelu amo yasifia luba melesine, inolo noolone sone saabia ufulu. Auba molofasia, e fogo selale hele nolobalo miliyo daalu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ausi, waini sebe suiyo hilia adesi, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibe</char> uleno hilibaisia, waini gelu yasiba ado alebaibia ami malalu. Ilihe waini sebe sufasia, seba waalebu amone e diyoguba imini difasia, faibe amofea memesi aulu. Auluso, dabalu mololo faibe amo ami goasi, gelu yasiba ado ili amohe e dufasia, balu obegeba malalu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Ausi, gelu enaohe dabalu mololo faibe no ilifea hilibailu. Auluso, ilihe amoda dufasia, efea yuaeyodolu molofasia, e balu obegeba malalu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Ausi, ehe saabia dabalu mololo faibe osoloda hilibailu. Aufia, ilihe eda naga mefasia, waini geiya ami baea saidafulu.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Ausi, wainida gelu enao amo selesia, ‘Na eneba moloyobi? Nahe ne faibe, nene hameselu amone hilibaiyobasu. Ilihe e baaba momolesia, ene sulu dubiyobafebile?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Auluso, gelu yasiba ado ilihe ene faibe saabe baafia, ili aleba nenesia selesia, ‘Inolo ewehe enaone daalo sunia diyobafe. Mila, ninihe e dufa olasia, ene daalomo nini diyoba.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Auba nenefasia, ilihe e waini geiya amifia fafufia saidafasia, e dufa olalu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Besi sulu auba saaba samodosia, Yesu selesia, “Gili eneba hilisefe, waini gelu enaomohe, gelu yasifia luba adomofea mana halaguba moloyobafe? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />E milifasiamo, geluda uluba ado ili amo yasoba dafalifia, waini gelu amo inolo noolofea meyobafe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Idele inolo ilihe Yesu auba selefe amo dofasia, ili selesia, “Auba moloba dafelagomesialeba asigifeba” solu.<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sng 118.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:42">Mad 21.42</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">HD 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Lom 9.33</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:11">1Kld 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6-8">1Fid 2.6-8</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe ilifea si galiba sidasia selesia, “Auluso, auba molosalenaga, amo Godene bugo selelu dobumone sulu kiwi sisamo amene?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">Abanemo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">moloda dilo ilihe wolubusia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">waaselaba abulu amo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">Aga abane amomo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">moloda kiwigaaba sefia melesine,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">duguiya ikau olaibo gadefalu labe.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Ais 8.14-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Inolo abane amofea siginaba gelebaisenaga, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:18">
    <char style="qt">amo ene kiwi nenamuba dafiyobafe. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:18">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, abane amo inolo uleno saabia hodobaisenaga, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:18">
    <char style="qt">inolo amo sauba dafiyobafe.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />
    <char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, Yesu besi sulu amo selefe dofasia, ilihe E alebale seyone eno isalu. Maumo, ili hilisesia, Ehe besi sulu amo selesia, ine ili iminiba solububa hiliselu. Auluso, ilimo idele inolo gagaiyolu amo baaba sagilisia, afolu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dagese molemo Sisafea meyobileba doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Madiyu 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maga 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 11:54">Lug 11.54</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, muguli manane dawalolu inoloda, ilihe Yesu nafuluba enogele alolu. Aufia, ilihe aibasilo noolo E bamesi hilibaisalu. Inolo ili amo masega isolugulu alebaifia, ene sulu dubiyofia aulu. Ilihe E gegesia, E sulu uleno heleba selesi, ilihe Ene sulu amofea alefasia, E gamanene yasilo amone sone saabia ufiyone aulu. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Aulugulu, aibasilo dedalelu ilihe, Efea eweguba doba abulu. “Walelo, nini hilisebu, Ge sulu ogo isolune, Gahe idele inolofeamo sulu isolusu saaba melo. Aufia, Ga suniafea sulu selesiamo, inolo widafeada, widalefeada, imini uluse sodo. Ga seale sulu sodohe, Godene manamo idele inolofea walelo. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Aulugulu, Ga eneba hilisebu? Ninihe dagese mole Lomene kini <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisafea</char> waagi ufiyo isobubile, me isobualebile?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ili auba selesi, Yesu bisigia, ilihe auba wanefemo, E gegeyo weiyaafebuba abulu. Aulugulu, Ehe ilifea selesia, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Lome gamane mole iso uleno, Nafea walema. Mimisililuda, wida, mole ogofea dobu ogo, abenebu?” Ausi, ili selesia, “Sisane mimisililububa solu.” <figure style="fig" alt="Coin with Caesar's image" file="HK00166B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="20.21-26">Lome gamane molemo, Sisane mimisililu walefe.</figure> <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Auba selesi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Sisanemo, Sisafea mema. Godenemo, Godefea mema.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ausi, Yesuhe idele inolo si saabia sulu ami solumo alefasia, E gegefia seyodoluale alolu. Sulu E obegeba solumo alefasia, ili hidigiba yaafia sausagalu.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadiyusi ilihe inolo olafia haiba degelomone Yesudai sulu hegelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Madiyu 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maga 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />
    <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> inolo noolo Yesu labea milibailu. Sadiyusi mosomu ili amomo, inolo danelumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> gaalaleba sodo. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Lo 25.5</ref></char></note>Inolo ili amohe Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> nineba eweguba seleba ufulu. <char style="qt">Inolo uleno ido difasia, faibeda male ligia olasenaga, amo ene elewohe ido ilisulu amo difasia, ene elewo olalumone mosomu amo mimilosifia, faibe seba gaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Aulugulu, doma. Hilia uleno, elewodali domoba asulu. Olaibomohe ido difasia, e faibeda male ligia, olalu. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ausi, elewo aganebo amohe, ido ilisulu amo difasia, eda olalu. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Aufia dufia, elewo osolo amohe ido amo difasia, olalu. Elewodali domoba amohe ido ilisulu amo difasia, faibeda male ligia, ili daneba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Aufia, kaaba dafelesiamo, ido ilisulu amoda olalu. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Elewodali domoba amohe ido ule hamagane dulugulu, danelu ili amo seale haiba degeba gaasenaga, ido amo abene eamono koleba miliyobafebi?” Sadiyusi ilihe Yesufea auba doba abulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sadiyusi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ilihe danelu degeba gaalaleba asigi ule ufulu. Sadalu solu ewe alefasia, ilihe Yesufea dabagalaba ofelesia, E elawanemesisia aulu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Fogo aga kakainabu ili ewemo, inolohe idele diaba yaasi, idelemo inolo dedalelo. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Auluso, idele inolo Godehe dufia degeba ifoyone iminilu ili amo, Edai alefalu miliyolu miliyobafe. Auba ligia, fogo amimo, ilihe ido disiale, ideleda inolo maiyobafale. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Aubale. Ili Godene sulu dia anogulu ligia, haiba saabia no olaeyodoluale miliyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kis 3.6</ref></char></note>Doma. Mosese ehe nini walesia, idele inolo olafemo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeloba</char> walelu. Enebamo, Mosesehe i de waiyafea ami, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> sulu selesia, e eweguba solu. <char style="qt">‘<char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> Gode, Aisegene Gode, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> Gode, Ga labe.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Mosese auba solune, nini eweguba hilisebu. Gode E daneba yaalune Gode-ale. Aubale. E bebea alebaibumone Gode. Ene si saabiamo idele inolo sunia bebea kakainabu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">Muguli manane dawalolu inolohe</char> Yesu sulu selefe amo dofasia, ilihe Efea selesia, “Walelo, Ga selefe ogo nafulu koleba.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ausi, inolo suniahe sagilisia, saabia no Efea doba abuluale.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keliso E abene faibe?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Madiyu 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maga 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Aufia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisomo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> faibeba selefe ewemo, ili enesi selefe? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42-43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Gasa Bugo selelu dobia ami, Deibidi ene ehe eweguba ulufaba selefe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:42-43" />
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42-43">
    <char style="qt">‘Saminilo Ehe, ne Saminilofea eweguba solu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42-43">
    <char style="qt">Ga Ne sone lilibefealo yoba aselesiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42-43">
    <char style="qt">Nahe ge gisa inolomo ge emo sisa waalemesi yasiba mela.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:42-43" />
  <para style="m" vid="LUK 20:42-43">Deibidihe auba seleba ufulu dobu. <verse eid="LUK 20:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Gili bama. Deibidihe Kelisofea, Ga ne Saminiloba selesenaga, Keliso E halaguba Deibidine faibe miliyobafebi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muguli manane walelo ine mana wolu amone nafulubaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Madiyu 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maga 12.38-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:37-54">Lugu 11.37-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Idele inolo sunia dobolaba labi, Yesu Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> eweguba solu. <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane walelo inolo</char> ili nafuluba yasimale. Enebamo, ilihe fagulo sesela siligaba nafulusu kakafia, gagaiyola helea ami, idele inolo ilidale wakalimesisia, misi waleba siyo hamelo. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu aselesiamoda, wida solu molobu amisu kakainayo hamelo. Aufia, naiyo bule naiyone gagaiyosiamo, ili wida solumone molobu saabia kakainayo hamelo. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Ilihe idele ilisulu nafuluba uluba adesiale, ine mole kegeleda ilifea meba yaamesisia, gegeba ado. Aufia, ili Godedai sulu selesiamo, masega selale domadomaba koleba sodo. Osolaeyo hilia adesimo, naga inolo amogulumo diyobafe amohe, inolo no naga diyobafemo waseyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Weagulu idohe Godefea mole ulu melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maga 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu E sebele molo yala usu ligia, moleda dafogolo bogose aniba ami yoba asulu. Aufia, E ami yoba sigia, sidafia ligia, elebeda ufulu inolo milibaifia, ulu molemo bogose usu ami dafaliba ilogofia dedaleba labi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Aufia, Ehe ido ilisulu weagulu ulenohe mole iso wedino aida bogose usu ami dafogosi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:12">2Kld 8.12</ref></char></note>E selesia, “Na seale gilifea selesu, ido ilisulu weagulu ewehe, idele inolo noolo mole dafogolumo suniaba bule dafogofe. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Enebamo, idele inolo sunia mole dafogosiamo, ilihe ine mole selo gofo wasigafia, huliane galeba dalefe amonesu haisi difasia dafogoso. Auluso, ido ilisulu weagulu ewehe, ene mole naiyo elegeyone sobo ufulumo, sunia dafogoso.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sebele molo woyobafeba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Madiyu 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maga 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Ene walelu faibili noolohe, <char style="w">sebele molo</char> dulu amone sidafia ligia, eweguba solu. “Abane yogolelu nooloda, ulu kegele idele inolohe Godefea melumoda difasia, ilihe molo ewe haideleba momadaba ufulubu.” Auba selesi, Yesu selesia, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:44">Lug 19.44</ref></char></note>“Nahe kegele gili aga iwi besabe ewene, gilifea saaba meyobasu. Dufia hilia no holobagasimo, ilihe sebele molo dulu ewe gogolefia, saidafaliba ilogoyobafe. Ausi, abane ewe, no no saabiaba sesagulaba waaleyobafale.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe higinilu holobagagaeyobafe amone solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Madiyu 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maga 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Ausi, ilihe Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “Walelo, kegele ewe asiga holobagaeyobafe? Eloba babiyo kegele amenedale holobagasi, aleba eloyo hilia hagoalefeba nini eneba babiyobi?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Gili nafuluba. Ilihe gili gegelosi yasiba melale. Enebamo, inolo wedinale milibaifia, ne wi saaba selesia, ‘Na Keliso loluba’ gegesia saeyobafe. Aufia, ili selesia, ‘Hilia hagoalefeba’ saeyobafe. Auluso, gilihe ili kuliba malabiyo. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Gilihe sulu gi dobelesia, yobofeba solu dubiyobafe. Aufia, noolo ilihe degefia, ine gamane besisia, duguba dafelefeba solu gili dubiyobafe. Amo nafuluba, gili hidigifia sagilimabiyo. Kegele amodale samini holobagaeyo dobu. Auluso, aleba eloyo hiliamo aso alebale holobagaeyobafale.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Hele nolobalo idele inolohe, hele nolobalodai gisa diaba yaeyobafe. Kini yasiba ado nohe, kini yasilo nodai yoboyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Heleli bule helefealu iwi sigiba yaeyobafe. Aufia, helefealu nolobalomo, mamia gi buledai, walefa gi buledai, holobagagaba yaeyobafe. Aufia, anakiwi lagimo, gilihe eloba babiyo bule nokene nokeneba besabi, gili sagilimesi kegele nooloda moloba yaeyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Auluso, kegele amo sunia aso holobagabale labi, ilihe gili sefia, woba waaleyobafe. Aufia, ilihe gili <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloa</char> ami yoba mesafia godofia, gili sefia dibolo dafaliba ilogoyobafe. Ilihe Ne wi dufa dafogoyofia, gilimo gamanedai, kinidai, ine olegia yoba melesi lubia maiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ausi, fogo amimo, gilihe asigi ule ufulu ogone mau amone ilifea fadaba saeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lug 12.11-12</ref></char></note>Auluso, gilihe ilifea gine meleba subuyone sulu eneba saeyobisia, keleba hilisemabiyo. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:10">HD 6.10</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, fogo ami, Nene Nahe sulu gine mofeo saabia diba ofelesia, aufia Nahe asigilo nafuluda gilifea meyo. Ausi, fogo amo inolo ili gilida osolafe amohe, sulu Nahe gilifea melu ogomo, ilihe saaba obegeyodoluale miliyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:21-22">Mad 10.21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gine gaodali, gaedalida, gine gelewodalida, gine mosomudalida, gine damenedalida, ili amohe gilimo gisane sone saabia ufiyobafe. Aufia, ilihe gili noolo dufa daneyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Ne wi gilifea dobu ogo alefasia, idele inolo suniahe gilifea gogoloba babiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Auluso, gine guni kaau ulenoda daba dafiyobafale. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Gili koleba kiwigaafia kalugasiamohe miliyolu diyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Yesu saabia selesia, “Gilihe Yelusalame ogo yobolo inolohe amaleba galifia alebaibi besenaga, amo gili hilisesia, sidi ogo woba dafiyomo hagoale adefebuba hilisemale. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Fogo amoyamo, idele inolo Yudia kakainabu gili, hele galefealo fisaba dedalemale. Aufia, idele inolo Yelusalame sidine yala usu kakainabu gili, sidi amo gadefia nolobalo dedaleba yaamale. Aufia, idele inolo yau kakainabu gili, sidi usu ami suga malabiyo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:29">Jer 5.29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:10">46.10</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9.7</ref></char></note>Auba molomalelumone maumo, hilia amo, Godene bugo usu selelu dobumo wakaliba sugasia, sabe naga meyone hilia adefe. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Hilia fogo amo, idele faibeda kakainabumoda, enaedali faibefea bu meba yaafemoda, ili amofea yeele! Yagunagalu bule. Mau enebamo, higinilu bule helefealu holobagasia, aufia gadilo bulemo mosomu ewefea ufiyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:1">Sng 79.1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:2">MUU 11.2</ref></char></note>Ine gisa milibaifasia, ilihe noolo helebesi dufa daneba yaeyobafe. Aufia, ilihe noolo dofaba yaafia luba dibia, helefealu nolobalo nolobaloba miliyo dedaleyobafe. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> inolone emohe Yelusalame emelafia ligiasu, Godehe yau inolofea Yelusalame waagi yasimesi iminifia gadefalu fogomo, ililisi afiyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dufia Inololene Faibe obegeba miyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Madiyu 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maga 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Fogo amoyamo, eloba babiyo nokene nokeneba halofeada, aubefeada, sigabifeada holobagagaeyobafe. Aufia, helefealu iwimo, idele inolo mosomu suniane asigimo woba dafelesia, salu hano galulu fufulesia, gala dafelefemo dubiyobafe. Ausi, ili keleba hilisesia, sagiliba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Idele inolo wedinalehe, helefealu iwi kegele holobagagaeyobafemone keleba hiliseba yaeyobafe. Anakiwi lagone kiwimoda bubuliba yaasi, ili bule koleba sagilisia, ine si dabeleba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:64">Mad 26.64</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">MUU 1.7</ref></char></note>Auba molosi, idele inolo ilihe <char style="qt"><char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> kiwigagalu bule alefasia <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleludai</char>, iwa aleba suga saabi babiyobafe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Kegele amo sunia maugasia holobagagasimo, gili kalugaafia, gine guni isofia, sagilibale yasifia melale. Maumo, gilida gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyomo, hagoale labe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gili koleba olono i bisigia, asigilo dimale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Madiyu 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maga 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesuhe besi sulu ewene ilifea solu. “Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono ida</char>, i sunia nooloda, beaba melale. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Gilihe iwalu hili ifea kaau gagasi besenaga, amo gili bisigia, heleso gi hagoale adefebuba eloba bolo. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Aubasu, gilihe kegele amo molosi besenaga, amo gili hilisesia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo hagoale labebuba hilisemale. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Na seale gilifea selesu, idele inolo saladegelu aga kakainabu ewe, aso danebale alebaibi, kegele ewe sunia holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Helefealuda anakiwida asigileyobafe. Auluso, Ne sulu mana asigileyobafale.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelu faibili gili nafuluba yasimale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gili nafuluba yasimale. Gili waini hano bule nafasia, gili kagoalosi. Aufia gilimo, domalane kegele amosu keleba hiliselosi. Mana amogulumohe gili dufa dafogosi, gili yasibale labi, Saminilone hilia saabimo, gili kani wadoguba wadosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Maumo, hilia amo, helefealu idele inolo kakainabu suniafea holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Hilia sunia gili yasifia melale. Aufia, Godehe gilifea kiwi memesi, hilia sunia <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selabasu</char> melale. Aufia, kegele sunia auba holobagafea ami, gili siba daafia malesi, Edai sulu selabasu melale. Ausi, dufia gili <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibene</char> si saabia kalugaeyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Hilia sunia, Yesuhe idele inolofea <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu ami, Godene sulu mana walebasu alolu. Auluso, nigilibamo, E abia, hele gale Olifiba soda ami haneyo daaba ado. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Aufia, idele inolo sunia keafa nigilibale koleba degefia, sebele moloa milibaifia, Ene sulu dubiyone milibailo.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesu guni inolo ilifea holonoba meyoba eelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Madiyu 26.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maga 14.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yone 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />
    <char style="w">Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo Hilia</char> hagoale alolu. Sigilo Hilia amo, ili wi no mesia, <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> Hiliaba sodo. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Sigilo Hilia sogo alegalu amo hagoale labi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu</char> ilida, Yesu dufa olaeyone eno isaba alolu. Ilihe idele inolo baaba sagilisia, auba muguba moloyone eno isalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:2">Yon 13.2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:27">27</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenemo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodoba</char> sodo amone libo sugalu. Yesune walelu faibili huguluba amone nomo, e. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ausi, Yudasa e abia, soba melone guni inoloda, sebele molone yasilone guni inoloda, ili labea daalu. Aufia, ehe ilidai Yesu halaguba ilifea holonoba meyobiba nenelu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Inolo ili amohe henefasia, ilihe Yudasafea mole noolo meyoba eelu. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ausi, Yudasahe ilidai sulu eefia, ehe Yesumo ine sone saabia ufiyone eno isaba alolu. Ehe idele inolo wamili Yesudai adefale fogo amone holobagamesi yasilu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelu faibe aidahe naiyo madenelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Madiyu 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maga 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yone 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kis 12.1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo Hilia</char> holobagalu. Sigilo hilia amimo, Isolaele idele inolo ilihe dofene sibi edo dufasia, de saufia, henesia nolo. Godehe ili Isibifia obegeba dulumone hiliseba obegeyone aulo. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Sigilo Hilia amo holobagasi, Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, hilibaisia, aalufea selesia, “Aali abia, <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> amone nini naiyo naiyomo, madeneyone malale.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Ausi, aaluhe Efea selesia, “Gahe ani koleba wagi madeneyo malesi hamefe?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ehe aalufea obegeba selesia, “Aali abia, sidi usu ami sugasimo, inolo uleno hano gofo wasulu uleno digifia, miliba labi, aali wakaliyobafe. Aali e kuliba abia, molo eda sugafea ami sugamale. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Ausi, aalihe molo amone enaofea eweguba saamale. ‘Walelohe gafea doba bisigia, Nada ne <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> galiba, Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo amone naiyo naba misiyomone, lalolu amo wagi dobuba doba besabeoba’ saamale. Aali efea auba doba bamale. <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Aufia, ehe aalifea lalolu ana lagi kegeleda sunia madeneba dobia ami, waleyobafe. Aali lalolu ami, nini ua naiyo naba misiyomone madeneba homale.” Auba safasia, Yesuhe aalu malalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ausi, aalu abia, bosolufalumo, kegele sunia Yesuhe aalufea soluguba, sunia moloba samodolu dobi baafia, aaluhe Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo amone naiyo amo ami madenelu.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo asigisia naiyo nolo">Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea boledida wainida namenesi melu</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Madiyu 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maga 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolidi 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Naiyo naiyo fogomo adesi, Yesuda, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> faibili ilida, milibaifia, ailalu naiyoda ufuluiya ami, amaleba ua yoba kakainalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Na aso naga dibale ligia, <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> ewene naiyomo, Na gilidai yaagi ua yoba sigia nabaiyeba, bule koleba hilisefia lolu. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Enebamo, Na gilifea selesu, Na-mo sigilo naiyo ewe saabia no naiyale. Dufia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami ligia, naiyo naiyo amone mau sisa wakaliba sugafia, ililiba samodofea ami, Na saabia no naiyobasu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Auba saaba samodofia, waini hano gaabu wasulu difasia, Godedai henelu sulu saafia, Yesu selesia, “Gaabu wasulu ewe, gili difasia, ule uleba nabaima. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Mau enebamo, Na gilifea selesu, Na <char style="w">waini</char> hano saabia no nabale ligiasu, hilia Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adomo saabi, naiyobasu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Aufia, Ehe <char style="w">boledi</char> difasia, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, Ene walelu faibilifea gogoleba sagasia, selesia, “Ewe Ne domala, Nahe ewe gili sagoba ufiyone mesu. Gilimo Na hilisesia, eweguba molobasu melale.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ili naiyo naba samodofia, Ehe waini hano gaabu wasulu difasia, E mana aubasu mololu. E selesia, “Waini hano gaabu wasulu ewehe, oloba huliale sulu hagaea iminiba ufulu. Na amone wakaliba sugamesisia, Ne ibi sagasu. Ne ibihe gili sagoba ofelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Oloba huliale dabalu">oloba huliale sulu amone dabalu</char> moloyosia, sagasu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sng 41.9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-22">Yon 13.21-22</ref></char></note>Auluso bama, inolo Nada holonoyobafe amo, e Nadai naiyo naiyone ailaiya iwi yoba saabe. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" /><char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char>, Ehe eno samini iminiba ufulu amo kuliba maiyo dobu. Auluso, inolo abehe Inololene Faibeda holonofe amo, efea woba ufiyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Walelu faibili ilihe sulu ewe dofasia, ine geleba doba bebelesia selesia, “Nini aleba abehe eweguba moloyobafebi?” <figure style="fig" alt="The Last Supper" file="IB04149.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="22.14-20">Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea boledida wainida namenesi mefe.</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walelu faibili ili aleba ami, olaibo abe labebisia, ine geleba hegelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Lug 9.46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, walelu faibili ilihe hegesia, ili aleba ami abe koleba olaibo labebisia, ine geleba hegelu. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mad 20.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-45">Mag 10.42-45</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> suniane kinihe, kiwigagafia ine mosomu yasiba ligia, ili hamefegubasu kuliba malesi mololo. Ili wida alefasia, ine mosomu ili sisasu melesi moloba adomo, ili ine meleba saaba sulu selesia, “Sagoba ofolo inolo nafulumo, nini loluba” sodo. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mad 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mag 9.35</ref></char></note>Auluso, gilimo, auba moloba melabiyo. Aubale. Inolo gili aleba ugi, olaibo labe e-mo, siagulu melale. Aufia, inolo gili aleba ugi, guni inolo labe e-mo, dabalu moloba ofologulu melale. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Yon 13.12-15</ref></char></note>Asigima, olaibomo abe? Inolo naiyo naiyone ailalu aniba yoba saabe amo e-la? Me naiyoda madeneyone moloba ofolo amo e-la? Seale, naiyo naiyone ailalu aniba yoba saabe e-mo, olaibo labe. Auluso Na-mo, gili aleba ami, naiyoda madeneyone moloba ofolo inolomo, Na lolu. Gili sagoba ufiyone dabalu moloba ofolo inolomo, Na lolu.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Nada dedeba babiyo fogo holobagagasimo, gilihe Na gadefia abiale, Na galibasu ado inolo, gili labe. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo Ne Nao Ehe Nafea melugubasu, Nahe amo gilifeada meyobasu. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mad 19.28</ref></char></note>Aufia, Na Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amimo, naiyo ufulu ailaiya ami amaleba, Nadai yoba sigia, gili naiyodai hanodai naiyobafe. Aufia, gilihe, asefalu ailalu yogolelu saabia yoba sigia, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu hugulubamo yasiba miliyobafe.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu selesia, Fidahe E faiso meyobafeba saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Madiyu 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maga 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yone 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Aufia, Yesu selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, Saimono, ga nafuluba. Gili aleba ugi asigi ule ufulu kiwigaafia labe abelaba, dedeba babiyone, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenehe</char> fogo waagi memaba solu. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:15">Yon 17.15</ref></char></note>Auluso, Saimono ga doma. Ge <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> gelebaimesiale, Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu solu</char>. Ausi, ga asigi besifia dufia, obegefea ami, ge gelewodali kiwigaaba homale.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Ausi, Fidahe Efea selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, doma! Ga dibolo aasenaga, nada Gadai maiyo. Ga olasenaga, nada Gadai olaeyo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lug 22.56-62</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char>, na gafea seale selesu. Aga nigiliba iwi, haga gogono aso galabale labi, ga koleba Na waaselaba bisigia, Na bolaleba mofebu osoloaba saeyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Lug 9.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10.4</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu Fidafea auba safasia, ehe Ene walelu faibilifea doba bisigia, selesia, “Nahe gili Ne dabalu moloyo hilibaisasimo, gili mole seloda, aluda, emo saligaloda, sebale dedalesi, fogo amimo gili kegele uleno abobosola?” Ili obegeba selesia, abobosaleba solu. <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ausi, E ilifea selesia, “Auluso, aga gahe mole selo alu sebunaga, amo dimale. Aufia, ga alu dobunaga, dimale. Aufia, ga helebesi sebualenaga, ge fagulo selale ogo elegefia, mole amohe helebesi uleno dimale. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Ais 53.12</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, Godene Bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">Idele inolohe E fadilo inolo wolugulu abulu.</char> Mau enebamo, kegele sunia Godene Bugohe moloyobafeba solu amo, Nafea koleba wakaliba sugasia, liliyobafe. Seale, Na saaba sulu selelu dobumo, aga wakaliba sugasia, liliba samodoyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Auba selesi, Ene walelu faibili ili selesia, “Saminilo, nini helebesi aida sebu, ewe bama”. Ausi, E selesia, “Amo isobuba” solu.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Olifi galea daafia ligia, Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Madiyu 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maga 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Aufia, Yesuhe molo ilida asuluiya amo afasia, Olifi galea daalumo, hilia sunia Ene daaba adoguba daalu. Ausi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilimo</char> E galiba dedalelu. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Hele galea ami goafia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Dedeba babiyo gilifea holobagamesialene, gili Godedai sulu saama.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Aufia, Ehe ili gadefia daalumo, hagoaleba aniba hamagi, emo hugulumo sagafia, Godedai sulu selesia, eweguba solu. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Nao, ga hamesenaga, gaabu naga wasulu Nafea dobu ewe, diba damale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaabu naga wasulu diba damaleba selefe amo, Godene kanolo Nafea huga milesialeba selefe. </char></note> Auluso, Na hamefegubale, Ga hamefegubasu molomale.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Auba selesi, hebenefia sulu dia ano uleno E labea holobagafia, E kiwigaaba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yesu E higinilu bule bisigia, Godedai sulu kiwigaaba selesi, ene ibimo, fifilima dudululoguba, hele saabia dudululu. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />E <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saaba</char> samodofia degefia, Ene walelu faibili labea obegeba daalu. Ehe ili haneba gagalifia labi abulu. Maumo, ili bule yagunagasia, si higinisia, haneba gagalifia alolu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />E ilifea selesia, “Gili enesi haneba gagalifia ele? Gili degefia, Godedai sulu saama. Dedeba babiyo gili labea holobagasi, gili gelebailosi saamale.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesu gisane sone saabia seba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Madiyu 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maga 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yone 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu E aso sulu selaba labi, inolo wamili E labea fela milibailu. Walelu faibili huguluba amone uleno, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasaba</char> sodo amo, e saminiba inigia, Yesu mimiyone hagoaleba mulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Auluso, Yesuhe efea doba bisigia selesia, “Yudasa, gahe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> mimife ogohe holonosela?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Yesudai alebailu ilihe, kegele moloyo weiyaafe amo baafia, selesia, “Saminilo, ninihe ili helebesi dufiyobile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ausi, ili ulenohe helebesi difasia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone yasilone</char> <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo faibene</char> koneni inaloalomo geleba dafogolu. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ausi, Yesuhe amo bafasia, selesia, “Hama! Auba molomabu!” Aufia, Yesune sonehe inolo amone koneni gesi, ene alolu aibalu.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Aufia, Yesuhe soba melone guni inolo ilifeada, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yasilo inolo ilifeada, guni inolo ilifeada, Eda seyone milibailu ili suniafea sulu eweguba solu. E selesia, “Gili helebesida, digaluda, sesaifia milibaisego, Na fadilo inolo labebuba hilisefia, Na seyone milibailula? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Hilia sunia Na gili galiba sebele molone yala usu alolu. Auluso, fogo ami gilihe Na sone sesale. Auluso, aga fogo ewe, gine halosibu. Aga fogo ewe Nigili Gagaluhe yasiba labe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fida selesia, e Yesu asigibualeba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Madiyu 26.57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maga 14.53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yone 18.12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.54 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mag 14.53-54</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, ilihe E sefia lubia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone yasilo</char> inolo moloa lubia daalu. Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e, ili faisa faisaba kuliba daalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Aufia, inolo noolohe molo amone yala usu ami, de gamefia yoba kakainabi, Fida eda ili galiba ami yoba asulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Dabalu mololo ido ulenohe Fida de waiya aniba yoba saabi baafia, e si galiba sidafia selesia, “Inolo eweda Yesudai adomobu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Auluso, Fida selesia, “Ido, Aa! Ogo na asigibuale!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Fogo wedino alefasia, inolo noda e baafia, selesia, “Edai alebailo ulenomo, ga-bu.” Ausi, Fida selesia, “Aa! Ogo naale.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Halosi fogo aoa ule amogulu daafia labi, inolo uleno selesia, “Seale faibe ewemo, Edai adobu. Enebamo, e Galili inolo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Auluso, Fida obegeba selesia, “Inolo ga selefe ogo, na hilisebuale koleba!” E aso sulu auba selaba labi, alebale hamagi, gogono galalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:34">Lug 22.34</ref></char></note>Ausi, Saminilo E labea amifia nolofia, Fida e si galiba sidalu. Ausi, Fidahe Saminilo sulu efea solumo hiliseba obegelu. “Aga nigiliba ewe, gogono aso galabale labi, gahe Na bolaleba mofeyobu osoloaba saeyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Auba hilisesia, Fida e baea daafia, yuasia, kudumaneba yeelu. <figure style="fig" alt="Peter denies Jesus" file="IB04158.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="22.55-62">Fida selesia, e Yesu bolaleba solu.</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe baaba gaidesia, Yesu dufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Madiyu 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maga 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Inolo Yesuda yasifia alolu ilihe, E baaba gaidesia dufulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Ilihe fagulo gelelu Ene sia dofafia, eweguba wanelu. “Saaba ofolo ga, inolo gada dufelefe ogo, wi abe? Gene saaba ofa saama!” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Aufia, ilihe Efea sulu wolu wedinale nokene nokeneba gaidaboba solu.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesu galisolo ine si saabia fadaayone degefia melalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Madiyu 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maga 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yone 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Keafa hiliasi, asidalune galisolo inolo ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> ilida, ili galiba gagaiyolu. Aufia, ilihe Yesu lubia abia, ine galisolone olegia yoba melalu. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:12">Yon 3.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, ili selesia, “Inolo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisoba</char> solumo Ga-la, ninifea saaba mema.” Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Na gilifea sealeba selesenaga, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyobafale</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Aufia, Nahe gilifea sulu noolo wanesenaga, amo gilihe Nafea sulu obegeba saeyobafale. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:56">HD 7.56</ref></char></note>Auluso, aga amifia, <char style="qt"><char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> E-mo Gode kiwigagaluda Ene sone lilibefealo ami yoba misiyobafe.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Auba selesi, ili sunia doba bisigia selesia, “Amo seale koleba, Ga Godene Faibela?” Ausi, Ehe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gilihe gine Na-ba selefe ogo, amo isoba selefe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ausi, ili selesia, “E seale mololubusia fadaayone sulu no male koleba. Enebamo, Ene mofeo alefasia solumo nini dubulu.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane muguli selesia, inolo uleno ene e Gode waagulu loluba selesenaga, inolo amo dufa olaeyo dobuba sodobiyo. (Kis 20.2-3; Wkp 24.16)</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesumo Filadusune si saabia godolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Madiyu 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maga 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yone 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Aufia, guni inolo ili sunia degefia, Yesu <char style="w">Filadusu</char> labea lubia daalu. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Ami goafia, ilihe E fadaasia oloba koweyo maugasia selesia, “Nini bisigia, inolo ewe nine mosomune manamo elawaneba ofeleso. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisafea</char> dagese mole meyomo, Ehe memabiyoba kaaso. Aufia, E ene meleba saaba selesia, Na <char style="w">Keliso</char> ligia, kini ulenomo Na-ba seleso.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Ili auba selefe dofasia, Filadusuhe Yesufea wanesia, “Ga <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> kinila?” Auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Sulu amo gene ga selefe waaga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Ausi, Filadusuhe <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilifeada, idele inolo wamili ilifeada, selesia, “Fadaayone sulu uleno, E heleba mololu, na bosoluale.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Auluso, ilihe kiwigagaba eweguba solu, “Inolo ogohe Yudia hele sunia ami siba ligia, idele inolone libo degeba waaleso. Galili disiligi ami maugafia, walelabia inigia, aga Yudia iwida goafia, auba molobasu labeo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesumo Helodone si saabia godolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> sulu amo dofasia, ilifea eweguba doba abulu, “Inolo ewe Galili inolola?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:1">Lug 3.1</ref></char></note>Ilihe Yesumo hele <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodo</char> yasibufealo amolo muluba selesi, Filadusuhe Yesu Helodo labea malalu. Fogo amoyamohe, Helodo eda Yelusalame ami alolu.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ausi, Helodohe Yesu baafia, e bule henelu. Maumo, fogo selale Helodohe Yesu babaiyeba hiliseba alolu. Yesu molofeba solumo dofasia, E <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> uleno molomesi, e babiyo hamelu. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Aulugulu, Yesumo eda labea hilibaifia labi, ehe Efea wedinale doba abulu. Auluso, Yesuhe efea sulu ulenoda obegeba soluale. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolo</char> inolo ilida, hagoaleba milibaifasia, Efea sulu oloba koweba selesia, kiwigaaba egedidilu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Aufia, Helododa, ene yobolo inoloda, ilihe Yesufea woba selesia, Efea baaba galiba solu. Aufia, ilihe fagulo yogolelu uleno difasia, Efea kaaba ofasia, E-mo Filadusu labea obegeba malesi hilibailu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Saminimo, Helodo e-mo, Filadusudai gisa ado. Auluso, aga fogo ewemo, aalu damene adefe. <figure style="fig" alt="Herod questions Jesus" file="IB04162.TIF" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="23.6-12">Helodohe Yesufea wanefe.</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filadusuhe Yesumo imolane uluba homaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Madiyu 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maga 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:38-19:16">Yone 18.38–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, guni inolo noolo ilida, idele inolo ilida, e labea weba gagaiyolu. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Aufia, ehe ilifea selesia, “Inolo ogo gilihe gasiba dibia, ulubia inigia, ne olegia yoba melalu. Aufia, gili selesia, Ehe idele inolone mana elawaneba ofelesia, ili degeba waalesoba solu. Gili auba selesi, nahe gine si saabia, kegele amone Efea fadaasia wanelu. Aulugulu doma, nahe inolo ewefea heleba mololune fadaayo uleno bosoluale. Kegele gili inolo ogofea, mololusia oloba koweba selefe amo, na sealebuba bosoluale. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodo</char> eda hilise ule aubasu ofasia, ehe inolo amo nini labea obegeba malasomo, gili besela? Doma, godosia dufa olamaba saeyonemo, kegele uleno inolo ewehe mololualebu. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16-17" />Aulugulu, nahe E naga mefia, sububa dafogoyo.” Enebamo, henesia sigilo hilia adesi, Filadusuhe dibolo dafalibagolu inolo uleno sububa dafogoyo dobu.<verse eid="LUK 23:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ausi, idele inolo suniahe wuaaba selesia, “Hama! Inolo ogo, diba dama-aaa! Balabasa ogo, sububa dafogofia ninifea mema-aaa!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balabasa e-mo dibolo dafogolu alolu maumo, ehe sidi amone gamanedai belagusia, inolo uleno dufa olalu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Filadusuhe Yesu sububa dafogoyo hamesia, ehe ilifea sulu saabia saeyo weiyaalu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Auluso, ili wuaaba selabasu ligia, selesia, “Ogo duma-aaa! E <char style="w">imolane</char> luba homa-aaa!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Ausi, saabia osolo ehe ilifea selesia, “Mau amene? E heleba amene mololubiyo? Osolasia dufa olamaba saeyonemo, kegele uleno inolo ewefea, na bosoluale. Aulugulu, nahe E naga mefia, sububa dafogoyobasu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Auluso, ilihe Filadusufea koleba wuaaba selaba yaasia, selesia, “Ogo imolane luba homa-aaaba” solu. Ili wuaalumohe Filadusune sulu solumo dufa dafogolu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ausi, Filadusuhe ine sulu kuliba abia selesia, Yesu dufa olamaba solu. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Aufia, ehe ine hame kuliba abia, inolo gamanedai belagusia, inoloda dufa olalumone dibolo dafogolu amo sububa dafogolu. Auluso, Yesumo, ehe ine hame kuliba abia dufa olamesi, yobolo inolone sone saabia ufulu.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesu imolane luba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Madiyu 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maga 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yone 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Yobolo inolo ilihe Yesu gasiba dibia abia, Yelusalame sidi amone baea holobagasia, Salini inolo uleno, ene wi Saimono, sidi usu suga miyofia miliba labi, wakalisia selu. Aufia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Imolane">imolanemo</char>, ene kilele saabia diba ofelesia, efea selesia, gahe amo digifia, Yesu kuliba malaba solu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ausi, idele inolo wamili wedinale E kuliba aasi, idele wedinale E saaba suliiba yegililabia dedalelu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Auluso, Yesu E nolofia, ilifea selesia, “Yelusalamene elewelidali gili, Na saabia yegilimabu. Gine meleba hilisesiada, gine faibe hilisesiada, yegilima. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:23">Lug 21.23</ref></char></note>Doma, dufiamo, eweguba saeyo hilia holobagaeyobafe. ‘Idele saune alebaibu ili amoda, idele ela molo faibeda aselale alebaibu ili amoda, aufia idele faibeda bu melale alebaibu ili amoda, ili heneyo dobu.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">MUU 6.16</ref></char></note>Fogo amoyamo, <char style="qt">idele inolo ilihe hele galefea eweguba saeyobafe. ‘Gili olabofia, nini saabia gasiaguma.</char>’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Enebamo, inolo ilihe iwalu aso imololu labi, mana ewe molosenaga, amo i bausolu amofea mana eneba moloyobafe?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Yobolo inolo ilihe inoloda dufa olalo inolo aida amoda gasiba dibia, Yesu galiba dufa olaeyone lubia mulu.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Aufia, ili abia, hele Guni Kiwiba soiya ami goafia, hele amimo ilihe Yesu <char style="w">imolane</char> luba ufulu. Aufia, ilihe inoloda dufa olalo aidamo, nomo Ene sone inaloalofealo, nomo Ene sone fofonaloalofealoba, imolane luba waalelu. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sng 22.18</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Nao, wolu ili molofemo, Gahe <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galima</char>. Ili molofe amo ine hilisebale molofe.” Ausi, yobolo inolo ilihe, Yesune fagulo dugulumo, osolasia abehe fagulo hala difelaba babiyone sadu dailu.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7-8">Sng 22.7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolohe Yesufea molofe amone babiyone sidafia yoba alebailu. Aufia, guni inolo ilihe Yesufea eweguba baaba galiba solu. “Gahe inolo noolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulugulu</char> Keliso, Ga koleba, Gode molobebelelumo seale, Ga labenaga, aga Ga gene meleba gasiba dafelagoba dima!” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sng 69.21</ref></char></note>Yobolo inolo ilida, E baaba galiba solu. Aufia, ilihe waini hano bese gililo Efea namenesi melu. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Aufia, ili selesia, “Ga seale <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> kininaga, amo Ga Gene meleba gasiba dafelagoba dima!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Enebamo, ilihe sowi uleno selefia, imolane amofea Yesune guni saabia uluba ufulu. Sulu amo eweguba selelu, <char style="sc">Inolo ewe Yudane Kini</char>.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Inoloda dufa olalo Yesudai luba ufulu aida amone, ulenomohe, Yesu gaidabosia eweguba saaba dafogolu. “Ga seale Keliso labela? Ausenaga, Ga Gene meleba sagoba ofelesia, anida gasiba dafelagoba dima.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40-41" />Auluso, inolo no amohe solu dofasia, e isosia, efea kiwigaaba gadiba eweguba solu. “Inolo ewe heleba daalu ulenoda male labe ogohe, gada naga hamaga imini ule dife. Animo, anine wolu mololumone sabe naga aga disumo, isoba disu. Aulugulu, ga aso Gode baaba sagilifalela?” <verse eid="LUK 23:40-41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Aufia, e selesia, “Yesu, Ga kini aselesiamo, na hilisemale.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Ausi, Yesu efea selesia, “Na seale koleba gafea selesu, aga ga Nadai hele nafuluiya Faladaisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele idele inolo ili selesia, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Faladaisi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo hele nafuluiya Idene geiyaguluba sodo. Idele inolo nafulu olasimo ami maiyobafeba hiliselo. </char></note> ami miliyobafe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu olalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Madiyu 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maga 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yone 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Halo dogo adesi, nigili gagaluhe helefealu sunia gasiagufiasu ligia, halosi osolo geide elolu. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:19-20">Hib 6.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, fogo amimo halo neeyomo kaafiasu alolu. Auba ausi, fagulo bule sebele moloa goloba helelumo, sunia aidaba gagalaba dafulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Sng 31.5</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe koleba eweguba wuaalu, “Nao-ooo! <char style="qt">Na Ne asubanemo Ge sone saabia ofelesu.</char>” Sulu auba saafia, E hame suluba dafelesia, olalu.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Yobolone yasilomohe kegele amo molofe baafia, ehe Godene wi digiba solu. Aufia, e selesia, “Seale, inolo ewe <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> koleba alolubu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Aufia, idele inolo sunia molofe amo babiyone gagaiyolu ili amohe kegele molofemo abulu. Ausi, molofemo ili baaba samodofia, ine faga dowesia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele ili </char><char style="fq" closed="false">faga dowesenaga</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, ili yuafesia aufe, me yagu nagafesia aufe.</char></note> ine moloa obegeba dedalelu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Auluso, Yesu ene damenedalida, idele Yesuda Galili amifia kuliba milibailumo ilida, ili wedino hago alebaifia ligia, kegele amo molofemo sunia abulu. <figure style="fig" alt="Cross and darkness" file="IB04166.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="23.44-49">Yesu imolane olalu.</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesune domalamo abane dana usu diba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Madiyu 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maga 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yone 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Inolo uleno alolumo, ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[4]], Alimadia dauno inolo alolu ">Yosebe</char>. E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> dauno uleno Alimadia amone inolo. E inolo nafulu ligia, <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> ado. Yudane galisolo inolo ulenomo, e. Auluso, galisolo ili noolohe Yesu godoyone daiyasi, e eefia kuliba daaluale. Ili mololu amo e heneluale. Ehe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo holobagamesifia, yasifia alolu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yosebe ewe <char style="w">Filadusu</char> labea daafia, Yesune domalamo e waagi diyobileba doba abulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Filadusuhe eesi, ehe Yesune domalamo imolane uluba ufulumo diba difasia, fagulo hoolu masolu. Aufia, domala masolu amo dibia abia, olaluda aso ofolale dana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele idele inolohe olalu domala ufiyone abane kaleba nagelelo. Aufasia, ilihe abane bule ule balele amalelu amo bebelolabia abia, eno saliba kaaba ofolo.</char></note> hili, abane nageleiya ami baliba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Yesuda olalu hilia ewe, Sabadane Sigilo Madeneyo Hilia alolu. Ausi, Ene domalada baliba ofalaba labe fogo ami, <char style="w" lemma="Sabada hilia">Sabada hiliamo</char> maugaeyo weiyaalu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane mana kuliba abia, halo uluba sesimo, hilia hili maugalo. Aulune, hilia Bi amimo, halo uluba sesimo, hilia Kaabe, Sabada Halemane Ado hilia maugafe. Sabada hiliamo, Yuda ili sulu muguli elo ufulu kuliba abia, dabalu mololale.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Idele, Galilifia Yesuda kuliba milibailu ili amo, Yosebe kuliba abia, dana amo abulu. Yosebehe Yesune domala ami baliba ofelefemo ili abulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kis 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Lo 5.14</ref></char></note>Idele ilihe amo bafasia, abia, ine moloa obegeba dedalefia, ilihe kasine kolelu nooloda, walea kasineda, kegele nooloda, Yesune domalafea ufiyone madenelu. Ausi, adigi keafa, Sabada hilia alolugulu, ili hilia amone muguli elo ufuluguba kuliba abia, dabalu ulenoda molobale, halemane asulu.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu haiba degelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Madiyu 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maga 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yone 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Sabada hilia amone faisa, hilia agele maugasi, keafa nigilibale koleba, idele ilihe kegele kasineda nafulu madeneba sesaifia, ili dana Yesuda ufuluiya ami dedalelu. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Ami goasia, bosolufalumo, abane dana amone enoda kaaba dafulumo, sogoba ofelesia, bebeloba dafulu dobi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Ili dana usu suga dedalesia, bosolufalumo, ilihe <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesune domalamo ami dobi abuluale. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ili amone keleba hiliseba alebaifia ligia, bosolufalumo, alebale hamagi, inolo aida, fagulo elalelu, si dabeleyodolu, kaalumo, ili aniba kalugaasi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Ausi, idele ili amo sagilisia, guni helea sauba fufunalolu. Auluso, inolo aida amohe ilifea eweguba solu, “Idele gilihe, inolo Bebeada Labemo, daneluda ofola ami dobulaba isase ogo, mau enesi isase? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9.22</ref></char></note>E iwi male, E degefia daalu. E aso gilidai Galili ligia, sulu solumone, gili hiliseba obegema. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Ehe gilifea eweguba solu. Ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolone sone saabia ofelesi, ilihe E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufiyobafe. Aufia, hilia osolohe, E haiba degeyobafe solu.” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Inolo aidamohe idelefea auba selesi, ilihe E solumo hiliseba obegelu.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Ausi, balilu danamo gadefia, obegeba dedalefia, ilihe walelu faibili kileleba amofeada, noolo ilidai alebailu suniafeada, kegele ili abulu amo sunia awaba melu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Idele ili amone wimo ewe. Magadala <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Maliada</char>, aufia Yoanada, aufia Malia, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesene</char> enaeda, aufia idele nooloda, ilidai alolu. Ili amohe <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu inolofea</char> sulu amo awaba melu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Auluso, ili hilisesia, idele ilihe sulu balu selefebuba hilisefia, ine sulu sigiba dubuluale. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e degefia, balilu dana dobia ami naguba daalu. Aufia, e goafia, dana usu babiyosia, waaba ilogofia, bosolufalumo, fagulo balusu dobi abulu. Aufia, e moloa obegeba daafia, kegele abulu amone, ene mololubisia, ene meleba keleba hiliselu. <figure style="fig" alt="Peter in empty tomb" file="IB04170.TIF" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="24.9-12">Fidahe fagulo balusu dobi besabe.</figure><verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuliba silo aidahe Yesumo Emease eno aiba ami wakalilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maga 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Hilia hamagaiyamo, Yesune kuliba silo aidamo mosomu Emeaseba soda ami maiyo daalu. Mosomu amo Yelusalamedai hagoale dobu. Amimo, halosi fogo aoa aida amogulu ano. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Aalu daaba ligia, kegele Yesufea mololu amone selabia daaba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Aalu sulu ewene wedinale nenelabia daaba labi, Yesu Ene E aalu daaba labea holobagafia, aaludai daaba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Auluso, aine si hagufia labi, aalu Yesu eloba abuluale.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ausi, Ehe aalufea doba bisigia selesia, “Aali nenelabia daaba elego, amene selese?” Ehe auba selesi dofasia, aalu daaba alolumone kalugaasi, aine olegimo, yagunagalu koleba abulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Aida amone, none wimo Kiliofase. Ehe Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “Eneba? Yelusalame ami, kegele amo hilia fogo ewe holobagasi abuluale inolomo, ule ga gelebisula?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />E auba selesi, Yesu aalufea doba bisigia selesia, “Amene kegele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Auba selesi, aaluhe Efea obegeba selesia, “Anihe kegele Nasalede inolo Yesufea mololumone selesu. E-mo <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo uleno alolu. Ehe Godene si saabiada, idele inolone si saabiada, dabalu kiwigaaba molosia, sulu kiwida sodo. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ausi, nine <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> nooloda, aufia guni inolo nooloda, ilihe E sefia, gamane E dufa olamesifia, ine sone saabia ufulu. Gamanehe E dufa olaeyoba sulu ule ofelesi, ilihe E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ofeleso. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:11">Lug 19.11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6">HD 1.6</ref></char></note>Saminimo, nini eweguba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia yasifia</char> alolu. Inolo Yesu E-mo, Gode alefasia <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo gisane sone amofeafia sububa dafelagosia, obegeba diyone iminiba ufulumo, E-buba hilisefia alolu. Auluso, ilihe E dufa olalumo, aga hilia osolo adefe. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Aufia, aga kegele noda gegoaba mololu. Agamo, nine mosomu idele noolohe nini elawaneba ufulu. Keafale koleba ili dana dobia ami daaluso, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Yesune domalamo ami male abulu. Aufia, ili obegeba milibaifasia, ilihe <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> aidamo, halaga bologuba abuluba seleso. Sulu dia ano aida amohe, Yesumo bebea labeba soluso. Idele ilihe ninifea auba awaso. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:3-10">Yon 20.3-10</ref></char></note>Ausi, nini noolo dana dobia ami dedalefia, idele soluguba dobi abulu. Auluso, Yesumo ilihe abuluale.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ausi, Yesuhe aalufea selesia, “Gili asigida male alefasia, sulu sunia saaba ofolo ili solumo, alebale asigiba dulualebu. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9.22</ref></char></note>Eneba labe? Maugabamo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> E-mo naga diyodolu alolu. Naga amo difasia ligiamo, E Godene <char style="w">elalelu</char> wabialeba ada ami sugaeyobafe. E ami sugaeyonemo, eno no male alolu. Saaba ofolo ilihe auba moloyobafemone sulu saaba ufulubiyo. Gili amo asigibualela?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1-21">Sng 22.1-21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53">Ais 53</ref></char></note>Aufia, Yesuhe aalufea sulu <char style="w">Mosese</char> soiya amifia, maugafia abia, saaba ofolo sulu sunia selelu amone walesiamo, Godene bugohe Ene E saaba sulu selelu dobu amo sunia, aalufea sawaba waleba samodolu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ili daaba labeofasia, mosomu aaluda maiyone aafea ami goasia, Yesumo hago maiyone anoguba aso daaba alolu. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Auluso, aaluhe E kaasia selesia, “Ga anidai yagi mela. Aga halo hugasia, nigiliyo hagoalefe.” Ausi, E aaludai moloa suga daafia, ami asulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />E aaludai ailalu aniba naiyo naiyone yoba aseba ilogosia, Ehe <char style="w">boledi</char> difasia, Godedai henelu sulu safasia, amo gogolefia, aalufea melu. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ausi, aine si hagulumo fisigaba ofelesi, aalu E eloba besabi, alebale hamagi E babiyodoluale adesi, aaluhe E saabia no abuluale. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Ausi, aaluhe aine geleba eweguba solu, “Seale koleba, ani eno aiba miliba labimo, Ehe anifea sulu selesia, Godene bugo selelu dobu amone sawaba walesi, anine asigi koleba henesia, libo degeba ofeleso. Auba mololumo koleba!”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Aalu auba saafia, alebale hamagi degefia, Yelusalame obegeba maiyo daalu. Aufia, aalu ami goafia, walelu faibili kilelebamoda, ine damenedali nooloda, ilidai gagaiyofia labi abulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:4-5">1Kld 15.4-5</ref></char></note>Ausi, bosolufalumo, ilihe aalufea selesia, “Saminilo degefia labe. Amo seale koleba. E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> labea holobagalu.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ausi, aaluhe ilifea awaba mesia, kegele sunia eno aiba ami aalufea mololumo, awaba melu. Aufia, aalu selesia, “Ehe boledi gogolesi, anihe E ami eloba abulu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Ene walelu faibili labea holobagalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Madiyu 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maga 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yone 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ili amone aso selaba labi, bosolufalumo, Yesu Ene E ili aleba hamagi holobagafia yoba ligia, ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">Aealo</char> gilidai miliyobafe.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:26">Mad 14.26</ref></char></note>Auluso, ili hidigiba asigisia, gesami besabebilesia, sagiliba yaalu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gili enesi sagilisia, keleba hiliseba yaase? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Gilihe Ne soneda, Ne emoda, bama. Ewe Na lolu. Ne domala ewe gine sone gesia, bama. Gesami ilimo huuda, kiwida, badoda, male koleba. Auluso, Na-mo badoda, huuda, kiwida lolu ewe, gili geba bama. Na gesamiale.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />E auba saafia, Ene sonedai, emodai, ilifea walelu. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Ausi, ili momoleba bisigia, henesia, aso sigidubuluale labi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gilihe naiyo noolo naiyone iwi dobula?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Ausi, ilihe hani subulu haisi no difasia, Efea namenesi melu. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />E amo difasia, ine si saabia mololu.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Na gilidai aso ligiamo, Na gilifea eweguba solu. ‘Sulu sunia samini Na saaba ufulumo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> <char style="w">muguli</char> bugoda, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> bugoda, gasa bugoda, bugo amo sunia seleba ufulumo, kegele amo sunia wakaliba sugasia, ililiba ufiyodolu dobu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Auba safasia, ili Godene bugo selelu dobumo fadaba asigimesifia, Ehe ine asigi kaalumo sogoba ufulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ehe ilifea selesia, “Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu. Keliso, E naga difasia, hilia osolomo E olaiya amifia haiba degeyobafe. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Aufia, Godene sulu mana idele inolo mosomu suniafea eweguba walemale. Idele inolo ine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisi</char>, Godehe Kelisone wifea alefasia, ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> hamasia, heesia galiba yaeyobafe. Gili koleba auba saeyone, Yelusalame ami maugafia, mosomu sunia kakainabia ami walelabia malale. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:27">Yon 15.27</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:8">HD 1.8</ref></char></note>Aufia, kegele sunia iwi molosi, gine si abulumo, gilihe saaba sigimale. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:16">Yon 14.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:26">15.26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:4">HD 1.4</ref></char></note>Doma. Ne Naohe oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulugulu, Nahe Asubane Noekenemo gili labea hilibaiyobasu. Amomo, hagoale adefe. Auluso, ana lagone kiwigagalu ewe gilifea aso suga milibale labi, gili sidi yaagi yasifia melale.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hebene aleba lagolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maga 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-12">Hilibaisi Daalu 1.9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Aufia, Yesuhe walelu faibili ilimo lubia abia, Bedani mosomia daalu. Aufia, Ehe Ene sone digifia, Godehe ili <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba</char> homesi solu. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ehe ili auba ediliba ofolaba ligia, Godehe E <char style="w">hebene</char> diba lagosi, E ili afolu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Aufia, ili sauba hanefia, Efea gulugululu. Aufia, ili nokene heneba yaafia, Yelusalame obegeba dedalelu. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Aufia, ili hilia sunia, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele moloa</char> kakainasia, Godene wi digiba selabasu alolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:53">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="End of Book OnobasuluNarrativeGreen.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="24.53" /><verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>